135	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "1", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Easy"}, "faq": [{"answer": "- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\r\\n\\r\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\r\\n\\r\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.", "question": "1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?"}, {"answer": "All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.", "question": "2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?"}, {"answer": "Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.", "question": "3. How to find & book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?"}, {"answer": "Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.", "question": "4. How is the weather like in Nepal?"}, {"answer": "Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\r\\n\\r\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\r\\n\\r\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\r\\n\\r\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.", "question": "5. What to expect on tours?"}], "meta": {"_edit_last": "5", "_edit_lock": "1706867077:5", "_dp_original": "510", "_thumbnail_id": "830", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "1", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Mountain Flight with view of Mt Everest", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "44", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Mountain Flight with view of Mt Everest offers awesome views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang extending towards Gaurishankar to Everest.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Easy", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest", "tags": [], "title": "Mountain Flight with view of Mt Everest", "duration": "1 Day", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "<h3>Mountain Flight with View of Mt Everest</h3>\\r\\nWhile in Kathmandu never to be missed for the overwhelming sweeping flight of an hour mountain flight. if you are not trekking but still have dreams of seeing <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\">Everest</a> and other high Himalayan peaks, this is an opportunity for a lifetime experience.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting very early in the morning with a drive to the domestic airport of Kathmandu and then using various local domestic airlines the popular ones for Mountain Flights are Buddha Air, Yeti Airlines, Tara Air, Goma, and Simrik Air on a window seating so that one can view unparalleled views array of snow-capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis wonderful breathtaking flight offers views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang &amp; Jugal Himal extending towards <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaurishankar\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Gaurishankar</a>, Melung Tse, Numbur, and Cho-Oyu with towering Mt. Everest at a near distance from the plane and views of Mt. Makalu and Kanchenjunga towards the further eastern horizon.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a mind-blowing experience during an hour-long flight, return to the hotel and feel this wonderful mountain flight.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuring Nice weather flights start in the early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking a flight in the winter period. In monsoons Mountains may not be visibility due to high clouds. but never know some cloud moves fast and mountains get very clear so wait for the best timings."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Mountain flight", "richText": "6:00 AM - Hotel to Domestic Airport\\r\\n6:30 AM - It's boarding time inside Airport\\r\\n7:00 AM - Flight to see Mt. Everest with most of other mountains\\r\\n8:00 AM - Return Kathmandu Airport after flyover tour from Everest region.\\r\\n8:30 AM - Return your hotel.\\r\\n\\r\\nNote: All are estimated time, during nice weather flight stars in early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking flight in winter/monson period. Due to the weather, airlines company decide the time to fly, if not clear weather they will cancel flight with full refund.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-flight-by-Turkish-people-1.jpg", "title": "mountain-flight-by-Turkish-people", "altText": "mountain-flight-by-Turkish-people", "caption": "mountain-flight-by-Turkish-people", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["830", "829", "828", "827"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "ws_trip_faqs_lists": 5, "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists": "field_63ede38e351c7", "ws_block_attractions": "View unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.", "ws_block_best_season": "Any Season", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "1", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "What's included?", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-light", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": " Overview ", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc6695edb31", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_block_video_widgets": "field_63eef38026ee6", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "", "ws_trip_galleries_title": "Photo/Visual Gallery", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "_ws_trip_galleries_title": "field_63ec89128acaa", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>View unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "ws_trip_information_list": 2, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec90a574f02", "starter_kit_section_title": "Day by Day Activities", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "ws_trip_faqs_section_title": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "_ws_trip_faqs_section_title": "field_63ede33e5b304", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Mountain flight ticket.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Driver Allowance, food, fuel, vehicle tax.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>English speaking tour guide.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drinking Water.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<h3>Mountain Flight with View of Mt Everest</h3>\\r\\nWhile in Kathmandu never to be missed for the overwhelming sweeping flight of an hour mountain flight. if you are not trekking but still have dreams of seeing <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\">Everest</a> and other high Himalayan peaks, this is an opportunity for a lifetime experience.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting very early in the morning with a drive to the domestic airport of Kathmandu and then using various local domestic airlines the popular ones for Mountain Flights are Buddha Air, Yeti Airlines, Tara Air, Goma, and Simrik Air on a window seating so that one can view unparalleled views array of snow-capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis wonderful breathtaking flight offers views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang &amp; Jugal Himal extending towards <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaurishankar\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Gaurishankar</a>, Melung Tse, Numbur, and Cho-Oyu with towering Mt. Everest at a near distance from the plane and views of Mt. Makalu and Kanchenjunga towards the further eastern horizon.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a mind-blowing experience during an hour-long flight, return to the hotel and feel this wonderful mountain flight.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuring Nice weather flights start in the early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking a flight in the winter period. In monsoons Mountains may not be visibility due to high clouds. but never know some cloud moves fast and mountains get very clear so wait for the best timings.", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "Flyover wonderful breathtaking flight with views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Mt. Langtang, Chooyu, Lhotse, Nuptse with towering Mount Everest ", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title": "1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title": "2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title": "3. How to find & book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title": "4. How is the weather like in Nepal?", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title": "5. What to expect on tours?", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title": "field_63ede3af351c8", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title": "field_63ede3af351c8", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title": "field_63ede3af351c8", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title": "field_63ede3af351c8", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title": "field_63ede3af351c8", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description": "- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\r\\n\\r\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\r\\n\\r\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description": "All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description": "Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description": "Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.", "ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description": "Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\r\\n\\r\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\r\\n\\r\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\r\\n\\r\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description": "field_63ede3bf351c9", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description": "field_63ede3bf351c9", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description": "field_63ede3bf351c9", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description": "field_63ede3bf351c9", "_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description": "field_63ede3bf351c9", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "field_63ec96f1878e1", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel": "", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title": "Mountain flight ", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "Extended Tours", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title": "Alternate Tours", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "field_63ec91180462f", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title": "field_63ec91180462f", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "6:00 AM - Hotel to Domestic Airport\\r\\n6:30 AM - It's boarding time inside Airport\\r\\n7:00 AM - Flight to see Mt. Everest with most of other mountains\\r\\n8:00 AM - Return Kathmandu Airport after flyover tour from Everest region.\\r\\n8:30 AM - Return your hotel.\\r\\n\\r\\nNote: All are estimated time, during nice weather flight stars in early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking flight in winter/monson period. Due to the weather, airlines company decide the time to fly, if not clear weather they will cancel flight with full refund.", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour - 2 days</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Mountain Flight with view of Mt Everest | Everest Vacation", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Flyover wonderful breathtaking flight with views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Mt. Langtang, Chooyu, Lhotse, Nuptse with towering Mount Everest \\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eView unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"View unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\" Overview \\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eMountain Flight with View of Mt Everest\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nWhile in Kathmandu never to be missed for the overwhelming sweeping flight of an hour mountain flight. if you are not trekking but still have dreams of seeing \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eEverest\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e and other high Himalayan peaks, this is an opportunity for a lifetime experience.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nStarting very early in the morning with a drive to the domestic airport of Kathmandu and then using various local domestic airlines the popular ones for Mountain Flights are Buddha Air, Yeti Airlines, Tara Air, Goma, and Simrik Air on a window seating so that one can view unparalleled views array of snow-capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThis wonderful breathtaking flight offers views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang \\\\u0026amp; Jugal Himal extending towards \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaurishankar\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eGaurishankar\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, Melung Tse, Numbur, and Cho-Oyu with towering Mt. Everest at a near distance from the plane and views of Mt. Makalu and Kanchenjunga towards the further eastern horizon.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a mind-blowing experience during an hour-long flight, return to the hotel and feel this wonderful mountain flight.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nDuring Nice weather flights start in the early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking a flight in the winter period. In monsoons Mountains may not be visibility due to high clouds. but never know some cloud moves fast and mountains get very clear so wait for the best timings.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"830\\",\\"829\\",\\"828\\",\\"827\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Mountain flight \\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"6:00 AM - Hotel to Domestic Airport\\\\r\\\\n6:30 AM - It's boarding time inside Airport\\\\r\\\\n7:00 AM - Flight to see Mt. Everest with most of other mountains\\\\r\\\\n8:00 AM - Return Kathmandu Airport after flyover tour from Everest region.\\\\r\\\\n8:30 AM - Return your hotel.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNote: All are estimated time, during nice weather flight stars in early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking flight in winter/monson period. Due to the weather, airlines company decide the time to fly, if not clear weather they will cancel flight with full refund.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMountain flight ticket.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDriver Allowance, food, fuel, vehicle tax.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking tour guide.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking Water.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ede33e5764a\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_641162e6b5849\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"field_63ede33e5b304\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"3. How to find \\\\u0026 book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"4. How is the weather like in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"5. What to expect on tours?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":5,\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":\\"field_63ede38e351c7\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour - 2 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"Alternate Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu \\\\u0026amp; Pokhara\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":2,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "descriptions": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Flyover wonderful breathtaking flight with views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Mt. Langtang, Chooyu, Lhotse, Nuptse with towering Mount Everest \\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eView unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"View unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\" Overview \\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eMountain Flight with View of Mt Everest\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nWhile in Kathmandu never to be missed for the overwhelming sweeping flight of an hour mountain flight. if you are not trekking but still have dreams of seeing \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eEverest\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e and other high Himalayan peaks, this is an opportunity for a lifetime experience.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nStarting very early in the morning with a drive to the domestic airport of Kathmandu and then using various local domestic airlines the popular ones for Mountain Flights are Buddha Air, Yeti Airlines, Tara Air, Goma, and Simrik Air on a window seating so that one can view unparalleled views array of snow-capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThis wonderful breathtaking flight offers views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang \\\\u0026amp; Jugal Himal extending towards \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaurishankar\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eGaurishankar\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, Melung Tse, Numbur, and Cho-Oyu with towering Mt. Everest at a near distance from the plane and views of Mt. Makalu and Kanchenjunga towards the further eastern horizon.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a mind-blowing experience during an hour-long flight, return to the hotel and feel this wonderful mountain flight.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nDuring Nice weather flights start in the early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking a flight in the winter period. In monsoons Mountains may not be visibility due to high clouds. but never know some cloud moves fast and mountains get very clear so wait for the best timings.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"830\\",\\"829\\",\\"828\\",\\"827\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Mountain flight \\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"6:00 AM - Hotel to Domestic Airport\\\\r\\\\n6:30 AM - It's boarding time inside Airport\\\\r\\\\n7:00 AM - Flight to see Mt. Everest with most of other mountains\\\\r\\\\n8:00 AM - Return Kathmandu Airport after flyover tour from Everest region.\\\\r\\\\n8:30 AM - Return your hotel.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNote: All are estimated time, during nice weather flight stars in early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking flight in winter/monson period. Due to the weather, airlines company decide the time to fly, if not clear weather they will cancel flight with full refund.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMountain flight ticket.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDriver Allowance, food, fuel, vehicle tax.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking tour guide.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking Water.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ede33e5764a\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_641162e6b5849\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"field_63ede33e5b304\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"3. How to find \\\\u0026 book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"4. How is the weather like in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"5. What to expect on tours?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":5,\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":\\"field_63ede38e351c7\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour - 2 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"Alternate Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu \\\\u0026amp; Pokhara\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":2,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-flight-by-Turkish-people-1.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-fight-everest-experience.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/views-of-sherpa-village-from-plane.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-views-on-the-way-to-mt.-everest.jpg"], "importSource": {"guid": "http://localhost/netra/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=538", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "538", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-01 08:00:59", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-01 08:00:59", "post_modified": "2024-02-02 09:44:35", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-02-02 09:44:35"}}, "customSections": [{"id": 1, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Extended Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour - 2 days</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour - 2 days</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": 2, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Alternate Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["<h3>Mountain Flight with View of Mt Everest</h3>\\r\\nWhile in Kathmandu never to be missed for the overwhelming sweeping flight of an hour mountain flight. if you are not trekking but still have dreams of seeing <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\">Everest</a> and other high Himalayan peaks, this is an opportunity for a lifetime experience.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting very early in the morning with a drive to the domestic airport of Kathmandu and then using various local domestic airlines the popular ones for Mountain Flights are Buddha Air, Yeti Airlines, Tara Air, Goma, and Simrik Air on a window seating so that one can view unparalleled views array of snow-capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis wonderful breathtaking flight offers views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang &amp; Jugal Himal extending towards <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaurishankar\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Gaurishankar</a>, Melung Tse, Numbur, and Cho-Oyu with towering Mt. Everest at a near distance from the plane and views of Mt. Makalu and Kanchenjunga towards the further eastern horizon.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a mind-blowing experience during an hour-long flight, return to the hotel and feel this wonderful mountain flight.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuring Nice weather flights start in the early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking a flight in the winter period. In monsoons Mountains may not be visibility due to high clouds. but never know some cloud moves fast and mountains get very clear so wait for the best timings."], "description": "<h3>Mountain Flight with View of Mt Everest</h3>\\r\\nWhile in Kathmandu never to be missed for the overwhelming sweeping flight of an hour mountain flight. if you are not trekking but still have dreams of seeing <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\">Everest</a> and other high Himalayan peaks, this is an opportunity for a lifetime experience.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting very early in the morning with a drive to the domestic airport of Kathmandu and then using various local domestic airlines the popular ones for Mountain Flights are Buddha Air, Yeti Airlines, Tara Air, Goma, and Simrik Air on a window seating so that one can view unparalleled views array of snow-capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis wonderful breathtaking flight offers views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang &amp; Jugal Himal extending towards <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaurishankar\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Gaurishankar</a>, Melung Tse, Numbur, and Cho-Oyu with towering Mt. Everest at a near distance from the plane and views of Mt. Makalu and Kanchenjunga towards the further eastern horizon.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a mind-blowing experience during an hour-long flight, return to the hotel and feel this wonderful mountain flight.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuring Nice weather flights start in the early morning. In Winter expect flight delays due to Winter fog, this fog gets cleared by 8 Am so do not plan anything if you are taking a flight in the winter period. In monsoons Mountains may not be visibility due to high clouds. but never know some cloud moves fast and mountains get very clear so wait for the best timings."}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Mountain flight ticket.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Driver Allowance, food, fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Mountain flight ticket.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Driver Allowance, food, fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Explore Mountain Flight with view of Mt Everest with Everest Vacation.", "trip_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>View unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "trip_type_level": "Easy", "meta_description": "Mountain Flight with view of Mt Everest offers awesome views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Langtang extending towards Gaurishankar to Everest.", "trip_attractions": "View unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.", "trip_best_season": "Any Season", "faq_section_title": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "View unparalleled views array of snow capped mountains over green rolling greens hills.", "best_season": "Any Season", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Flyover wonderful breathtaking flight with views of Mt. Manaslu, Ganesh Himal, Mt. Langtang, Chooyu, Lhotse, Nuptse with towering Mount Everest"}	2023-12-01 08:00:59+00	2024-02-02 09:44:35+00
136	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Explore history, culture, adventure, yoga, hiking, and village tours of Kathmandu.", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "6", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "2", "_edit_lock": "1716182232:2", "_dp_original": "510", "_thumbnail_id": "687", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Explore history, culture, adventure, yoga, hiking, and village tours of Kathmandu.", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "6", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Kathmandu Multi Day Tours", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Kathmandu Multi Day Tours", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "47", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Explore Kathmandu multi day tours, an all-encompassing journey weaving through culture, history, adventure revealing Nepal's diverse beauty.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "kathmandu-multi-day-tours", "tags": [], "title": "Kathmandu Multi Day Tours", "duration": "6 Days", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "A warm greeting and welcome to everyone for the <strong>Kathmandu multi day tours</strong>. A week-long tour is a great combination of history, culture, and adventure. We offer you many <strong>varieties in one package</strong>. Come and join us to witness the historic, cultural, and adventurous places and stunning scenery around <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathmandu_Valley\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley</a>. A great opportunity to experience the authentic and local village lifestyle, a day hike in the natural surroundings, spectacular and close-up Mountain views on <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-mountain-flight/\\">mountain flights or helicopter-tour</a> along with a full day Yoga activity day for mind and body relaxation.\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Great combination of History, Culture, and Adventure</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu Valley Multi-day tours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Extended tours to Pokhara, Chitwan, and Lumbini</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tour historical, cultural, and religious places</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experience the adventurous tour by mountain flight or helicopter tour and a cable-car ride</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Enjoy the local village life, and authentic food, and experience their lifestyle on the Village tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Take a full day Yoga activities session for mind and body relaxation</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<h4></h4>\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 1: Cultural and religious day tour\\r\\nDay 2: Historical day tour<span class=\\"redactor-invisible-space\\">\\r\\nDay 3: Hiking day tour\\r\\nDay 4: Adventure day tour\\r\\nDay 5: Yoga Activities day\\r\\nDay 6: Village day tour</span>"}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Cultural and religious day tour", "richText": "The tour commences with a visit to the cultural and religious places inside the Kathmandu valley. Nepal is very rich in its culture and abundant with historically important cultural places. Kathmandu is famous as <strong><i>“The city of temples.”</i></strong> The city has a great combination of Buddhist Stupas and Hindu temples. <strong>Pashupatinath, Budhanilkantha, Bouddhanath, and Swoyambhunath</strong> are some of the major attractions. Besides these, you can find several Buddhist and Hindu religious stupas and temples that are both culturally and historically important. The structures and designs are unique and impressive. To visit these cultural &amp; religious places and get to learn about their history at the same time is fabulous.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 2, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Historical day tour", "richText": "The second day of the tour is to the historical places inside the Kathmandu valley. <strong>Patan Durbar Square </strong>and <strong>Bhaktapur Durbar Square </strong>are historically significant. These durbar squares are artistically beautiful, and their aesthetic designs make them attractive. Every place and structure inside the durbar squares has a great history. Moreover, there are numerous <strong>World Heritage and cultural sites</strong> that are equally significant and historic as these two durbar squares. <strong>Kathmandu Durbar Square, Kirtipur, Hanumandhoka museum, Chhauni museum, etc. </strong>are some other historical places to explore. The ancient temples and local authentic foods are other prime attractions.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 3, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Hiking day tour", "richText": "<strong>Hiking</strong> is the best way to witness the natural beauty of the Kathmandu valley. The lovely views of the Kathmandu valley from the top and close-up mountain views are great takings from a day hike. To hike in the vicinity of the green forest, and diverse flora, and breathe fresh air is surreal. <strong>Champadevi hike, Shivapuri hike, and Changunarayan to Nagarkot hike </strong>are some of the popular hiking destinations.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "2732m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 4, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Adventure day tour", "richText": "There must be some adventures in life to make it more interesting. On the adventure day tour, an option of <strong>an Everest Mountain flight or helicopter tour </strong>in the morning is scheduled. An exciting moment to get a close sight of Mt. Everest and other snow-capped mountains, green hills, flowing rivers, natural greenery, and lovely cities from the flight. The helicopter tour<strong> </strong>gives an opportunity to get close-up views of Mt. Everest and nearby mountains as it lands on the Kalapatthar. After that, tour the <strong>Chandragiri hills via cable car</strong>. The 10-minute cable car ride gives you a sight of awesome green scenery and the Kathmandu valley. Upon reaching the top, adore the natural beauty of Kathmandu valley and the spectacular snowy mountains. If time permits, explore the nearby lovely places.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "2551m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 5, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Yoga Activities day", "richText": "The day is scheduled for Yoga activities day for mind and body relaxation. Various activities like Bhakti Yoga (chants/prayers), Ayurvedic Therapy, and Music Healing, &amp; Meditation are carried out. Besides these, the teachings on different yoga asanas (poses), &amp; chants are given. The full-day Yoga activity is a great way to heal the mind &amp; body after a multi-day tour.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Village day tour", "richText": "The last day of the tour is the village tour. Despite modernization, some places still maintain their originality. <strong>Dhulikhel, Panauti, &amp; Namo Buddha </strong>are some of the villages that are original and people follow authentic lifestyles. The green fields, local farming, organic crops, authentic foods, local lifestyle, well-maintained ancient temples in their original form, and following and preserving the century-old culture, religion, and tradition are the real beauty of these villages.<u></u>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1750m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "", "title": "Pokhara, Chitwan, Lumbini", "richText": "This is our <strong>6-day tour package</strong> with a great combination of history, culture, and adventure and a visit to various places. The tour variety you get while traveling is remarkable. The best part of this package is that you can <strong>customize</strong> the tour as per your preference. You can minimize the tour to 2-4 days or extend the tours to the destinations like <strong>Pokhara, Chitwan, </strong>and<strong> Lumbini</strong>.\\r\\n<h3>Pokhara</h3>\\r\\n<strong>Pokhara</strong> is a lovely city of lakes and a popular tourist destination. The city is renowned for its natural beauty. The awesome mountain views, several historic and cultural places, fascinating lakes, and exciting nightlife makes Pokhara a must-travel city. Pokhara is also a starting city for the Annapurna region trekkers. People can carry out adventurous activities like Paragliding, Zip-flyer, helicopter tours, etc., and create a memory.\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Distance from Kathmandu to Pokhara: 200Km- 7 hours by road or 30 minutes by flight</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Distance from Chitwan to Pokhara: 142Km- 5 hours by road or 20 minutes by flight</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<h3>Chitwan</h3>\\r\\n<strong>Chitwan </strong>is another great destination famous for jungle safari, elephant riding, and bird watching in the beautiful natural surroundings of the Chitwan National Park. Tharu village and the lifestyle of Tharu are other attractions here. Tharu cultural dance, watching birds relaxing at the bank of Rapti River, and witnessing one-horned rhino, Bengal Tiger, &amp; other diverse flora and fauna are mesmerizing.\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Distance from Kathmandu to Chitwan: 164Km- 5 hours by road or 25minutes by flight</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Distance from Pokhara to Chitwan: 142Km- 5 hours by road or 20 minutes by flight.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<h3>Lumbini</h3>\\r\\n<strong>Lumbini </strong>is the historical birthplace of Lord Buddha. World Peace Pagoda, Ashoka Pillar, several artistic monasteries built by several nations, Maya Devi Temple, etc. are the major attractions here. To visit the birthplace of Lord Buddha and attend the sermons on Buddha’s principles and teachings are magical.\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Distance from Kathmandu to Lumbini: 290Km - 9 hours by road or 35 minutes by flight</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Distance from Pokhara to Lumbini: 200Km- 6.5 hours by road or 20 minutes by flight</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Distance from Chitwan to Lumbini: 156Km-5 hours by road</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/local-people-of-newari-village-in-Kathmandu.jpg", "title": "local people of newari village in Kathmandu", "altText": "local people from Newari people, Kathmandu", "caption": "local people from Newari people, Kathmandu", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["553", "559", "555", "556", "554", "560", "561", "558", "557"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "Everyday different experiences: Cultural and religious day | Historical day | Hiking day | Adventure sport day | Yoga & Meditation day | Village exploring day", "ws_block_best_season": "Any Season", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "-1", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "The itineraries above are just suggestions. If they don't quite match your vision, we can adjust them to your specific needs and preferences. Whether you have a specific duration in mind, we can create a tailor-made itinerary that's perfect for you. Just let us know your desired travel dates, preferred destinations, and any specific activities or interests you have, and we'll craft the perfect adventure for you.", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "What's included?", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-white", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "We’re happy to customize your trip!", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Overview", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc651ee1073", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_block_video_widgets": "field_63eef38026ee6", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "Private AC Vehicle", "ws_trip_galleries_title": "Photo/Visual Gallery", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "_ws_trip_galleries_title": "field_63ec89128acaa", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nExperience a perfect blend of history, culture, adventure, yoga, hiking, and village tours. Our itinerary offers a diverse range of activities that cater to all your interests. Immerse yourself in the rich history and culture of the region, embark on thrilling adventures, unwind with yoga sessions, explore the beautiful hiking trails, and discover the beauty of rural village life. Join us for an unforgettable journey with us.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "ws_trip_information_list": 7, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec94565c587", "starter_kit_section_title": "Day by Day Activities", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Meals as per your choice (Breakfast / Lunch / Dinner)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All accommodation as per your choice (3-star hotels, 4-star / 5-star or high-end luxury hotel)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Monuments entrance/admission fees</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private vehicle with air conditioning from airport to airport service.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) &amp; government taxes.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Upon your request, we can handle your flight ticket with an additional cost.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "A warm greeting and welcome to everyone for the <strong>Kathmandu multi day tours</strong>. A week-long tour is a great combination of history, culture, and adventure. We offer you many <strong>varieties in one package</strong>. Come and join us to witness the historic, cultural, and adventurous places and stunning scenery around <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathmandu_Valley\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley</a>. A great opportunity to experience the authentic and local village lifestyle, a day hike in the natural surroundings, spectacular and close-up Mountain views on <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-mountain-flight/\\">mountain flights or helicopter-tour</a> along with a full day Yoga activity day for mind and body relaxation.\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Great combination of History, Culture, and Adventure</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu Valley Multi-day tours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Extended tours to Pokhara, Chitwan, and Lumbini</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tour historical, cultural, and religious places</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experience the adventurous tour by mountain flight or helicopter tour and a cable-car ride</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Enjoy the local village life, and authentic food, and experience their lifestyle on the Village tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Take a full day Yoga activities session for mind and body relaxation</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<h4></h4>\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 1: Cultural and religious day tour\\r\\nDay 2: Historical day tour<span class=\\"redactor-invisible-space\\">\\r\\nDay 3: Hiking day tour\\r\\nDay 4: Adventure day tour\\r\\nDay 5: Yoga Activities day\\r\\nDay 6: Village day tour</span>", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "Explore history, culture, adventure, yoga, hiking, and village tours of Kathmandu with a variety of combinations", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "04", "ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days": "05", "ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days": "06", "ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days": "Extension", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "field