>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>"}], "itinerary_title": "Sample Itinerary (Customizable)", "showBookingForm": true, "sub_description": "8 nights in Kathmandu/Pokhara/Chitwan NP, 4 nights in Thimphu/Punakha/Paro, 7 nights in Lhasa, Tsedang, Gyantse, Shigatse(Tibet)", "trip_highlights": "<ol><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Kathmandu sightseeing (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Pokhara Sightseeing with sunrise at Sarangkot</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Chitwan Excursion (Jungle Safari, Tharu Village Tour, Canoeing, Sunset View)</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Thimphu Sightseeing (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Buddha Dordenma, etc.)</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Tiger’s Nest Monastery hike with Paro Sightseeing</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Visit Tibet’s first monastery-Samye and historic Yumbu Lhakhang Palace</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Shigatse &amp; Gyantse Sightseeing (Gyantse Kumbum, Pelkor Chöde Monastery, Tashilhunpo Monastery)</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>Visit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake</li><li data-list=\\"bullet\\"><span class=\\"ql-ui\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></span>UNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace</li><li data-li