 view of Kathmandu city, surrounding green hills with snow capped mountains in the north.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThis old Stupa of Swayambhunath, the oldest historical monument listed as World Heritage Sites with over 2, 5000 years old Buddhist religion area with huge dome shape stupa overlooking four cardinal eyes of Buddha around North, South, East and West directions. Here visiting monastery and chapels, Sywambhunath is guarded with lovely woodland with a many monkeys around, this place is also named as “Monkey Temple”.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here another tour leads to Pashupatinath Temple, where non Hindu are not permitted inside the main temple entrance, where visitors can have a look of the temple surrounding from above the Bagmati river, this famous Shiva temple decorated with golden tier roofs with silver doors around each corner, this place close to green woodland with lots of monkeys around. Pashupatinath is full of pilgrims in special day on Shiva Ratri (birth anniversary of lord Shiva).\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNearby on the side of the river funeral and cremation are held for all Hindus, from here return back to your hotels at leisure for the rest of afternoon.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"02\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Bhaktapur \\\\u0026 Patan Durbar Square\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Starting the morning with a short drive towards Patan city located south of Kathmandu at mere distance across the bridge, on reaching Patan also known as Lalitpur meaning “city of arts” visit the old Palace complex, courtyard (Durbar) with tall terracotta palace, impressive window carvings, and a tall Krishna Temple with Garuda pillar, a vehicle of Lord Vishnu and Lord Krishna, from here a pleasant ride to valley 03rd biggest city, this old looking city at one time Nepal capital during Malla period in 12th to 15th century.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nBhaktapur famous for arts and crafts like woodcarving and pottery, tour of unique Durbar Square with golden gate of 55 windows palace, interesting wooden peacock window, continue tour of Bhaktapur visiting another Durbar Square with famed Nytapola Temple, Bhaktapur National Art Gallery, and Bhairavnath Temple.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a lovely and interesting day return back to hotel with afternoon free at leisure.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"03\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Changu Narayan \\\\u0026 Nagarkot hill top\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"2175m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning depart hotel for a scenic and interesting drive towards east North East of Kathmandu on the Nepal / Tibet, China Friendship highway, drive leaves past the outer rim of Bhaktapur with uphill reaching at a small medieval Newari village at Changu-Narayan, visit Nepal oldest temple, listed in World Heritage Site, a 05th century old adorned with full artistic work on metals and wood. Inscription dates back 464 AD the first ever epigraphicevidences of Nepalese history, from here carry on drive high above to Nagarkot, located 30 km east of Kathmandu, a favorite weekend gateway for Himalayan mountain views and serenity. From Nagarkot, witness the striking mountain panorama extending from Dhaulagiri in the west towards east of Mt. Everest. Nagarkot at 2,175 meters high visiting the top hill and climb to a observatory tower with beautiful forest surrounding offering a grandstand panorama of the Himalaya with five world’s highest mountains with Everest (8,848m.), Lhotse (8,516m.), Cho Oyu (8,201m.), Makalu (8,463m.) and other lesser peak. Nagarkot famous for sunrise and sunset views over chain of Himalayan snow peaks.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"04\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Nagarkot Sunrise Tour and Return back to Kathmandu by drive or hiking with drive.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"2175m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Early morning, you will enjoy amazing sunrise and return back to Kathmandu by drive or hiking with drive.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a wonderful exciting tour of Kathmandu city historical, cultural places with scenic Mountain View point’s return back to Kathmandu after completing the tour with Everest Vacation.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":4,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eFully private trip \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e(even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVehicle fuel, vehicle tax.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking cultural city tour guide.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking Water.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"2\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ede33e5764a\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_641162e6b5849\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"field_63ede33e5b304\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"3. How to find \\\\u0026 book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"4. How is the weather like in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"5. What to expect on tours?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":5,\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":\\"field_63ede38e351c7\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 1 hour\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 2 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/6-days-kathmandu-nagakot-dhulikhel-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot \\\\u0026amp; Dhulikhel Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 6 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "descriptions": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Kathmandu and Nagarkot sunrise tour with diversity of culture and scenery\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThis tour offer you world heritage sites of Kathmandu, Patan \\\\u0026amp; Bhaktapur. It includes beautiful Himalayan views, natural scenery, religious and cultural architects of Kathmandu valley with popular hill Nagarkot. Nagarkot is very popular for mountain sunrise and sunset.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"2175 meters\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Boudhanath, Pashupatinath, Swoyambhunath, Basantapur, Patan, Bhaktapur, Changu Narayan \\\\u0026 Nagarkot\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Highlights\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"4 days in \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-short-tour/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e and \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagarkot\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eNagarkot\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e with a diversity of culture and scenery. If you are interested, this itinerary will help you to get the most out of this magical yet hectic place aside from the valley with Historical, Cultural, Newari People local lifestyle, and Farming activities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch4\\\\u003eOutline Itinerary\\\\u003c/h4\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\\\r\\\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan Durbar Square \\\\u0026amp; Bhaktapur\\\\r\\\\nDay 03: Tour of Changu Narayan \\\\u0026amp; Nagarkot hill top\\\\r\\\\nDay 04: Nagarkot Sunrise Tour and Return back to Kathmandu by drive or hiking with drive.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"542\\",\\"602\\",\\"4349\\",\\"4333\\",\\"4304\\",\\"4297\\",\\"4041\\",\\"3960\\",\\"3955\\",\\"3920\\",\\"781\\",\\"527\\",\\"525\\",\\"3969\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning 09 a.m. departure from the hotel for guided sightseeing tour of historical and cultural tour with delightful scenery around Kathmandu city with Everest Vacation, a short ride to Kathmandu Durbar Square, visit of places with old history and rich culture of old king’s durbar square and Hanuman Dhoka (palace) visit of ancient Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu name derived from) this temple built of wood from a single tree, tour of Kumari Goddess (living virgin goddess) Kumari a very young girl, after teenage years phase replaced by another young Kumari, from here a short drive to west of the city at Swayambhunath Stupa located on a hill top, with panorama view of Kathmandu city, surrounding green hills with snow capped mountains in the north.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThis old Stupa of Swayambhunath, the oldest historical monument listed as World Heritage Sites with over 2, 5000 years old Buddhist religion area with huge dome shape stupa overlooking four cardinal eyes of Buddha around North, South, East and West directions. Here visiting monastery and chapels, Sywambhunath is guarded with lovely woodland with a many monkeys around, this place is also named as “Monkey Temple”.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here another tour leads to Pashupatinath Temple, where non Hindu are not permitted inside the main temple entrance, where visitors can have a look of the temple surrounding from above the Bagmati river, this famous Shiva temple decorated with golden tier roofs with silver doors around each corner, this place close to green woodland with lots of monkeys around. Pashupatinath is full of pilgrims in special day on Shiva Ratri (birth anniversary of lord Shiva).\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNearby on the side of the river funeral and cremation are held for all Hindus, from here return back to your hotels at leisure for the rest of afternoon.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"02\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Bhaktapur \\\\u0026 Patan Durbar Square\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Starting the morning with a short drive towards Patan city located south of Kathmandu at mere distance across the bridge, on reaching Patan also known as Lalitpur meaning “city of arts” visit the old Palace complex, courtyard (Durbar) with tall terracotta palace, impressive window carvings, and a tall Krishna Temple with Garuda pillar, a vehicle of Lord Vishnu and Lord Krishna, from here a pleasant ride to valley 03rd biggest city, this old looking city at one time Nepal capital during Malla period in 12th to 15th century.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nBhaktapur famous for arts and crafts like woodcarving and pottery, tour of unique Durbar Square with golden gate of 55 windows palace, interesting wooden peacock window, continue tour of Bhaktapur visiting another Durbar Square with famed Nytapola Temple, Bhaktapur National Art Gallery, and Bhairavnath Temple.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a lovely and interesting day return back to hotel with afternoon free at leisure.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"03\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Changu Narayan \\\\u0026 Nagarkot hill top\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"2175m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning depart hotel for a scenic and interesting drive towards east North East of Kathmandu on the Nepal / Tibet, China Friendship highway, drive leaves past the outer rim of Bhaktapur with uphill reaching at a small medieval Newari village at Changu-Narayan, visit Nepal oldest temple, listed in World Heritage Site, a 05th century old adorned with full artistic work on metals and wood. Inscription dates back 464 AD the first ever epigraphicevidences of Nepalese history, from here carry on drive high above to Nagarkot, located 30 km east of Kathmandu, a favorite weekend gateway for Himalayan mountain views and serenity. From Nagarkot, witness the striking mountain panorama extending from Dhaulagiri in the west towards east of Mt. Everest. Nagarkot at 2,175 meters high visiting the top hill and climb to a observatory tower with beautiful forest surrounding offering a grandstand panorama of the Himalaya with five world’s highest mountains with Everest (8,848m.), Lhotse (8,516m.), Cho Oyu (8,201m.), Makalu (8,463m.) and other lesser peak. Nagarkot famous for sunrise and sunset views over chain of Himalayan snow peaks.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"04\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Nagarkot Sunrise Tour and Return back to Kathmandu by drive or hiking with drive.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"2175m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Early morning, you will enjoy amazing sunrise and return back to Kathmandu by drive or hiking with drive.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a wonderful exciting tour of Kathmandu city historical, cultural places with scenic Mountain View point’s return back to Kathmandu after completing the tour with Everest Vacation.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":4,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eFully private trip \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e(even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVehicle fuel, vehicle tax.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking cultural city tour guide.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking Water.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"2\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ede33e5764a\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_641162e6b5849\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"field_63ede33e5b304\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"3. How to find \\\\u0026 book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"4. How is the weather like in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"5. What to expect on tours?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":5,\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":\\"field_63ede38e351c7\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 1 hour\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 2 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/6-days-kathmandu-nagakot-dhulikhel-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot \\\\u0026amp; Dhulikhel Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 6 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/sunrise-tour-nagarkot.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pashupati-temple-load-shiva.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/nagakot.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/kathmandu-city-tour.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/kathmandu-trip-1.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/village-local-life.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/swyambhunath.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Thanka-of-Buddha.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/mountain-views.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/mountainview.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/historical-day-tour.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/changunarayan-temple.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/bhaktapur-city-of-arts-e1706022904337.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/nala-farming.jpg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=601", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "601", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-02 09:32:25", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-02 09:32:25", "post_modified": "2024-05-17 07:03:27", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-05-17 07:03:27"}}, "customSections": [{"id": 1, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Extended Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/6-days-kathmandu-nagakot-dhulikhel-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot &amp; Dhulikhel Tour</a> - 6 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/6-days-kathmandu-nagakot-dhulikhel-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot &amp; Dhulikhel Tour</a> - 6 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Highlights", "content": ["4 days in <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-short-tour/\\">Kathmandu</a> and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagarkot\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Nagarkot</a> with a diversity of culture and scenery. If you are interested, this itinerary will help you to get the most out of this magical yet hectic place aside from the valley with Historical, Cultural, Newari People local lifestyle, and Farming activities.\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan Durbar Square &amp; Bhaktapur\\r\\nDay 03: Tour of Changu Narayan &amp; Nagarkot hill top\\r\\nDay 04: Nagarkot Sunrise Tour and Return back to Kathmandu by drive or hiking with drive."], "description": "4 days in <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-short-tour/\\">Kathmandu</a> and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagarkot\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Nagarkot</a> with a diversity of culture and scenery. If you are interested, this itinerary will help you to get the most out of this magical yet hectic place aside from the valley with Historical, Cultural, Newari People local lifestyle, and Farming activities.\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan Durbar Square &amp; Bhaktapur\\r\\nDay 03: Tour of Changu Narayan &amp; Nagarkot hill top\\r\\nDay 04: Nagarkot Sunrise Tour and Return back to Kathmandu by drive or hiking with drive."}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Combination of culture and scenic tour including Nagarkot Sunrise", "trip_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nThis tour offer you world heritage sites of Kathmandu, Patan &amp; Bhaktapur. It includes beautiful Himalayan views, natural scenery, religious and cultural architects of Kathmandu valley with popular hill Nagarkot. Nagarkot is very popular for mountain sunrise and sunset.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "4 Days Kathmandu City with Nagarkot Hill Tour is very popular offering diversity of culture and scenery coupled with adventure.", "trip_attractions": "Boudhanath, Pashupatinath, Swoyambhunath, Basantapur, Patan, Bhaktapur, Changu Narayan & Nagarkot", "trip_best_season": "Any Season", "faq_section_title": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "Boudhanath, Pashupatinath, Swoyambhunath, Basantapur, Patan, Bhaktapur, Changu Narayan & Nagarkot", "best_season": "Any Season", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "2175 meters", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_max_elevation": "2175 meters", "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "Kathmandu and Nagarkot sunrise tour with diversity of culture and scenery"}	2023-12-02 09:32:25+00	2024-05-17 08:03:27+01
157	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Kritipur, Bungmati & Dakshinkali", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "3", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "2", "_edit_lock": "1715928939:2", "_dp_original": "510", "_thumbnail_id": "609", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Kritipur, Bungmati & Dakshinkali", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "3", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "3 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "3 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "47", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "An interesting 3 Days Kathmandu Cultural tour of historical and cultural landmarks with pleasant scenery with Everest Vacation tour.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour", "tags": [], "title": "3 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour", "duration": "3 Days", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "There are three principal cities in Kathmandu Valley namely Kathmandu, Patan, and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>. There are three Durbar (Palace) Squares in these cities under UNESCO Heritage sites, and ultimately these Sites are the living history of <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\">Kathmandu Valley</a>.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you are a traveler with three or more travel days, plan to this itinerary will be most beneficial for you. This tightly managed itinerary doesn’t compromise the quality of your experiences but manages your time and schedule in a way that you will make the most of your Kathmandu visit.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn the span of a mere three days, you will be experiencing one of the closest encounters with this grand place; its people, their culture, tradition, and religion, and their rich history in a crafted Vessel. You will peek into the lifestyle of locals and try the Newari Cuisines on your journey. The natural sceneries of the rice plantation beyond the green hills with the snowcapped mountains in the distance, be ready to make some boundless memories in Kathmandu.\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) &amp; Bhaktapur, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 03: Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping &amp; Dakshinkali Approx: 05 – 06 hrs."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath", "richText": "A captivating morning tour with Everest Vacation, our city, and cultural guide will receive you from the hotel in the first hour of the day. You will then start the day with a guided tour of <strong>Kathmandu Durbar Square</strong>. A place with a stockpile of old history and rich culture, visiting old Royal Durbar Square is experiencing medieval Nepal as a whole.\\r\\n\\r\\nOne of the major attraction here was Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu was named) a temple built from the wood of a single tree. Sadly, the temple with a couple of other monuments was destroyed from the earthquake of 2015. However, you can still visit the ruins of these temples. Then you will have a tour of Kumari Goddess Temple (Only living goddess in Nepal). The Divine Goddess is here from her tender age, and she remains in the position until her puberty period. The priests then select the next Goddess to replace her.\\r\\n\\r\\nWalk around the world famous <strong>freak street,</strong> A popular destination in Kathmandu in the early 1960s to ’80s for budget tourist and hippies before Thamel established as a tourist center.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom here you will travel towards the western delight of the Valley. Located in the hilltop <strong>Swyambhunath</strong> is the oldest shrine of this nation. Attended by Hindus and Buddhists alike this place is an excellent destination for a quick hike and some fresh air.\\r\\n\\r\\nAbout 2500 years old, Swyambhunath is also the oldest Unesco Heritage site in Nepal. An environment with positive vibes and abundant pilgrims circumambulating the area, you can just feel in the atmosphere all day long. The white dome in the top of the hill is the main structure here. With the abundant population of monkeys residing in the Temple, Swyambhunath area is also popular as 'The Monkey Temple.' From the hilltop, you can enjoy the panoramic view of most parts of Kathmandu and the hills that surround the city. in clear weather you can also view multiple mountain ranges in the far North.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter your lunch, take a short rest and be ready to experience the most significant <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/travel-info/about-hinduisms/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Hindu</a> temple of Nepal, you head towards the north of the city towards the holy temple of <strong>Pashupatinath</strong> in the late afternoon. As Non-Hindu tourists and personnel cant enter the main temple area, you can explore the other monuments and shrines under the vast field of Pashupatinath. Extending in both sides of the <strong>Holy Bagmati</strong> river the temple complex has more than 518 temples in a 264-hectare area.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom Pashupatinath, you drive further north-east to reach the <strong>Boudhanath Stupa</strong>. This stupa is the biggest stupa of Nepal and also listed in the UNESCO world heritage list. Boudhanath is the center of Tibetan Buddhism in Nepal. The majestic architecture of the dome is balanced with the Buddhism vibe going all around it. You can spend some time here Taking sips of Tibetan tea and enjoying the view from one of the rooftop here. You will also get a chance to shop for your souvenirs in the shops surrounding the Stupa.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter the nice refreshing tour of the Heritage and religious sites, return to your hotel and get some rest and refreshments.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 2, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) & Bhaktapur", "richText": "Your morning starts with some hot beverage, and you move to the third major city of <strong>Bhaktapur</strong>. Also known as Bhadgaon(the land of rice), Bhaktapur offers you the less disturbed cultural places in the Valley. Walking through the stone patched streets here you can admire the art form and architecture in every corner. The area is famous for beautiful pottery as well as wood and stone carvings. The significant places not to miss in your visit are The <strong>Bhaktapur Durbar Square</strong>, Nyatapola Temple square with surrounding temples, Bhaktapur national art gallery and the 55 windows palace.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter your trip, Bhaktapur has lunch and proceed towards the city of arts,<strong> Patan</strong>. Also known as Lalitpur, this city is the second largest city in the valley. A quieter neighborhood than the capital, Patan is a living cultural destination in your trip. You'll have a visit to the Patan Durbar Square, where full of architectural brilliance and art packed streets wait for you. Explore the Krishna Temple, One of the most eye-catching and religiously essential sculptures of the square. People believe that this vast temple was carved into a single enormous stone. After your experience rich visit, return to your hotel.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 3, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping & Dakshinkali", "richText": "Today you will have an authentic look at the locals of Kathmandu, the Newars. Newari people lived in the place from centuries ago, and one can still see their rich culture and tradition in their architecture and way of living. About 6km from the city to the southern edge of this whole valley, you will reach a small town of Pharping. Famous for their diverse culture and tradition, this suburb city is in the lap of natural scenery. There is a monastery here where people believe that <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Padmasambhava\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Guru Rinpoche</a> meditated in caves. <strong>Pharping</strong> is also a gateway to one of the famous Hindu Goddess temple in the whole nation, Dakshinkali. In the way, you can visit the Chovar gorge and beautiful Manjushree park.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou will then visit the historic city of Kritipur. Popular for the Newari neighborhood and their authentic cuisine this place was a separate kingdom before king <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prithvi_Narayan_Shah\\">P.N Shah</a> merged Nepal. This city of glory believes in unity, and you can see that in the community festivals when the whole settlement comes together. Walking through the streets, you can explore the ancient Newari architecture of making their houses. The subtle wood carvings people use in their windows, doors, and roof will be a treat for you.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn <strong>Kirtipur</strong> visit Bagh Bhairab temple, dedicated to the God Bhairab in the form of a tiger. This god is regarded as the guardian of Kirtipur, and the locals call him Ajudeu.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Chilancho Stupa</strong>: is a Buddhist shrine built in the medieval period. An inscription of Nepal Samvat 635 is found in this Chaitya. Therefore, it is one of the most historical stupas of this region.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Uma Maheshwar</strong>: Uma Maheshwar temple (locally, Kwacho Dega) is one of the famous heritage sites of Kirtipur. This pagoda-style three-storied temple is situated at a high hill at 1,414 m of altitude. This site With fabulous views of Kathmandu valley and different mountains ranges towards the north.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Shri Kirti Bihar</strong>: a Theravada Buddhist monastery built in traditional Thai architectural style. Located at the entrance to the city, its magnificent architecture is alluring.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter spending some quality time in Kritipur, you will now head towards the beautiful villages of <strong>Bungmati and Kokana</strong>. This village tour is ideal for learning the ancient history and lifestyle of Nepal. These villages have unchanged and undisturbed lifestyle from centuries ago. The majority of people are Newars while other tribesmen also live in perfect harmony here. The monuments here are preserved by the locals, and you can experience the traditional farming and husbandry techniques here. This place is also famous for hand-made garments and organic mustard oil production. You will be gazing at a different Nepal in these places, and the village tour will be a perfect way to end your day as you return to your hotel.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/antique-bell.jpg", "title": "antique-bell", "altText": "Antique Bell, Kathmandu religious monuments", "caption": "Antique Bell, Kathmandu religious monuments", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["611", "610", "609", "612", "4331", "4030", "4299", "3997", "3942", "3921", "836", "4309", "4310", "4311"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "World Heritage sites, Hindu Temples, Buddhist Stupas, History of Newari people and culture ,Local lifestyle, Farming activities", "ws_block_best_season": "Any Season", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "-1", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "What's included?", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-light", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Overview", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc6695edb31", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_block_video_widgets": "field_63eef38026ee6", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "Private AC Vehicle", "ws_trip_galleries_title": "Photo/Visual Gallery", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "_ws_trip_galleries_title": "field_63ec89128acaa", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nKathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Kritipur, Bungmati, Pharping &amp; Dakshinkali\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "ws_trip_information_list": 1, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec90a574f02", "starter_kit_section_title": "Day by Day Activities", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Fully private trip </strong>(even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>English speaking cultural city tour guide.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drinking Water.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "There are three principal cities in Kathmandu Valley namely Kathmandu, Patan, and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>. There are three Durbar (Palace) Squares in these cities under UNESCO Heritage sites, and ultimately these Sites are the living history of <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\">Kathmandu Valley</a>.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you are a traveler with three or more travel days, plan to this itinerary will be most beneficial for you. This tightly managed itinerary doesn’t compromise the quality of your experiences but manages your time and schedule in a way that you will make the most of your Kathmandu visit.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn the span of a mere three days, you will be experiencing one of the closest encounters with this grand place; its people, their culture, tradition, and religion, and their rich history in a crafted Vessel. You will peek into the lifestyle of locals and try the Newari Cuisines on your journey. The natural sceneries of the rice plantation beyond the green hills with the snowcapped mountains in the distance, be ready to make some boundless memories in Kathmandu.\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) &amp; Bhaktapur, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 03: Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping &amp; Dakshinkali Approx: 05 – 06 hrs.", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "Historical, Cultural, Newari People local lifestyle, Farming activities", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food": "Breakfast", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food": "Breakfast", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "field_63ec96f1878e1", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food": "field_63ec96f1878e1", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food": "field_63ec96f1878e1", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel": "3star to Luxury hotels", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title": "Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel": "3star to Luxury hotels", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title": "Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) & Bhaktapur", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel": "3star to Luxury hotels", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title": "Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping & Dakshinkali", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "Extended Tours", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "field_63ec91180462f", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration": "", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "A captivating morning tour with Everest Vacation, our city, and cultural guide will receive you from the hotel in the first hour of the day. You will then start the day with a guided tour of <strong>Kathmandu Durbar Square</strong>. A place with a stockpile of old history and rich culture, visiting old Royal Durbar Square is experiencing medieval Nepal as a whole.\\r\\n\\r\\nOne of the major attraction here was Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu was named) a temple built from the wood of a single tree. Sadly, the temple with a couple of other monuments was destroyed from the earthquake of 2015. However, you can still visit the ruins of these temples. Then you will have a tour of Kumari Goddess Temple (Only living goddess in Nepal). The Divine Goddess is here from her tender age, and she remains in the position until her puberty period. The priests then select the next Goddess to replace her.\\r\\n\\r\\nWalk around the world famous <strong>freak street,</strong> A popular destination in Kathmandu in the early 1960s to ’80s for budget tourist and hippies before Thamel established as a tourist center.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom here you will travel towards the western delight of the Valley. Located in the hilltop <strong>Swyambhunath</strong> is the oldest shrine of this nation. Attended by Hindus and Buddhists alike this place is an excellent destination for a quick hike and some fresh air.\\r\\n\\r\\nAbout 2500 years old, Swyambhunath is also the oldest Unesco Heritage site in Nepal. An environment with positive vibes and abundant pilgrims circumambulating the area, you can just feel in the atmosphere all day long. The white dome in the top of the hill is the main structure here. With the abundant population of monkeys residing in the Temple, Swyambhunath area is also popular as 'The Monkey Temple.' From the hilltop, you can enjoy the panoramic view of most parts of Kathmandu and the hills that surround the city. in clear weather you can also view multiple mountain ranges in the far North.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter your lunch, take a short rest and be ready to experience the most significant <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/travel-info/about-hinduisms/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Hindu</a> temple of Nepal, you head towards the north of the city towards the holy temple of <strong>Pashupatinath</strong> in the late afternoon. As Non-Hindu tourists and personnel cant enter the main temple area, you can explore the other monuments and shrines under the vast field of Pashupatinath. Extending in both sides of the <strong>Holy Bagmati</strong> river the temple complex has more than 518 temples in a 264-hectare area.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom Pashupatinath, you drive further north-east to reach the <strong>Boudhanath Stupa</strong>. This stupa is the biggest stupa of Nepal and also listed in the UNESCO world heritage list. Boudhanath is the center of Tibetan Buddhism in Nepal. The majestic architecture of the dome is balanced with the Buddhism vibe going all around it. You can spend some time here Taking sips of Tibetan tea and enjoying the view from one of the rooftop here. You will also get a chance to shop for your souvenirs in the shops surrounding the Stupa.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter the nice refreshing tour of the Heritage and religious sites, return to your hotel and get some rest and refreshments.", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "Your morning starts with some hot beverage, and you move to the third major city of <strong>Bhaktapur</strong>. Also known as Bhadgaon(the land of rice), Bhaktapur offers you the less disturbed cultural places in the Valley. Walking through the stone patched streets here you can admire the art form and architecture in every corner. The area is famous for beautiful pottery as well as wood and stone carvings. The significant places not to miss in your visit are The <strong>Bhaktapur Durbar Square</strong>, Nyatapola Temple square with surrounding temples, Bhaktapur national art gallery and the 55 windows palace.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter your trip, Bhaktapur has lunch and proceed towards the city of arts,<strong> Patan</strong>. Also known as Lalitpur, this city is the second largest city in the valley. A quieter neighborhood than the capital, Patan is a living cultural destination in your trip. You'll have a visit to the Patan Durbar Square, where full of architectural brilliance and art packed streets wait for you. Explore the Krishna Temple, One of the most eye-catching and religiously essential sculptures of the square. People believe that this vast temple was carved into a single enormous stone. After your experience rich visit, return to your hotel.", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "Today you will have an authentic look at the locals of Kathmandu, the Newars. Newari people lived in the place from centuries ago, and one can still see their rich culture and tradition in their architecture and way of living. About 6km from the city to the southern edge of this whole valley, you will reach a small town of Pharping. Famous for their diverse culture and tradition, this suburb city is in the lap of natural scenery. There is a monastery here where people believe that <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Padmasambhava\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Guru Rinpoche</a> meditated in caves. <strong>Pharping</strong> is also a gateway to one of the famous Hindu Goddess temple in the whole nation, Dakshinkali. In the way, you can visit the Chovar gorge and beautiful Manjushree park.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou will then visit the historic city of Kritipur. Popular for the Newari neighborhood and their authentic cuisine this place was a separate kingdom before king <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prithvi_Narayan_Shah\\">P.N Shah</a> merged Nepal. This city of glory believes in unity, and you can see that in the community festivals when the whole settlement comes together. Walking through the streets, you can explore the ancient Newari architecture of making their houses. The subtle wood carvings people use in their windows, doors, and roof will be a treat for you.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn <strong>Kirtipur</strong> visit Bagh Bhairab temple, dedicated to the God Bhairab in the form of a tiger. This god is regarded as the guardian of Kirtipur, and the locals call him Ajudeu.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Chilancho Stupa</strong>: is a Buddhist shrine built in the medieval period. An inscription of Nepal Samvat 635 is found in this Chaitya. Therefore, it is one of the most historical stupas of this region.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Uma Maheshwar</strong>: Uma Maheshwar temple (locally, Kwacho Dega) is one of the famous heritage sites of Kirtipur. This pagoda-style three-storied temple is situated at a high hill at 1,414 m of altitude. This site With fabulous views of Kathmandu valley and different mountains ranges towards the north.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Shri Kirti Bihar</strong>: a Theravada Buddhist monastery built in traditional Thai architectural style. Located at the entrance to the city, its magnificent architecture is alluring.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter spending some quality time in Kritipur, you will now head towards the beautiful villages of <strong>Bungmati and Kokana</strong>. This village tour is ideal for learning the ancient history and lifestyle of Nepal. These villages have unchanged and undisturbed lifestyle from centuries ago. The majority of people are Newars while other tribesmen also live in perfect harmony here. The monuments here are preserved by the locals, and you can experience the traditional farming and husbandry techniques here. This place is also famous for hand-made garments and organic mustard oil production. You will be gazing at a different Nepal in these places, and the village tour will be a perfect way to end your day as you return to your hotel.", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "3 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Historical, Cultural, Newari People local lifestyle, Farming activities\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nKathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Kritipur, Bungmati, Pharping \\\\u0026amp; Dakshinkali\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"World Heritage sites, Hindu Temples, Buddhist Stupas, History of Newari people and culture ,Local lifestyle, Farming activities\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"There are three principal cities in Kathmandu Valley namely Kathmandu, Patan, and \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eBhaktapur\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e. There are three Durbar (Palace) Squares in these cities under UNESCO Heritage sites, and ultimately these Sites are the living history of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIf you are a traveler with three or more travel days, plan to this itinerary will be most beneficial for you. This tightly managed itinerary doesn’t compromise the quality of your experiences but manages your time and schedule in a way that you will make the most of your Kathmandu visit.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIn the span of a mere three days, you will be experiencing one of the closest encounters with this grand place; its people, their culture, tradition, and religion, and their rich history in a crafted Vessel. You will peek into the lifestyle of locals and try the Newari Cuisines on your journey. The natural sceneries of the rice plantation beyond the green hills with the snowcapped mountains in the distance, be ready to make some boundless memories in Kathmandu.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch4\\\\u003eOutline Itinerary\\\\u003c/h4\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\\\r\\\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) \\\\u0026amp; Bhaktapur, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\\\r\\\\nDay 03: Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping \\\\u0026amp; Dakshinkali Approx: 05 – 06 hrs.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"611\\",\\"610\\",\\"609\\",\\"612\\",\\"4331\\",\\"4030\\",\\"4299\\",\\"3997\\",\\"3942\\",\\"3921\\",\\"836\\",\\"4309\\",\\"4310\\",\\"4311\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"A captivating morning tour with Everest Vacation, our city, and cultural guide will receive you from the hotel in the first hour of the day. You will then start the day with a guided tour of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eKathmandu Durbar Square\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. A place with a stockpile of old history and rich culture, visiting old Royal Durbar Square is experiencing medieval Nepal as a whole.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nOne of the major attraction here was Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu was named) a temple built from the wood of a single tree. Sadly, the temple with a couple of other monuments was destroyed from the earthquake of 2015. However, you can still visit the ruins of these temples. Then you will have a tour of Kumari Goddess Temple (Only living goddess in Nepal). The Divine Goddess is here from her tender age, and she remains in the position until her puberty period. The priests then select the next Goddess to replace her.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWalk around the world famous \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003efreak street,\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e A popular destination in Kathmandu in the early 1960s to ’80s for budget tourist and hippies before Thamel established as a tourist center.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here you will travel towards the western delight of the Valley. Located in the hilltop \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eSwyambhunath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is the oldest shrine of this nation. Attended by Hindus and Buddhists alike this place is an excellent destination for a quick hike and some fresh air.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAbout 2500 years old, Swyambhunath is also the oldest Unesco Heritage site in Nepal. An environment with positive vibes and abundant pilgrims circumambulating the area, you can just feel in the atmosphere all day long. The white dome in the top of the hill is the main structure here. With the abundant population of monkeys residing in the Temple, Swyambhunath area is also popular as 'The Monkey Temple.' From the hilltop, you can enjoy the panoramic view of most parts of Kathmandu and the hills that surround the city. in clear weather you can also view multiple mountain ranges in the far North.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter your lunch, take a short rest and be ready to experience the most significant \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/travel-info/about-hinduisms/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHindu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e temple of Nepal, you head towards the north of the city towards the holy temple of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e in the late afternoon. As Non-Hindu tourists and personnel cant enter the main temple area, you can explore the other monuments and shrines under the vast field of Pashupatinath. Extending in both sides of the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHoly Bagmati\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e river the temple complex has more than 518 temples in a 264-hectare area.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom Pashupatinath, you drive further north-east to reach the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBoudhanath Stupa\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. This stupa is the biggest stupa of Nepal and also listed in the UNESCO world heritage list. Boudhanath is the center of Tibetan Buddhism in Nepal. The majestic architecture of the dome is balanced with the Buddhism vibe going all around it. You can spend some time here Taking sips of Tibetan tea and enjoying the view from one of the rooftop here. You will also get a chance to shop for your souvenirs in the shops surrounding the Stupa.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter the nice refreshing tour of the Heritage and religious sites, return to your hotel and get some rest and refreshments.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"02\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) \\\\u0026 Bhaktapur\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Your morning starts with some hot beverage, and you move to the third major city of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBhaktapur\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. Also known as Bhadgaon(the land of rice), Bhaktapur offers you the less disturbed cultural places in the Valley. Walking through the stone patched streets here you can admire the art form and architecture in every corner. The area is famous for beautiful pottery as well as wood and stone carvings. The significant places not to miss in your visit are The \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBhaktapur Durbar Square\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, Nyatapola Temple square with surrounding temples, Bhaktapur national art gallery and the 55 windows palace.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter your trip, Bhaktapur has lunch and proceed towards the city of arts,\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003e Patan\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. Also known as Lalitpur, this city is the second largest city in the valley. A quieter neighborhood than the capital, Patan is a living cultural destination in your trip. You'll have a visit to the Patan Durbar Square, where full of architectural brilliance and art packed streets wait for you. Explore the Krishna Temple, One of the most eye-catching and religiously essential sculptures of the square. People believe that this vast temple was carved into a single enormous stone. After your experience rich visit, return to your hotel.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"03\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping \\\\u0026 Dakshinkali\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Today you will have an authentic look at the locals of Kathmandu, the Newars. Newari people lived in the place from centuries ago, and one can still see their rich culture and tradition in their architecture and way of living. About 6km from the city to the southern edge of this whole valley, you will reach a small town of Pharping. Famous for their diverse culture and tradition, this suburb city is in the lap of natural scenery. There is a monastery here where people believe that \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Padmasambhava\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eGuru Rinpoche\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e meditated in caves. \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePharping\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is also a gateway to one of the famous Hindu Goddess temple in the whole nation, Dakshinkali. In the way, you can visit the Chovar gorge and beautiful Manjushree park.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou will then visit the historic city of Kritipur. Popular for the Newari neighborhood and their authentic cuisine this place was a separate kingdom before king \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prithvi_Narayan_Shah\\\\u0022\\\\u003eP.N Shah\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e merged Nepal. This city of glory believes in unity, and you can see that in the community festivals when the whole settlement comes together. Walking through the streets, you can explore the ancient Newari architecture of making their houses. The subtle wood carvings people use in their windows, doors, and roof will be a treat for you.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIn \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eKirtipur\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e visit Bagh Bhairab temple, dedicated to the God Bhairab in the form of a tiger. This god is regarded as the guardian of Kirtipur, and the locals call him Ajudeu.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChilancho Stupa\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e: is a Buddhist shrine built in the medieval period. An inscription of Nepal Samvat 635 is found in this Chaitya. Therefore, it is one of the most historical stupas of this region.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eUma Maheshwar\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e: Uma Maheshwar temple (locally, Kwacho Dega) is one of the famous heritage sites of Kirtipur. This pagoda-style three-storied temple is situated at a high hill at 1,414 m of altitude. This site With fabulous views of Kathmandu valley and different mountains ranges towards the north.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eShri Kirti Bihar\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e: a Theravada Buddhist monastery built in traditional Thai architectural style. Located at the entrance to the city, its magnificent architecture is alluring.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter spending some quality time in Kritipur, you will now head towards the beautiful villages of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBungmati and Kokana\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. This village tour is ideal for learning the ancient history and lifestyle of Nepal. These villages have unchanged and undisturbed lifestyle from centuries ago. The majority of people are Newars while other tribesmen also live in perfect harmony here. The monuments here are preserved by the locals, and you can experience the traditional farming and husbandry techniques here. This place is also famous for hand-made garments and organic mustard oil production. You will be gazing at a different Nepal in these places, and the village tour will be a perfect way to end your day as you return to your hotel.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":3,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eFully private trip \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e(even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVehicle fuel, vehicle tax.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking cultural city tour guide.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking Water.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 1 hour\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 2 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "descriptions": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Historical, Cultural, Newari People local lifestyle, Farming activities\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022col-lg-12 info first_para\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nKathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Kritipur, Bungmati, Pharping \\\\u0026amp; Dakshinkali\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"World Heritage sites, Hindu Temples, Buddhist Stupas, History of Newari people and culture ,Local lifestyle, Farming activities\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"There are three principal cities in Kathmandu Valley namely Kathmandu, Patan, and \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eBhaktapur\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e. There are three Durbar (Palace) Squares in these cities under UNESCO Heritage sites, and ultimately these Sites are the living history of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIf you are a traveler with three or more travel days, plan to this itinerary will be most beneficial for you. This tightly managed itinerary doesn’t compromise the quality of your experiences but manages your time and schedule in a way that you will make the most of your Kathmandu visit.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIn the span of a mere three days, you will be experiencing one of the closest encounters with this grand place; its people, their culture, tradition, and religion, and their rich history in a crafted Vessel. You will peek into the lifestyle of locals and try the Newari Cuisines on your journey. The natural sceneries of the rice plantation beyond the green hills with the snowcapped mountains in the distance, be ready to make some boundless memories in Kathmandu.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch4\\\\u003eOutline Itinerary\\\\u003c/h4\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\\\r\\\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) \\\\u0026amp; Bhaktapur, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\\\r\\\\nDay 03: Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping \\\\u0026amp; Dakshinkali Approx: 05 – 06 hrs.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"611\\",\\"610\\",\\"609\\",\\"612\\",\\"4331\\",\\"4030\\",\\"4299\\",\\"3997\\",\\"3942\\",\\"3921\\",\\"836\\",\\"4309\\",\\"4310\\",\\"4311\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"A captivating morning tour with Everest Vacation, our city, and cultural guide will receive you from the hotel in the first hour of the day. You will then start the day with a guided tour of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eKathmandu Durbar Square\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. A place with a stockpile of old history and rich culture, visiting old Royal Durbar Square is experiencing medieval Nepal as a whole.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nOne of the major attraction here was Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu was named) a temple built from the wood of a single tree. Sadly, the temple with a couple of other monuments was destroyed from the earthquake of 2015. However, you can still visit the ruins of these temples. Then you will have a tour of Kumari Goddess Temple (Only living goddess in Nepal). The Divine Goddess is here from her tender age, and she remains in the position until her puberty period. The priests then select the next Goddess to replace her.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWalk around the world famous \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003efreak street,\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e A popular destination in Kathmandu in the early 1960s to ’80s for budget tourist and hippies before Thamel established as a tourist center.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here you will travel towards the western delight of the Valley. Located in the hilltop \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eSwyambhunath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is the oldest shrine of this nation. Attended by Hindus and Buddhists alike this place is an excellent destination for a quick hike and some fresh air.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAbout 2500 years old, Swyambhunath is also the oldest Unesco Heritage site in Nepal. An environment with positive vibes and abundant pilgrims circumambulating the area, you can just feel in the atmosphere all day long. The white dome in the top of the hill is the main structure here. With the abundant population of monkeys residing in the Temple, Swyambhunath area is also popular as 'The Monkey Temple.' From the hilltop, you can enjoy the panoramic view of most parts of Kathmandu and the hills that surround the city. in clear weather you can also view multiple mountain ranges in the far North.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter your lunch, take a short rest and be ready to experience the most significant \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/travel-info/about-hinduisms/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHindu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e temple of Nepal, you head towards the north of the city towards the holy temple of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e in the late afternoon. As Non-Hindu tourists and personnel cant enter the main temple area, you can explore the other monuments and shrines under the vast field of Pashupatinath. Extending in both sides of the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHoly Bagmati\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e river the temple complex has more than 518 temples in a 264-hectare area.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom Pashupatinath, you drive further north-east to reach the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBoudhanath Stupa\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. This stupa is the biggest stupa of Nepal and also listed in the UNESCO world heritage list. Boudhanath is the center of Tibetan Buddhism in Nepal. The majestic architecture of the dome is balanced with the Buddhism vibe going all around it. You can spend some time here Taking sips of Tibetan tea and enjoying the view from one of the rooftop here. You will also get a chance to shop for your souvenirs in the shops surrounding the Stupa.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter the nice refreshing tour of the Heritage and religious sites, return to your hotel and get some rest and refreshments.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"02\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) \\\\u0026 Bhaktapur\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Your morning starts with some hot beverage, and you move to the third major city of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBhaktapur\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. Also known as Bhadgaon(the land of rice), Bhaktapur offers you the less disturbed cultural places in the Valley. Walking through the stone patched streets here you can admire the art form and architecture in every corner. The area is famous for beautiful pottery as well as wood and stone carvings. The significant places not to miss in your visit are The \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBhaktapur Durbar Square\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, Nyatapola Temple square with surrounding temples, Bhaktapur national art gallery and the 55 windows palace.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter your trip, Bhaktapur has lunch and proceed towards the city of arts,\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003e Patan\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. Also known as Lalitpur, this city is the second largest city in the valley. A quieter neighborhood than the capital, Patan is a living cultural destination in your trip. You'll have a visit to the Patan Durbar Square, where full of architectural brilliance and art packed streets wait for you. Explore the Krishna Temple, One of the most eye-catching and religiously essential sculptures of the square. People believe that this vast temple was carved into a single enormous stone. After your experience rich visit, return to your hotel.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"03\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping \\\\u0026 Dakshinkali\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Today you will have an authentic look at the locals of Kathmandu, the Newars. Newari people lived in the place from centuries ago, and one can still see their rich culture and tradition in their architecture and way of living. About 6km from the city to the southern edge of this whole valley, you will reach a small town of Pharping. Famous for their diverse culture and tradition, this suburb city is in the lap of natural scenery. There is a monastery here where people believe that \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Padmasambhava\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eGuru Rinpoche\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e meditated in caves. \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePharping\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is also a gateway to one of the famous Hindu Goddess temple in the whole nation, Dakshinkali. In the way, you can visit the Chovar gorge and beautiful Manjushree park.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou will then visit the historic city of Kritipur. Popular for the Newari neighborhood and their authentic cuisine this place was a separate kingdom before king \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prithvi_Narayan_Shah\\\\u0022\\\\u003eP.N Shah\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e merged Nepal. This city of glory believes in unity, and you can see that in the community festivals when the whole settlement comes together. Walking through the streets, you can explore the ancient Newari architecture of making their houses. The subtle wood carvings people use in their windows, doors, and roof will be a treat for you.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIn \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eKirtipur\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e visit Bagh Bhairab temple, dedicated to the God Bhairab in the form of a tiger. This god is regarded as the guardian of Kirtipur, and the locals call him Ajudeu.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChilancho Stupa\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e: is a Buddhist shrine built in the medieval period. An inscription of Nepal Samvat 635 is found in this Chaitya. Therefore, it is one of the most historical stupas of this region.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eUma Maheshwar\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e: Uma Maheshwar temple (locally, Kwacho Dega) is one of the famous heritage sites of Kirtipur. This pagoda-style three-storied temple is situated at a high hill at 1,414 m of altitude. This site With fabulous views of Kathmandu valley and different mountains ranges towards the north.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eShri Kirti Bihar\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e: a Theravada Buddhist monastery built in traditional Thai architectural style. Located at the entrance to the city, its magnificent architecture is alluring.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter spending some quality time in Kritipur, you will now head towards the beautiful villages of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBungmati and Kokana\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. This village tour is ideal for learning the ancient history and lifestyle of Nepal. These villages have unchanged and undisturbed lifestyle from centuries ago. The majority of people are Newars while other tribesmen also live in perfect harmony here. The monuments here are preserved by the locals, and you can experience the traditional farming and husbandry techniques here. This place is also famous for hand-made garments and organic mustard oil production. You will be gazing at a different Nepal in these places, and the village tour will be a perfect way to end your day as you return to your hotel.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":3,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eFully private trip \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e(even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVehicle fuel, vehicle tax.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking cultural city tour guide.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking Water.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 1 hour\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 2 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/antique-bell.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/local-people-bungmati.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/farming-bungmati.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/dakshinkali-temple.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/kathmandu-tour-nepal.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/suspension-bridge-Taudaha-flat-hike.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/swyambhunath-monkey-temple.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pashupatinath-kathmandu.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Khokana-Taudaha-flat-hike3.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Holi-Festival-Festival-of-Colors-at-Kathmandu-Durbar-Square.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/nala-farming-1.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bhaktapur-tour.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bhaktapur-tour.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bhaktapur-tour-nepal.jpg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=606", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "606", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-02 09:53:31", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-02 09:53:31", "post_modified": "2024-05-17 06:55:38", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-05-17 06:55:38"}}, "customSections": [{"id": 1, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Extended Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["There are three principal cities in Kathmandu Valley namely Kathmandu, Patan, and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>. There are three Durbar (Palace) Squares in these cities under UNESCO Heritage sites, and ultimately these Sites are the living history of <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\">Kathmandu Valley</a>.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you are a traveler with three or more travel days, plan to this itinerary will be most beneficial for you. This tightly managed itinerary doesn’t compromise the quality of your experiences but manages your time and schedule in a way that you will make the most of your Kathmandu visit.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn the span of a mere three days, you will be experiencing one of the closest encounters with this grand place; its people, their culture, tradition, and religion, and their rich history in a crafted Vessel. You will peek into the lifestyle of locals and try the Newari Cuisines on your journey. The natural sceneries of the rice plantation beyond the green hills with the snowcapped mountains in the distance, be ready to make some boundless memories in Kathmandu.\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) &amp; Bhaktapur, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 03: Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping &amp; Dakshinkali Approx: 05 – 06 hrs."], "description": "There are three principal cities in Kathmandu Valley namely Kathmandu, Patan, and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>. There are three Durbar (Palace) Squares in these cities under UNESCO Heritage sites, and ultimately these Sites are the living history of <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\">Kathmandu Valley</a>.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you are a traveler with three or more travel days, plan to this itinerary will be most beneficial for you. This tightly managed itinerary doesn’t compromise the quality of your experiences but manages your time and schedule in a way that you will make the most of your Kathmandu visit.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn the span of a mere three days, you will be experiencing one of the closest encounters with this grand place; its people, their culture, tradition, and religion, and their rich history in a crafted Vessel. You will peek into the lifestyle of locals and try the Newari Cuisines on your journey. The natural sceneries of the rice plantation beyond the green hills with the snowcapped mountains in the distance, be ready to make some boundless memories in Kathmandu.\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan (Lalitpur) &amp; Bhaktapur, approx: 05 – 06 hours.\\r\\nDay 03: Tour of Kirtipur, Khokana, Bungmati, Pharping &amp; Dakshinkali Approx: 05 – 06 hrs."}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Kritipur, Bungmati & Dakshinkali", "trip_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nKathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Kritipur, Bungmati, Pharping &amp; Dakshinkali\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "An interesting 3 Days Kathmandu Cultural tour of historical and cultural landmarks with pleasant scenery with Everest Vacation tour.", "trip_attractions": "World Heritage sites, Hindu Temples, Buddhist Stupas, History of Newari people and culture ,Local lifestyle, Farming activities", "trip_best_season": "Any Season", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "World Heritage sites, Hindu Temples, Buddhist Stupas, History of Newari people and culture ,Local lifestyle, Farming activities", "best_season": "Any Season", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "Historical, Cultural, Newari People local lifestyle, Farming activities"}	2023-12-02 09:53:31+00	2024-05-17 07:55:38+01
158	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Boudhanath, Pashupatinath & Chandragiri hill by cable car", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "1", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "2", "_edit_lock": "1769270039:6", "_dp_original": "538", "_thumbnail_id": "620", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Boudhanath, Pashupatinath & Chandragiri hill by cable car", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "1", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "One day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "One day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "47", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "One Day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills is filled with a tour to phenomenal landmarks, amazing scenery, and mountain vistas.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "one-day-kathmandu-tour-with-chandragiri-hills", "tags": [], "title": "One day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills", "duration": "1 Day", "overview": {"title": "Highlights", "description": "<h4>Phenomenal One Day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills</h4>\\r\\n<div class=\\"item\\">\\r\\n<div id=\\"collapse-1\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-1\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Boudhanath Stupa</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\nEverest Vacation’s guide will pick you up from your hotel and head towards Boudhanath. The biggest stupa in Nepal and the center of Tibetan Buddhism, <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boudhanath\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"><strong>Boudhanath</strong></a> is a peaceful place to spend the evening. You can join the hundreds of devotees circumambulating the premises.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Pashupatinath Temple</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter Boudha Stupa, short drive to Pashupatinath, a Hindu temple. <strong>Pashupatinath</strong>, devoted to the Hindu god of destruction ‘Shiva’ is one of the supreme Hindu shrines in Nepal. The temple complex consists of over 500 small and big shrines, Shiva Lingam, and Chaityas. The main pagoda is two-storeyed with a golden Gajur in it enclosed within four big doors.\\r\\n\\r\\nOn the banks of the holy river Bagmati, this temple is an ideal place to learn about Hindu culture and tradition in the valley. Numerous legends give us the origin of the Temple and its constituent shrines. The temple gets most devotees in the festival of Shiva Ratri from all around the world. You can spend some time in the banks of Bagmati witnessing the <strong>Hindu form of cremation</strong>. A heartwarming scene, teaching you the meaning of life and what comes after.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Chandragiri Hills with Cable Car Ride</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\"item\\">\\r\\n<div id=\\"collapse-2\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-2\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom Patan, we will take a ride to <strong>Chandragiri</strong>. The <strong>day tour of Chandragiri</strong> is a tour packed with spiritual, scenic, and adventurous delights on the western hills surrounding the Kathmandu valley. With majestic views of the Himalayas far in the north and a refreshing breeze embracing you at this natural amphitheater. The drive through the vibrant streets of Kathmandu leads you to the base of this amazing destination. Taking a mesmerizing <strong>cable car ride</strong> over the green hills treating you with waves of unobstructed mountain views escorts you to the <strong>top of Chandragiri Hills</strong>.\\r\\n\\r\\nPerceiving the legends alongside the Hindu devotees, feel the spiritual experiences in the temple of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaleshwor_Mahadev\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaleshwor Mahadev</a>. A family getaway to this panoramic piece of heaven will give you a pristine slice of adventure within a short period. From Everest, Annapurna, and Langtang mountain ranges, to the birds-eye view of Kathmandu Valley, nurse your soul and senses with the <strong>Chandragiri day tour</strong>.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you are looking for a day tour of Kathmandu with nature’s delight in Chandragiri, contact Everest Vacation for your best day tour.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>"}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Boudhanath Stupa, Pashupatinath Temple, Patan Durbar Square & Chandragiri hills in a day", "richText": "Our guide from Everest Vacation will pick you from your hotel or airport. Then after tour of Boudhanath, Pashupatinath &amp; Patan Durbar squre, our guide &amp; driver will start for a relaxed drive (30-40 min<a name=\\"_GoBack\\"></a>) to the foothills of Chandragiri. After reaching Thankot, we will take the cable-car tickets to the top here. This fantastic and scenic ride of about 9-12 minutes will give you a perfect view of the landscape surrounding Chandragiri. We will visit the Bhaleshor temple and the view tower here after arrival. The panoramic view of the Everest, Gaurishankar, Langtang, Annapurna, and other beautiful snow-capped ranges from the hilltop is fantastic. You can enjoy your time here, exploring the area. We will then take the return trip down to Thankot and drive back to your hotel or airport. You'll return with some majestic memories and a step closer to nature from this vacation.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Chandragiri-with-cable-car.jpeg", "title": "Chandragiri-with-cable-car", "altText": "Chandragiri-with-cable-car", "caption": "Chandragiri-with-cable-car", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["625", "542", "620", "622", "621"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "Day tour of Chandragiri Hills with Cable car and Boudhanath, Pashupatinath, Patan Durbar Square", "ws_block_best_season": "Any Season", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "-1", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "What's included?", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-light", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Highlights", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc6695edb31", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_block_video_widgets": "field_63eef38026ee6", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "Private AC Vehicle", "ws_trip_galleries_title": "Photo/Visual Gallery", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "_ws_trip_galleries_title": "field_63ec89128acaa", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "", "ws_trip_information_list": 2, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec90a574f02", "starter_kit_section_title": "Day by Day Activities", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Fully private trip</strong> (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>English speaking cultural city tour guide</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup and drop to your hotel</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<h4>Phenomenal One Day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills</h4>\\r\\n<div class=\\"item\\">\\r\\n<div id=\\"collapse-1\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-1\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Boudhanath Stupa</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\nEverest Vacation’s guide will pick you up from your hotel and head towards Boudhanath. The biggest stupa in Nepal and the center of Tibetan Buddhism, <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boudhanath\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"><strong>Boudhanath</strong></a> is a peaceful place to spend the evening. You can join the hundreds of devotees circumambulating the premises.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Pashupatinath Temple</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter Boudha Stupa, short drive to Pashupatinath, a Hindu temple. <strong>Pashupatinath</strong>, devoted to the Hindu god of destruction ‘Shiva’ is one of the supreme Hindu shrines in Nepal. The temple complex consists of over 500 small and big shrines, Shiva Lingam, and Chaityas. The main pagoda is two-storeyed with a golden Gajur in it enclosed within four big doors.\\r\\n\\r\\nOn the banks of the holy river Bagmati, this temple is an ideal place to learn about Hindu culture and tradition in the valley. Numerous legends give us the origin of the Temple and its constituent shrines. The temple gets most devotees in the festival of Shiva Ratri from all around the world. You can spend some time in the banks of Bagmati witnessing the <strong>Hindu form of cremation</strong>. A heartwarming scene, teaching you the meaning of life and what comes after.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Chandragiri Hills with Cable Car Ride</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\"item\\">\\r\\n<div id=\\"collapse-2\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-2\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom Patan, we will take a ride to <strong>Chandragiri</strong>. The <strong>day tour of Chandragiri</strong> is a tour packed with spiritual, scenic, and adventurous delights on the western hills surrounding the Kathmandu valley. With majestic views of the Himalayas far in the north and a refreshing breeze embracing you at this natural amphitheater. The drive through the vibrant streets of Kathmandu leads you to the base of this amazing destination. Taking a mesmerizing <strong>cable car ride</strong> over the green hills treating you with waves of unobstructed mountain views escorts you to the <strong>top of Chandragiri Hills</strong>.\\r\\n\\r\\nPerceiving the legends alongside the Hindu devotees, feel the spiritual experiences in the temple of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaleshwor_Mahadev\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaleshwor Mahadev</a>. A family getaway to this panoramic piece of heaven will give you a pristine slice of adventure within a short period. From Everest, Annapurna, and Langtang mountain ranges, to the birds-eye view of Kathmandu Valley, nurse your soul and senses with the <strong>Chandragiri day tour</strong>.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you are looking for a day tour of Kathmandu with nature’s delight in Chandragiri, contact Everest Vacation for your best day tour.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "field_63ec96f1878e1", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel": "", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title": "Boudhanath Stupa, Pashupatinath Temple, Patan Durbar Square & Chandragiri hills in a day", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "Extended Tours", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title": "Alternate Tours", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "field_63ec91180462f", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title": "field_63ec91180462f", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "Our guide from Everest Vacation will pick you from your hotel or airport. Then after tour of Boudhanath, Pashupatinath &amp; Patan Durbar squre, our guide &amp; driver will start for a relaxed drive (30-40 min<a name=\\"_GoBack\\"></a>) to the foothills of Chandragiri. After reaching Thankot, we will take the cable-car tickets to the top here. This fantastic and scenic ride of about 9-12 minutes will give you a perfect view of the landscape surrounding Chandragiri. We will visit the Bhaleshor temple and the view tower here after arrival. The panoramic view of the Everest, Gaurishankar, Langtang, Annapurna, and other beautiful snow-capped ranges from the hilltop is fantastic. You can enjoy your time here, exploring the area. We will then take the return trip down to Thankot and drive back to your hotel or airport. You'll return with some majestic memories and a step closer to nature from this vacation.", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/heli-flight-from-pokhara-to-annapurna-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Annapurna Base Camp</a> - 1-1:30 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/1-day-kathmandu-sightseeing-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\">1 day Cultural Tour only in Kathmandu Valley</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\">1 day Hiking trip in Kathmandu Valley (3 hours to 5 hours)</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "One day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Day tour of Chandragiri Hills with Cable car and Boudhanath, Pashupatinath, Patan Durbar Square\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Highlights\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003ch4\\\\u003ePhenomenal One Day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills\\\\u003c/h4\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022item\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv id=\\\\u0022collapse-1\\\\u0022 class=\\\\u0022panel-collapse collapse show\\\\u0022 role=\\\\u0022tabpanel\\\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\\\u0022heading-1\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBoudhanath Stupa\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nEverest Vacation’s guide will pick you up from your hotel and head towards Boudhanath. The biggest stupa in Nepal and the center of Tibetan Buddhism, \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boudhanath\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBoudhanath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e is a peaceful place to spend the evening. You can join the hundreds of devotees circumambulating the premises.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath Temple\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter Boudha Stupa, short drive to Pashupatinath, a Hindu temple. \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, devoted to the Hindu god of destruction ‘Shiva’ is one of the supreme Hindu shrines in Nepal. The temple complex consists of over 500 small and big shrines, Shiva Lingam, and Chaityas. The main pagoda is two-storeyed with a golden Gajur in it enclosed within four big doors.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nOn the banks of the holy river Bagmati, this temple is an ideal place to learn about Hindu culture and tradition in the valley. Numerous legends give us the origin of the Temple and its constituent shrines. The temple gets most devotees in the festival of Shiva Ratri from all around the world. You can spend some time in the banks of Bagmati witnessing the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHindu form of cremation\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. A heartwarming scene, teaching you the meaning of life and what comes after.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChandragiri Hills with Cable Car Ride\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022item\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv id=\\\\u0022collapse-2\\\\u0022 class=\\\\u0022panel-collapse collapse show\\\\u0022 role=\\\\u0022tabpanel\\\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\\\u0022heading-2\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom Patan, we will take a ride to \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChandragiri\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. The \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eday tour of Chandragiri\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is a tour packed with spiritual, scenic, and adventurous delights on the western hills surrounding the Kathmandu valley. With majestic views of the Himalayas far in the north and a refreshing breeze embracing you at this natural amphitheater. The drive through the vibrant streets of Kathmandu leads you to the base of this amazing destination. Taking a mesmerizing \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ecable car ride\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e over the green hills treating you with waves of unobstructed mountain views escorts you to the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003etop of Chandragiri Hills\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nPerceiving the legends alongside the Hindu devotees, feel the spiritual experiences in the temple of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaleshwor_Mahadev\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eBhaleshwor Mahadev\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e. A family getaway to this panoramic piece of heaven will give you a pristine slice of adventure within a short period. From Everest, Annapurna, and Langtang mountain ranges, to the birds-eye view of Kathmandu Valley, nurse your soul and senses with the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChandragiri day tour\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIf you are looking for a day tour of Kathmandu with nature’s delight in Chandragiri, contact Everest Vacation for your best day tour.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"625\\",\\"542\\",\\"620\\",\\"622\\",\\"621\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Boudhanath Stupa, Pashupatinath Temple, Patan Durbar Square \\\\u0026 Chandragiri hills in a day\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Our guide from Everest Vacation will pick you from your hotel or airport. Then after tour of Boudhanath, Pashupatinath \\\\u0026amp; Patan Durbar squre, our guide \\\\u0026amp; driver will start for a relaxed drive (30-40 min\\\\u003ca name=\\\\u0022_GoBack\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e) to the foothills of Chandragiri. After reaching Thankot, we will take the cable-car tickets to the top here. This fantastic and scenic ride of about 9-12 minutes will give you a perfect view of the landscape surrounding Chandragiri. We will visit the Bhaleshor temple and the view tower here after arrival. The panoramic view of the Everest, Gaurishankar, Langtang, Annapurna, and other beautiful snow-capped ranges from the hilltop is fantastic. You can enjoy your time here, exploring the area. We will then take the return trip down to Thankot and drive back to your hotel or airport. You'll return with some majestic memories and a step closer to nature from this vacation.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eFully private trip\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking cultural city tour guide\\\\u003c/li