ps://everestnepaltours.com/heli-flight-from-pokhara-to-annapurna-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Annapurna Base Camp\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 1-1:30 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 2 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"Alternate Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/1-day-kathmandu-sightseeing-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003e1 day Cultural Tour only in Kathmandu Valley\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003e1 day Hiking trip in Kathmandu Valley (3 hours to 5 hours)\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":2,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "descriptions": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Day tour of Chandragiri Hills with Cable car and Boudhanath, Pashupatinath, Patan Durbar Square\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Highlights\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003ch4\\\\u003ePhenomenal One Day Kathmandu Tour with Chandragiri Hills\\\\u003c/h4\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022item\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv id=\\\\u0022collapse-1\\\\u0022 class=\\\\u0022panel-collapse collapse show\\\\u0022 role=\\\\u0022tabpanel\\\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\\\u0022heading-1\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBoudhanath Stupa\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nEverest Vacation’s guide will pick you up from your hotel and head towards Boudhanath. The biggest stupa in Nepal and the center of Tibetan Buddhism, \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boudhanath\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBoudhanath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e is a peaceful place to spend the evening. You can join the hundreds of devotees circumambulating the premises.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath Temple\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter Boudha Stupa, short drive to Pashupatinath, a Hindu temple. \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, devoted to the Hindu god of destruction ‘Shiva’ is one of the supreme Hindu shrines in Nepal. The temple complex consists of over 500 small and big shrines, Shiva Lingam, and Chaityas. The main pagoda is two-storeyed with a golden Gajur in it enclosed within four big doors.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nOn the banks of the holy river Bagmati, this temple is an ideal place to learn about Hindu culture and tradition in the valley. Numerous legends give us the origin of the Temple and its constituent shrines. The temple gets most devotees in the festival of Shiva Ratri from all around the world. You can spend some time in the banks of Bagmati witnessing the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHindu form of cremation\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. A heartwarming scene, teaching you the meaning of life and what comes after.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChandragiri Hills with Cable Car Ride\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv class=\\\\u0022item\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cdiv id=\\\\u0022collapse-2\\\\u0022 class=\\\\u0022panel-collapse collapse show\\\\u0022 role=\\\\u0022tabpanel\\\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\\\u0022heading-2\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom Patan, we will take a ride to \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChandragiri\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e. The \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eday tour of Chandragiri\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is a tour packed with spiritual, scenic, and adventurous delights on the western hills surrounding the Kathmandu valley. With majestic views of the Himalayas far in the north and a refreshing breeze embracing you at this natural amphitheater. The drive through the vibrant streets of Kathmandu leads you to the base of this amazing destination. Taking a mesmerizing \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ecable car ride\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e over the green hills treating you with waves of unobstructed mountain views escorts you to the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003etop of Chandragiri Hills\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nPerceiving the legends alongside the Hindu devotees, feel the spiritual experiences in the temple of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaleshwor_Mahadev\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eBhaleshwor Mahadev\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e. A family getaway to this panoramic piece of heaven will give you a pristine slice of adventure within a short period. From Everest, Annapurna, and Langtang mountain ranges, to the birds-eye view of Kathmandu Valley, nurse your soul and senses with the \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eChandragiri day tour\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nIf you are looking for a day tour of Kathmandu with nature’s delight in Chandragiri, contact Everest Vacation for your best day tour.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"625\\",\\"542\\",\\"620\\",\\"622\\",\\"621\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Boudhanath Stupa, Pashupatinath Temple, Patan Durbar Square \\\\u0026 Chandragiri hills in a day\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Our guide from Everest Vacation will pick you from your hotel or airport. Then after tour of Boudhanath, Pashupatinath \\\\u0026amp; Patan Durbar squre, our guide \\\\u0026amp; driver will start for a relaxed drive (30-40 min\\\\u003ca name=\\\\u0022_GoBack\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e) to the foothills of Chandragiri. After reaching Thankot, we will take the cable-car tickets to the top here. This fantastic and scenic ride of about 9-12 minutes will give you a perfect view of the landscape surrounding Chandragiri. We will visit the Bhaleshor temple and the view tower here after arrival. The panoramic view of the Everest, Gaurishankar, Langtang, Annapurna, and other beautiful snow-capped ranges from the hilltop is fantastic. You can enjoy your time here, exploring the area. We will then take the return trip down to Thankot and drive back to your hotel or airport. You'll return with some majestic memories and a step closer to nature from this vacation.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\