ours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["<strong>The<a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nepal\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"> Nepal</a> Honeymoon tour</strong> is the best trip for a newly-wedded couple to get to know each other and make the best memories of their life. So this <strong>7-day romantic honeymoon tour</strong> of Everest Vacation offers a busy life to disappear in the cultural monuments, with local people and the natural beauty of the mountain ranges to enjoy your <strong>honeymoon trip</strong>.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Activities</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Explore <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\">Kathmandu City</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Everest Mountain Flight or Helicopter Tour (optional) and Bhaktapur and Nagarkot Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Chitwan Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pokhara Tour</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Kathmandu Tour\\r\\nDay 02: Mountain flight or Helicopter tour to Mt. Everest (Optional) | Kathmandu Nagarkot Hill Tour\\r\\nDay 03: Nagarkot Sunrise and drive Kathmandu to Chitwan\\r\\nDay 04: Chitwan National Park Tour\\r\\nDay 05: Chitwan to Pokhara\\r\\nDay 06: Pokhara Sighseeing Tour with Sarangkot\\r\\nDay 07: Pokhara to Kathmandu"], "description": "<strong>The<a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nepal\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"> Nepal</a> Honeymoon tour</strong> is the best trip for a newly-wedded couple to get to know each other and make the best memories of their life. So this <strong>7-day romantic honeymoon tour</strong> of Everest Vacation offers a busy life to disappear in the cultural monuments, with local people and the natural beauty of the mountain ranges to enjoy your <strong>honeymoon trip</strong>.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Activities</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Explore <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\">Kathmandu City</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Everest Mountain Flight or Helicopter Tour (optional) and Bhaktapur and Nagarkot Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Chitwan Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pokhara Tour</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<h4>Outline Itinerary</h4>\\r\\nDay 01: Kathmandu Tour\\r\\nDay 02: Mountain flight or Helicopter tour to Mt. Everest (Optional) | Kathmandu Nagarkot Hill Tour\\r\\nDay 03: Nagarkot Sunrise and drive Kathmandu to Chitwan\\r\\nDay 04: Chitwan National Park Tour\\r\\nDay 05: Chitwan to Pokhara\\r\\nDay 06: Pokhara Sighseeing Tour with Sarangkot\\r\\nDay 07: Pokhara to Kathmandu"}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Kathmandu, Nagarkot, Pokhara and Chitwan National Park with adventure sports", "trip_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nThis exclusive honeymoon tour, we offer you by a professional guide and driver and cover cultural world heritage sites of Kathmandu valley, Nagarkot view point with sunrise and sunset, Mt. Everest view by mountain flight or helicopter, Chitwan National park, scenic highway driving along side of Trisuli river, Pokhara and Sarangkot.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "Nepal Honeymoon tour is the best trip in the beautiful vicinity for a newly-wedded couple to make the best memories of their life.", "trip_attractions": "Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath, Bouddhanath, Bhaktapur, Nagarkot, Chitwan (wildlife tour and jungle safari ), Pokhara (sunrise tour at Sarangkot, Cave, Waterfalls, boating, temple)", "trip_best_season": "Any Season", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "Meals, as your choice", "start_end": "", "attractions": "Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath, Bouddhanath, Bhaktapur, Nagarkot, Chitwan (wildlife tour and jungle safari ), Pokhara (sunrise tour at Sarangkot, Cave, Waterfalls, boating, temple)", "best_season": "Any Season", "accommodation": "Hotels, as your choice", "max_elevation": "2175 meters", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_accommodation": "Hotels, as your choice", "trip_max_elevation": "2175 meters", "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "7 days exclusive and romantic honeymoon tour with Kathmandu Nagarkot Chitwan & Pokhara"}	2023-12-03 07:13:09+00	2024-05-17 08:26:04+01
165	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "15", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Challenging"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "5", "_edit_lock": "1707376210:5", "_dp_original": "751", "_thumbnail_id": "757", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "15", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Everest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Everest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "44", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "The Everest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek via Chola Pass is a challenging 15-day trek in the Everest region which is full of adventure.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Challenging", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "everest-base-camp-and-gokyo-lake-trek-via-chola-pass", "tags": [], "title": "Everest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek", "duration": "15 Days", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "The <strong>Everest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek via Chola Pass</strong> is a challenging 15-day trek in the Everest region which is full of adventure. A once-in-a-lifetime experience for trekkers seeking a daring trek in the Everest region. The prime highlight of this trek is to cross Cho La Pass at an elevation of 5,420m. Along with it, exploring serene Gokyo Lake, hiking to iconic Everest Base Camp, and Kalapatthar for the close-up views of <strong>Mt. Everest, Nuptse, Lhotse, <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cho_Oyu\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Cho Oyu</a></strong>, etc. and immersing in local Sherpa culture is full of unique experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\nTrekking at such high altitudes on the rugged trail is challenging but experiencing such adventure in the vicinity of the Everest region is a dream come true for many trekkers. Walk past diverse vegetation in the surroundings of <strong>Sagarmatha National Park</strong> relishing the towering peaks in the background. Explore the Gokyo Lake and its surroundings, traverse Cho La Pass, and witness the awesome <strong>Gokyo Valley</strong> and peaks like <strong>Cho Oyu, Pumori</strong>, etc."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Fly to Lukla and trek to Phakding", "richText": "", "driveTime": "3 hours", "elevation": "2652m/8699ft", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 2, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Namche Bazaar", "richText": "", "driveTime": "6 hours", "elevation": "3440m/11283ft", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 3, "meal": "", "title": "Namche Bazar – Everest View Hotel", "richText": "", "driveTime": "3 hours", "elevation": "3880 m", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 4, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Tengboche", "richText": "", "driveTime": "5 hours", "elevation": "3860m/12660ft", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 5, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Dingboche", "richText": "", "driveTime": "5 hours", "elevation": "4410m/14464ft", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 6, "meal": "", "title": "Dingboche to Nagerjun and return", "richText": "", "driveTime": "3 hours", "elevation": "5100m/16728ft", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 7, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Lobuche", "richText": "", "driveTime": "5 hours", "elevation": "4910m/16105ft", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 8, "meal": "", "title": "Trek 