on_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_13_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_14_ws_itinerary_description": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_13_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_14_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Everest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"The Everest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek via Chola Pass is an adventurous 15-day trek in the Everest region offering once in a lifetime experience for trekkers. Crossing the Chola Pass (5,420m), exploring tranquil Gokyo Lake, hiking to iconic Everest Base Camp, and Kalapatthar for the close-up views of Mt. Everest, Nuptse, Lhotse, Cho Oyu, etc. and immersing in local Sherpa culture is great fun.\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"5,420m\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Everest Base Camp, Gokyo Lake,  Kalapatthar\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"All season except December \\\\u0026 January\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"The \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eEverest Base Camp and Gokyo Lake trek via Chola Pass\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is a challenging 15-day trek in the Everest region which is full of adventure. A once-in-a-lifetime experience for trekkers seeking a daring trek in the Everest region. The prime highlight of this trek is to cross Cho La Pass at an elevation of 5,420m. Along with it, exploring serene Gokyo Lake, hiking to iconic Everest Base Camp, and Kalapatthar for the close-up views of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eMt. Everest, Nuptse, Lhotse, \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cho_Oyu\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eCho Oyu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, etc. and immersing in local Sherpa culture is full of unique experiences.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nTrekking at such high altitudes on the rugged trail is challenging but experiencing such adventure in the vicinity of the Everest region is a dream come true for many trekkers. Walk past diverse vegetation in the surroundings of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eSagarmatha National Park\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e relishing the towering peaks in the background. Explore the Gokyo Lake and its surroundings, traverse Cho La Pass, and witness the awesome \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eGokyo Valley\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e and peaks like \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eCho Oyu, Pumori\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, etc.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":