ring monsoon season as well.\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"3,850m\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Caves, and old Buddhist monasteries\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"Teahouse\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Flight / Private Vechile\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"Kathmandu\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eUpper Mustang Trek\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is a 13-day challenging trek in the rain-shadow area of Nepal that is full of adventure unlike anything out there. Upper Mustang is settled in the majestic Himalayas of Nepal bordering with Tibet in the north. Upper Mustang Trek offers an exceptional adventure with its desert-like landscapes, ancient caves, and old Buddhist monasteries. The ancient kingdom of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lo_Manthang_Palace\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eLo-Manthang\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, numerous caves, grand mountain peaks, centuries-old art, culture, and traditional lifestyle, and locals are major attractions during this trek.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe Adventurous Upper Mustang trek journey begins with a scenic Jomsom flight and a trek to Kagbeni. Navigate through the amazing settlements of Chele, Geling, Tsarang, Lo-Manthang, Dhakmar, and Jomsom admiring scenic landscapes. Throughout the trek, experience the beauty of this least-explored region. This trek is possible in Monsoon as this region expects less or no rainfall. Witness the incredible views of Annapurna (8,091), Annapurna II, Annapurna IV, Thorung Peak, Nilgiri, Chulu West, Chulu East, Tukuche Peak, Dhaulagiri, and Lamjung Himal during this trek. This trek is full of worth to create everlasting memories with family and friends.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"4077\\",\\"4071\\",\\"4059\\",\\"3963\\",\\"3962\\",\\"3888\\",\\"4004\\",\\"4000\\",\\"3885\\",\\"803\\",\\"706\\",\\"708\\",