":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eMardi Himal trekking\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e at an elevation of 4,500m in the vicinity of the Annapurna region is a newly opened popular trekking route. The best alternative route for trekkers looking for a new adventure in the Annapurna region besides the famous Annapurna Base camp or Ghorepani Poon Hill trek. Walk past beautiful trails of rhododendron forest during the spring season, scenic landscapes, and charming villages.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThere is a good accommodation facility during the trek despite being a newly opened trek. This trek takes you to numerous villages such as Dhampus, Forest Camp, High Camp, and Sidhing. The locals, their culture, lifestyle, food, and warm hospitality are major attractions of the Mardi trek. Enjoy the stunning views of towering peaks such as Mardi (5,587m), \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machapuchare\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMachhapuchhre\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, Annapurna I, Annapurna South, Dhaulagiri, and other surrounding peaks.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Mardi Himal Trekking\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_inform