t Tour - 4 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"Alternate Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu \\\\u0026amp; Pokhara\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":2,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/nagarkot-hike.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/nala-farming.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/nagarkot-hill-hiking.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/changunarayan-temple.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/nagarkot-evening.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-view-from-nagarkot.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/sunset-from-kathmandu.jpeg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=861", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "861", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-05 06:56:15", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-05 06:56:15", "post_modified": "2024-02-13 05:55:55", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-02-13 05:55:55"}}, "customSections": [{"id": 1, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Extended Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour - 2 days</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour - 2 days</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": 2, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Alternate Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["A great to escape the hustle and bustle of Kathmandu city for a day, Everest Vacation provides Changunarayan to Nagarkot Hill Hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley. A day hike of 3-4 hours to a famous tourist spot at <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nagarkot-sunrise-tour-day-hiking/\\">Nagarkot</a> with an elevation of 2,100 meters high to the top of Nagarkot where stands the view and observatory tower.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting with a short drive from Kathmandu leading North East on the good road passing interesting villages and towns of Thimi and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur_District\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>. Then, head for a climb with tremendous views of Bhaktapur city, green farmlands, and spread-out farm villages. After an hour’s climb on the narrow winding road reaching a small medieval period Newari village as it was for the past many centuries. At Changunarayan, take a short walk on steps with many small souvenir shops and restaurants leading into the old temple complex. Changunarayan is a unique ancient temple and one of the oldest in Nepal with a history that dates back to the Lichhavi period.\\r\\n\\r\\nChangu Narayan temple, perched on a hill placed in World Cultural Heritage Sites, is a scenic spot situated at an altitude of about 1,700 meters, just north of Bhaktapur. The temple is believed to be the oldest of all the temples in Nepal. It is said to have been built by King Hari Datta Verma in 323 A.D. And most authentic inscription located in Changu Narayan dates back to 464 AD it is endorsed to the King Lichhavi King Mandeva.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a wonderful time here a nice walk in tranquil surroundings with wonderful woodlands of pines and rhododendron trees and reach a small farm village of Telkot. From here, climb on the steps for an hour to reach a nice area with Shiva temple. After a brief stop, and another 2 hours climb through rural farm areas and villages and reach at famous viewpoint of Nagarkot after completing this nice day walk.\\r\\n\\r\\nNagarkot is located 30 km to the east of Kathmandu on the valley rim. Nagarkot is the favorite weekend gateway for those who seek Himalayan Scenery and rural serenity. From Nagarkot, you witness the stunning view of mountains that extend from Dhaulagiri in the west past Mt. Everest to Kanchenjunga in the east. The surrounding countryside of Nagarkot is great for walking.\\r\\n\\r\\nNagarkot is situated at an elevation of (2,175 m.) and provides a grandstand panorama of the Himalayas. You can see five of the world’s tallest mountains – Everest (8,848m.), Lhotse (8,516m.), Cho Oyu (8,201m.), Makalu (8,463m.) – and many other lesser summits. The snow peaks look especially gorgeous during sunset and sunrise.\\r\\n\\r\\nNagarkot, surrounded by terraced hillsides and picturesque farmhouses, the hilltop resort is a great escape to enjoy the natural peaceful surroundings. At Nagarkot optional overnight stop or drive back to Kathmandu the same day with a tour of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>."], "description": "A great to escape the hustle and bustle of Kathmandu city for a day, Everest Vacation provides Changunarayan to Nagarkot Hill Hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley. A day hike of 3-4 hours to a famous tourist spot at <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nagarkot-sunrise-tour-day-hiking/\\">Nagarkot</a> with an elevation of 2,100 meters high to the top of Nagarkot where stands the view and observatory tower.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting with a short drive from Kathmandu leading North East on the good road passing interesting villages and towns of Thimi and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur_District\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>. Then, head for a climb with tremendous views of Bhaktapur city, green farmlands, and spread-out farm villages. After an hour’s climb on the narrow winding road reaching a small medieval period Newari village as it was for the past many centuries. At Changunarayan, take a short walk on steps with many small souvenir shops and restaurants leading into the old temple complex. Changunarayan is a unique ancient temple and one of the oldest in Nepal with a history that dates back to the Lichhavi period.\\r\\n\\r\\nChangu Narayan temple, perched on a hill placed in World Cultural Heritage Sites, is a scenic spot situated at an altitude of about 1,700 meters, just north of Bhaktapur. The temple is believed to be the oldest of all the temples in Nepal. It is said to have been built by King Hari Datta Verma in 323 A.D. And most authentic inscription located in Changu Narayan dates back to 464 AD it is endorsed to the King Lichhavi King Mandeva.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a wonderful time here a nice walk in tranquil surroundings with wonderful woodlands of pines and rhododendron trees and reach a small farm village of Telkot. From here, climb on the steps for an hour to reach a nice area with Shiva temple. After a brief stop, and another 2 hours climb through rural farm areas and villages and reach at famous viewpoint of Nagarkot after completing this nice day walk.\\r\\n\\r\\nNagarkot is located 30 km to the east of Kathmandu on the valley rim. Nagarkot is the favorite weekend gateway for those who seek Himalayan Scenery and rural serenity. From Nagarkot, you witness the stunning view of mountains that extend from Dhaulagiri in the west past Mt. Everest to Kanchenjunga in the east. The surrounding countryside of Nagarkot is great for walking.\\r\\n\\r\\nNagarkot is situated at an elevation of (2,175 m.) and provides a grandstand panorama of the Himalayas. You can see five of the world’s tallest mountains – Everest (8,848m.), Lhotse (8,516m.), Cho Oyu (8,201m.), Makalu (8,463m.) – and many other lesser summits. The snow peaks look especially gorgeous during sunset and sunrise.\\r\\n\\r\\nNagarkot, surrounded by terraced hillsides and picturesque farmhouses, the hilltop resort is a great escape to enjoy the natural peaceful surroundings. At Nagarkot optional overnight stop or drive back to Kathmandu the same day with a tour of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhaktapur\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Bhaktapur</a>."}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition", "English speaking cultural city tour guide", "Pickup and drop to your hotel"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition", "English speaking cultural city tour guide", "Pickup and drop to your hotel"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Explore Changunarayan to Nagarkot Hill Hiking with Everest Vacation.", "trip_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nEmbark on a delightful single day tour of Kathmandu and explore the fascinating historical and cultural landmarks listed as UNESCO World Heritage Sites. Immerse yourself in the rich history, vibrant culture, diverse religion, delectable Nepalese cuisine, and local lifestyle, all with the guidance of our expert travel guides from Nepal.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "trip_type_level": "Easy", "meta_description": "Everest Vacation provides Changunarayan to Nagarkot Hill Hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley.", "trip_attractions": "Changunaryan, Nagarkot Hill", "trip_best_season": "Any Season", "faq_section_title": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "Changunaryan, Nagarkot Hill", "best_season": "Any Season", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "Kathmandu Nepal tour with World Heritage Sites by UNESCO"}	2023-12-05 06:56:15+00	2024-02-13 05:55:55+00
181	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "80", "ws_short_desc": "", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "100", "ws_number_of_days": "1", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Easy"}, "faq": [{"answer": "- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\r\\n\\r\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\r\\n\\r\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.", "question": "1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?"}, {"answer": "All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.", "question": "2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?"}, {"answer": "Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.", "question": "3. How to find & book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?"}, {"answer": "Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.", "question": "4. How is the weather like in Nepal?"}, {"answer": "Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\r\\n\\r\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\r\\n\\r\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\r\\n\\r\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.", "question": "5. What to expect on tours?"}], "meta": {"_edit_last": "5", "_edit_lock": "1707468682:5", "_dp_original": "861", "_thumbnail_id": "4246", "ws_sale_price": "80", "ws_short_desc": "", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "100", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "1", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "49", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking is a day hike of 3-4 hours to the famous tourist spot with a fabulous view range of snow-capped mountains.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Easy", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "namobuddha-hiking", "tags": [], "title": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking", "duration": "1 Day", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "A great to escape the hustle and bustle of Kathmandu city for a day, Everest Vacation provides Namobudhha hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley. Namobuddha Hiking is a day hike of 3-4 hours to the famous tourist spot with a fabulous view range of snow-capped mountains from Ganesh-Langtang-Jugal Himal, Gaurishankar, etc.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting with a short drive from <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-multi-day-tours/\\">Kathmandu</a> leading North East on the good road passing interesting villages and towns of Thimi and Bhaktapur. Then, heading for a climb to Sanga past Bhaktapur with green farmlands and spread out farm villages. After a few hour’s drive reach, the hill town of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhulikhel\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Dhulikhel</a> famous for its mountain panorama.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom here, take the off-trail away from the motor road to reach holy Namobuddha. A serene environment surrounded by terraced hillsides and picturesque farmhouses. An interesting hike with great views passing several scattered farmhouses and villages.\\r\\n\\r\\nThen, reach Namobuddha located in the serene environment a truly holy place. One of the main sacred sites known as  Nepal’s <em>three Stupas</em> is Tagmo Lüjin (meaning “The place where the future Buddha sacrificed his body to a tigress”). It is a holy site where the perfect and supreme Buddha-at that time still on the path of learning his own body without regret to a tigress suffering from hunger.\\r\\n\\r\\nHere visit several monasteries and great stupas (Buddhist dome monument) and drive back to Kathmandu (optional overnight stop at Dhulikhel) after a great Namobuddha Hiking (day hike) in a complete natural holy Buddhist environment."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Namobuddha Hiking", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Namo-Buddha-Panauti.jpg", "title": "Namo-Buddha-Panauti", "altText": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking", "caption": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["868", "863", "864", "738"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec