nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"A great to escape the hustle and bustle of Kathmandu city for a day, Everest Vacation provides Namobudhha hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley. Namobuddha Hiking is a day hike of 3-4 hours to the famous tourist spot with a fabulous view range of snow-capped mountains from Ganesh-Langtang-Jugal Himal, Gaurishankar, etc.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nStarting with a short drive from \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-multi-day-tours/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e leading North East on the good road passing interesting villages and towns of Thimi and Bhaktapur. Then, heading for a climb to Sanga past Bhaktapur with green farmlands and spread out farm villages. After a few hour’s drive reach, the hill town of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhulikhel\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eDhulikhel\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e famous for its mountain panorama.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here, take the off-trail away from the motor road to reach holy Namobuddha. A serene environment surrounded by terraced hillsides and picturesque farmhouses. An interesting hike with great views passing several scattered farmhouses and villages.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThen, reach Namobuddha located in the serene environment a truly holy place. One of the main sacred sites known as  Nepal’s \\\\u003cem\\\\u003ethree Stupas\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e is Tagmo Lüjin (meaning “The place where the future Buddha sacrificed his body to a tigress”). It is a holy site where the perfect and supreme Buddha-at that time still on the path of learning his own body without regret to a tigress suffering from hunger.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nHere visit several monasteries and great stupas (Buddhist dome monument) and drive back to Kathmandu (optional overnight stop at Dhulikhel) after a great Namobuddha Hiking (day hike) in a complete natural holy Buddhist environment.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"868\\",\\"863\\",\\"864\\",\\"738\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Namobuddha Hiking\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eFully private trip\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking cultural city tour guide\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePickup and drop to your hotel\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ede33e5764a\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_641162e6b5849\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"field_63ede33e5b304\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"3. How to find \\\\u0026 book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"4. How is the weather like in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"5. What to expect on tours?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":5,\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":\\"field_63ede38e351c7\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour - 2 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"Alternate Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu \\\\u0026amp; Pokhara\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":2,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "descriptions": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"A great to escape the hustle and bustle of Kathmandu city for a day, Everest Vacation provides Namobudhha hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley. Namobuddha Hiking is a day hike of 3-4 hours to the famous tourist spot with a fabulous view range of snow-capped mountains from Ganesh-Langtang-Jugal Himal, Gaurishankar, etc.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nStarting with a short drive from \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-multi-day-tours/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e leading North East on the good road passing interesting villages and towns of Thimi and Bhaktapur. Then, heading for a climb to Sanga past Bhaktapur with green farmlands and spread out farm villages. After a few hour’s drive reach, the hill town of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhulikhel\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eDhulikhel\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e famous for its mountain panorama.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here, take the off-trail away from the motor road to reach holy Namobuddha. A serene environment surrounded by terraced hillsides and picturesque farmhouses. An interesting hike with great views passing several scattered farmhouses and villages.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThen, reach Namobuddha located in the serene environment a truly holy place. One of the main sacred sites known as  Nepal’s \\\\u003cem\\\\u003ethree Stupas\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e is Tagmo Lüjin (meaning “The place where the future Buddha sacrificed his body to a tigress”). It is a holy site where the perfect and supreme Buddha-at that time still on the path of learning his own body without regret to a tigress suffering from hunger.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nHere visit several monasteries and great stupas (Buddhist dome monument) and drive back to Kathmandu (optional overnight stop at Dhulikhel) after a great Namobuddha Hiking (day hike) in a complete natural holy Buddhist environment.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"868\\",\\"863\\",\\"864\\",\\"738\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Namobuddha Hiking\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eFully private trip\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eEnglish speaking cultural city tour guide\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePickup and drop to your hotel\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-faqs\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ede33e5764a\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_641162e6b5849\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_section_title\\":\\"field_63ede33e5b304\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"1. How can I Reach Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"- You can enter Kathmandu by international flight from Europe and other parts of Asia, Australia and USA with stopover and transit on route flight to reaching Kathmandu (Tribhuvan International airport),\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- Overland from Delhi, Sikkim, and Darjeeling from India\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n- To enter from China catch a flight or train to Lhasa (Tibet) and then drive/fly to Kathmandu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_0_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"2. How to get Visa for Kathmandu?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"All valid Passports are required with a proper visa for you to enter Nepal. Visa can be obtained from your countries through Nepal Embassy and Consulate, or one can get a permit on arrival at any port of entry at the border or Kathmandu international airport. Minimum visa of a week and a maximum of 1 month can be obtained from here. If you urge to elongate the stay, your visa extension can be done for an extra cost per day or week basis.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_1_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"3. How to find \\\\u0026 book a good and reliable travel agents in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"Most of the travel agents in Nepal, especially in Kathmandu and other touristic areas, are reliable and certified by the government. Some of these agencies have been running for more than a decade with the utmost experience in travel line. However, as per your taste and duration in Nepal, you can book with us as we provide topnotch services with a flexible period of your journey.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWe have an expert knowledgeable local guide with complete training and experience in culture, history of the destination you will visit. With us, you will be able to experience the destinations to your fullest without missing a thing. We keep in touch with you throughout your journey till your departure and aid you in your tour. Similarly, we have a wide range of transport vehicles for your ease and a standby team for any complications during your trip.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_2_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"4. How is the weather like in Nepal?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"Nepal has four seasons including the monsoon (wet months). The climate is not too cold in winter and mildly hot in summer. The country experiences a moderate climate in every other time of the year.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nYou can experience the destinations differently in each weather, and the memories will be equally delightful. As for sightseeing and cultural tour, You can visit this country at any time of the year. However, the best time will be from the month of March to May and October to November when the views are clear especially of the high snow-capped mountain range.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_3_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"5. What to expect on tours?\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faq_title\\":\\"field_63ede3af351c8\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"Depending upon the duration and area of your tours, you can expect something new in every destination. Nepal will surprise you with delights as this place is like no other when it comes to traveling. Famous for numerous historical, cultural monuments which are mostly listed in World Heritage Sites by UNESCO, Nepal is a travel lover's Zion.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal is a melting pot of Hindu and Buddhist with small minority of Islamic, Christians, Jain and Sikh religions.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMost of the monuments temples and monasteries are of Hindu and Buddhist religions, other places of interest are old historical Durbar squares as the palaces of former kings.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNepal embraces you with its unique Himalayan setting full of mountains, rivers, and thick jungles as well. One can take an elephant safari in one most famous national park of Chitwan to observe wildlife and nature from close. Rare Royal Bengal Tiger, one-horned rhinoceros many different types of deer and other wildlife and 700 species of exotic birds live in these jungles.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe other experience of Nepal is its panoramic scene of snow-capped mountains in the comfort of nice and cozy hotels and resorts and with the warm hospitality of native villagers in homestay facilities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWhatever your taste and interest are? Nepal is an amazing country with everything you would want in a travel destination.\\",\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists_4_faqs_description\\":\\"field_63ede3bf351c9\\",\\"ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":5,\\"_ws_trip_faqs_lists\\":\\"field_63ede38e351c7\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour - 2 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"Alternate Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003col\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu \\\\u0026amp; Pokhara\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ol\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":2,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Namo-Buddha-Panauti.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/namobuddha.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/nagarkot-hike.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/nagarkot-hill-hiking.jpg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=867", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "867", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-06 06:15:26", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-06 06:15:26", "post_modified": "2024-02-09 08:51:21", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-02-09 08:51:21"}}, "customSections": [{"id": 1, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Extended Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour - 2 days</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp - 4-5 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area - 1 hour</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu - 4-6 hours</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour - 2 days</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour - 4 days</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": 2, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Alternate Tours", "content": ["<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 days easy hiking / trekking around Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</a></li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/3-days-kathmandu-cultural-tour-with-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">2 Days Kathmandu Cultural Tour + 1 day hike</a></li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["A great to escape the hustle and bustle of Kathmandu city for a day, Everest Vacation provides Namobudhha hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley. Namobuddha Hiking is a day hike of 3-4 hours to the famous tourist spot with a fabulous view range of snow-capped mountains from Ganesh-Langtang-Jugal Himal, Gaurishankar, etc.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting with a short drive from <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-multi-day-tours/\\">Kathmandu</a> leading North East on the good road passing interesting villages and towns of Thimi and Bhaktapur. Then, heading for a climb to Sanga past Bhaktapur with green farmlands and spread out farm villages. After a few hour’s drive reach, the hill town of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhulikhel\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Dhulikhel</a> famous for its mountain panorama.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom here, take the off-trail away from the motor road to reach holy Namobuddha. A serene environment surrounded by terraced hillsides and picturesque farmhouses. An interesting hike with great views passing several scattered farmhouses and villages.\\r\\n\\r\\nThen, reach Namobuddha located in the serene environment a truly holy place. One of the main sacred sites known as  Nepal’s <em>three Stupas</em> is Tagmo Lüjin (meaning “The place where the future Buddha sacrificed his body to a tigress”). It is a holy site where the perfect and supreme Buddha-at that time still on the path of learning his own body without regret to a tigress suffering from hunger.\\r\\n\\r\\nHere visit several monasteries and great stupas (Buddhist dome monument) and drive back to Kathmandu (optional overnight stop at Dhulikhel) after a great Namobuddha Hiking (day hike) in a complete natural holy Buddhist environment."], "description": "A great to escape the hustle and bustle of Kathmandu city for a day, Everest Vacation provides Namobudhha hiking in a serene and wonderful environment outside the valley. Namobuddha Hiking is a day hike of 3-4 hours to the famous tourist spot with a fabulous view range of snow-capped mountains from Ganesh-Langtang-Jugal Himal, Gaurishankar, etc.\\r\\n\\r\\nStarting with a short drive from <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/kathmandu-multi-day-tours/\\">Kathmandu</a> leading North East on the good road passing interesting villages and towns of Thimi and Bhaktapur. Then, heading for a climb to Sanga past Bhaktapur with green farmlands and spread out farm villages. After a few hour’s drive reach, the hill town of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhulikhel\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Dhulikhel</a> famous for its mountain panorama.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom here, take the off-trail away from the motor road to reach holy Namobuddha. A serene environment surrounded by terraced hillsides and picturesque farmhouses. An interesting hike with great views passing several scattered farmhouses and villages.\\r\\n\\r\\nThen, reach Namobuddha located in the serene environment a truly holy place. One of the main sacred sites known as  Nepal’s <em>three Stupas</em> is Tagmo Lüjin (meaning “The place where the future Buddha sacrificed his body to a tigress”). It is a holy site where the perfect and supreme Buddha-at that time still on the path of learning his own body without regret to a tigress suffering from hunger.\\r\\n\\r\\nHere visit several monasteries and great stupas (Buddhist dome monument) and drive back to Kathmandu (optional overnight stop at Dhulikhel) after a great Namobuddha Hiking (day hike) in a complete natural holy Buddhist environment."}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition", "English speaking cultural city tour guide", "Pickup and drop to your hotel"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s) with air-condition", "English speaking cultural city tour guide", "Pickup and drop to your hotel"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Explore Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking with Everest Vacation.", "trip_type_level": "Easy", "meta_description": "Peaceful Namobuddha Hiking is a day hike of 3-4 hours to the famous tourist spot with a fabulous view range of snow-capped mountains.", "trip_best_season": "Any Season", "faq_section_title": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "Any Season", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "What's included?"}	2023-12-06 06:15:26+00	2024-02-09 08:51:21+00
