es Thakali, Gurung, and Manangis living in these charming villages of Chame, Pisang, Manang, and Yak Kharka.\\r\\n\\r\\nCross the highest point <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thorong_La\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Thorong La</a> (5,416m) during this trek which is challenging and adventurous at the same time. From the top, relish the spectacular views of Tukuche, Annapurna I, Dhaulagiri, Nilgiri, and other peaks. This trek is a great combination of natural and cultural diversity so, adore it during your Annapurna Round Short trek. Visit the Muktinath temple, a sacred site for both Hindus and Buddhists. The best part of this trek is some routes fall under rain-shadow areas. Hence, it is possible to trek in the Monsoon (Jul-Aug) seasons as well."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Kathmandu to Chame", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 2, "meal": "", "title": "Chame to Pisang", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 3, "meal": "", "title": "Pisang to Manang", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 4, "meal": "", "title": "Manang rest day", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 5, "meal": "", "title": "Manang to Yak Kharka", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 6, "meal": "", "title": "Yak Kharka to Thorong Phedi", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 7, "meal": "", "title": "Throng Phedi to Muktinath via Throng La pass", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 8, "meal": "", "title": "Muktinath to Jomsom", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 9, "meal": "", "title": "Flight/drive from Jomson to Pokhara then drive/flight to Kathmandu", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", 