.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>English speaking guide.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<strong>Chisapani Nagarkot Trek</strong> is a 3-day short and easy trek in the Kathmandu Valley that is appropriate for all age groups. This trek is a great combination of nature with typical local life. Witness the mesmerizing sunrise or sunset views over the snow-capped Himalayas from Nagarkot. Walk past rough trails admiring the beautiful forests and fauna in the vicinity.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe first-day trek begins with a drive to Sundarijal, then a hike to Chisapani which takes about 4 to 5 hours of walk. Chisapani is a beautiful place to adore some majestic views of the Himalayan range. These Himalayas emit an ethereal glow in the setting sunlight.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe resume a second-day trip heading toward Nagarkot, along the ridge to the temple known as Changu Narayan temple. This temple hosts a nice view of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sankhu\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Sankhu</a> village and the Bhaktapur area. After some hours of exploration, we drive back to Kathmandu. You can combine this tour with other tours in Kathmandu. The itinerary has been designed in detail keeping in mind the safety and enjoyment of the journey.", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "Historical, Cultural, People local lifestyle, Farming activities", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799",