e yourself in their culture, tradition, and lifestyle. The locals showered you with the warm hospitality and savor some local foods and drinks.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nRelish the stunning views of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Annapurna\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMt. Annapurna\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, Mt. Machhapuchhre, Mt. Hiunchuli, and Gangapurna from Ghandruk. This village is also a gateway to the famous Poon Hill viewpoint. Meshram Baraha Temple and Gurung Cultural Museum are major attractions of this village. After completing this trek, get some relaxation at Jhinu Natural Hot Spring. This trek follows the route from \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003e\\\\u003cem\\\\u003eSiuwai-Ghandruk-Jhinu-Nayapul\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e and a return drive to Pokhara.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_