\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>"], "description": "<ol>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ol>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["<strong>Ghandruk Village trekking in Pokhara</strong> is one of the best destinations surrounded by natural scenery at an elevation of 2,012 m. Ghandruk is easily accessible and one of the nearest and shortest treks appropriate for all age groups. Ghandruk is a lovely Gurung village where you can immerse yourself in their culture, tradition, and lifestyle. The locals showered you with the warm hospitality and savor some local foods and drinks.\\r\\n\\r\\nRelish the stunning views of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Annapurna\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mt. Annapurna</a>, Mt. Machhapuchhre, Mt. Hiunchuli, and Gangapurna from Ghandruk. This village is also a gateway to the famous Poon Hill viewpoint. Meshram Baraha Temple and Gurung Cultural Museum are major attractions of this village. After completing this trek, get some relaxation at Jhinu Natural Hot Spring. This trek follows the route from <strong><em>Siuwai-Ghandruk-Jhinu-Nayapul</em></strong> and a return drive to Pokhara."], "description": "<strong>Ghandruk Village trekking in Pokhara</strong> is one of the best destinations surrounded by natural scenery at an elevation of 2,012 m. Ghandruk is easily accessible and one of the nearest and shortest treks appropriate for all age groups. Ghandruk is a lovely Gurung village where you can immerse yourself in their culture, tradition, and lifestyle. The locals showered you with the warm hospitality and savor some local foods and drinks.\\r\\n\\r\\nRelish the stunning views of <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Annapurna\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mt. Annapurna</a>, Mt. Machhapuchhre, Mt. Hiunchuli, and Gangapurna from Ghandruk. This village is also a gateway to the famous Poon Hill viewpoint. Meshram Baraha Temple and Gurung Cultural Museum are major attractions of this village. After completing this trek, get some relaxation at Jhinu Natural Hot Spring. This trek follows the route from <strong><em>Siuwai-Ghandruk-Jhinu-Nayapul</em></strong> and a return drive to Pokhara."}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Explore Ghandruk Village Trekking in Pokhara with Everest Vacation.", "trip_type_level": "Easy", "meta_description": "Ghandruk Village trekking in Pokhara is one of the best destinations surrounded by natural scenery at an elevation of 2,012 m.", "trip_attractions": "Hot spring and Ghandruk", "trip_best_season": "All seasons", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "Hot spring and Ghandruk", "best_season": "All seasons", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "2012 m", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_max_elevation": "2012 m", "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "What's included?"}	2023-12-06 06:54:48+00	2024-02-09 09:07:06+00
