n their culture, tradition, and lifestyle. The locals showered you with the warm hospitality and savor some local foods and drinks. Ghorepani is a famous stopover to go to Poon Hill.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePoon Hill\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e at an elevation of 3,210 m is a famous vantage point to adore the stunning views of Annapurna, \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machapuchare\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMachhapuchhre\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, Hiunchuli, Annapurna South, Dhampus Peak, and many more. In springtime, tourists pass through the trail of the blossoming colorful Rhododendron flowers. The mesmerizing sunrise view over snowy mountains is the prime highlight of this trek. This trek follows the route from \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003e\\\\u003cem\\\\u003eUlleri-Ghorepani-PoonHill-Nayapul\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e and a return drive to Pokhara.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starte