: ["<strong>Ghorepani Poon Hill trekking</strong> is one of the best destinations in Pokhara that offers phenomenal scenery and mesmerizing sunrise views. Ghorepani Poon Hill is one of the shortest treks appropriate for all age groups. Ghorepani is a beautiful Pun Magar village that lies in the vicinity of the Annapurna Conservation Area. You can immerse yourself in their culture, tradition, and lifestyle. The locals showered you with the warm hospitality and savor some local foods and drinks. Ghorepani is a famous stopover to go to Poon Hill.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Poon Hill</strong> at an elevation of 3,210 m is a famous vantage point to adore the stunning views of Annapurna, <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machapuchare\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Machhapuchhre</a>, Hiunchuli, Annapurna South, Dhampus Peak, and many more. In springtime, tourists pass through the trail of the blossoming colorful Rhododendron flowers. The mesmerizing sunrise view over snowy mountains is the prime highlight of this trek. This trek follows the route from <strong><em>Ulleri-Ghorepani-PoonHill-Nayapul</em></strong> and a return drive to Pokhara."], "description": "<strong>Ghorepani Poon Hill trekking</strong> is one of the best destinations in Pokhara that offers phenomenal scenery and mesmerizing sunrise views. Ghorepani Poon Hill is one of the shortest treks appropriate for all age groups. Ghorepani is a beautiful Pun Magar village that lies in the vicinity of the Annapurna Conservation Area. You can immerse yourself in their culture, tradition, and lifestyle. The locals showered you with the warm hospitality and savor some local foods and drinks. Ghorepani is a famous stopover to go to Poon Hill.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Poon Hill</strong> at an elevation of 3,210 m is a famous vantage point to adore the stunning views of Annapurna, <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machapuchare\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Machhapuchhre</a>, Hiunchuli, Annapurna South, Dhampus Peak, and many more. In springtime, tourists pass through the trail of the blossoming colorful Rhododendron flowers. The mesmerizing sunrise view over snowy mountains is the prime highlight of this trek. This trek follows the route from <strong><em>Ulleri-Ghorepani-PoonHill-Nayapul</em></strong> and a return drive to Pokhara."}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Fully private trip (even 1 traveler) with private guide and vehicle.", "Transportation in comfortable private vehicle(s).", "Vehicle fuel, vehicle tax.", "English speaking cultural city tour guide.", "Drinking Water."], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Explore Magical Ghorepani Poon Hill Trekking with Everest Vacation.", "trip_type_level": "Easy", "meta_description": "Magical Ghorepani Poon Hill trekking is one of the best destinations in Pokhara that offers phenomenal scenery and mesmerizing sunrise views.", "trip_attractions": "Ghorepani , Poonhill", "trip_best_season": "All season", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "Ghorepani , Poonhill", "best_season": "All season", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "3210m", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_max_elevation": "3210m", "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "What's included?"}	2023-12-06 06:58:48+00	2024-02-09 09:09:10+00
