ing": "", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<strong>Langtang Valley trek</strong> in the Langtang region is a moderate-level trek suitable for trekkers with good physical fitness. One of the easiest treks as compared to Annapurna and Everest region treks, this trek takes you through the trail of Langtang National Park. Walk past diverse flora and witness some fauna in the vicinity. Explore the beautiful Tamang villages that have a strong influence on Tibetan Buddhism. The scenic landscapes, stunning snow-capped mountains, locals, and their culture define the perfect blending of nature and culture.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe highest point during the Langtang Valley trek is <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsergo_Ri\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Tsergo Ri</a> at an elevation of 5,033m. Langtang Valley trek takes you to beautiful Kyangjin Gompa where trekkers can explore numerous Buddhist stupas, and Mani walls, and witness prayer flags. Hike to Tsergo Ri is a breathtaking experience where trekkers can relish the magnificent views of <strong>Naya Kanga, Langtang Lirung, Yala Peak, Dorje Lakpa, Ganesh, Jugal</strong>, and many more peaks. Langtang Valley is a highly rewarding 8-day trek which is a beautiful combination of nature and culture.", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "04", "ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days": "05", "ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days": "06", "ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days": "07", "ws_trip_information_list_7_di_days": "08", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", 