d Everest View Hotel and adore the awesome views of Everest and other neighboring peaks. Then, visit the lovely \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khumjung\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKhumjung village\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e where you can visit a monastery that has a purported Yeti scalp. Also, tour around the school built by Sir Edmund Hillary’s Trust. End your trek with an excursion to the Khumbu region’s largest Tengboche Monastery. From here, relish the snow-capped mountains such as Everest, Tawache, Thamserku, Ama Dablam, Lhotse, and Nuptse.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Everest view Trekking with Tengboche\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\" Flight to Lukla then Trek to Phakding.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel