"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["<strong>Annapurna Base Camp trekking</strong> is a classic trek that takes trekkers through scenic landscapes and natural attractions in the vicinity. The Annapurna Base Camp trek that begins from Nayapul is easier compared to the Everest Base Camp trek.\\r\\n\\r\\nAnnapurna Base Camp trekking at an elevation of 4,130 m is the popular and classic trek in the Annapurna region. Traverse through the beautiful settlements of Jhinu, Bamboo, and Deurali to reach Annapurna Base Camp. Witness the stunning views of Annapurna and Dhaulagiri ranges, Machhapuchhre, and surrounding peaks.\\r\\n\\r\\nAnnapurna Base Camp trekking is a combination of nature and culture with a backdrop of beautiful snow-capped mountains. During this trek, get showered with warm hospitality of the locals and savor some local cuisines. Immerse yourself in the local culture and understand their lifestyle which is a new learnings from this trek for trekkers."], "description": "<strong>Annapurna Base Camp trekking</strong> is a classic trek that takes trekkers through scenic landscapes and natural attractions in the vicinity. The Annapurna Base Camp trek that begins from Nayapul is easier compared to the Everest Base Camp trek.\\r\\n\\r\\nAnnapurna Base Camp trekking at an elevation of 4,130 m is the popular and classic trek in the Annapurna region. Traverse through the beautiful settlements of Jhinu, Bamboo, and Deurali to reach Annapurna Base Camp. Witness the stunning views of Annapurna and Dhaulagiri ranges, Machhapuchhre, and surrounding peaks.\\r\\n\\r\\nAnnapurna Base Camp trekking is a combination of nature and culture with a backdrop of beautiful snow-capped mountains. During this trek, get showered with warm hospitality of the locals and savor some local cuisines. Immerse yourself in the local culture and understand their lifestyle which is a new learnings from this trek for trekkers."}], "itinerary_title": "Annapurna Base Camp Trekking", "sub_description": "Explore Annapurna Base Camp Trekking with Everest Vacation.", "trip_highlights": "Annapurna Base Camp trekking is a classic trek that takes trekkers through scenic landscapes and natural attractions in the vicinity. The Annapurna Base Camp trek that begins from Nayapul is easier compared to the Everest Base Camp trek.", "trip_type_level": "Short and Easy", "meta_description": "Annapurna Base Camp trekking is a classic trek that takes trekkers through scenic landscapes and natural attractions in the vicinity.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}}	2023-12-07 05:39:34+00	2024-04-26 10:12:18+01
