ding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"A \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eshort and easy\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eGosainkunda trekking\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e can be organized from near the Kathmandu valley. Also, we can take a drive to Gosainkunda which takes about 8 hours from Kathmandu. This trekking is a perfect mixture of cultural heritage and nature. Trek also touches the Langtang region through \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhunche\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eDhunche\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e. Langtang is also one of the popular trekking destinations in Nepal. It’s probably the only trek that leads trekkers more than 4000 m high within a short period. This trek offers a magnificent view of alpine valleys, high Himalayas, and typical cultural heritage.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nGosaikunda Lake is one of the most religious and famous places of pilgrimage situated at 4,380m above sea level. Every year in Janai Purnima thousands of Hindu pilgrims come here for a holy bath, believing that sins are a relief after taking a bath in this sacred lake. During this trek, we can get a majestic view of the highest mountain around the lake. Gosainkunda trek is preferable for those trekkers who want a short and less expensive trek.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eThe short Gosainkunda trek\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e starts a scenic drive from Kathmandu to Dhunche and trek to Sing Gompa. We continue our trek to the sacred lake, Gosainkunda, and after exploring around we head back to Dhunche via Sing-Gompa. Then we drive back to Kathmandu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Gosainkunda Trekking\\",\\"_start