78e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":6,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/langtang-helicopter-tour.jpg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=890", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "890", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-07 06:21:16", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-07 06:21:16", "post_modified": "2024-02-09 09:27:39", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-02-09 09:27:39"}}, "customSections": [{"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["A <strong>short and easy</strong> <strong>Gosainkunda trekking</strong> can be organized from near the Kathmandu valley. Also, we can take a drive to Gosainkunda which takes about 8 hours from Kathmandu. This trekking is a perfect mixture of cultural heritage and nature. Trek also touches the Langtang region through <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhunche\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Dhunche</a>. Langtang is also one of the popular trekking destinations in Nepal. It’s probably the only trek that leads trekkers more than 4000 m high within a short period. This trek offers a magnificent view of alpine valleys, high Himalayas, and typical cultural heritage.\\r\\n\\r\\nGosaikunda Lake is one of the most religious and famous places of pilgrimage situated at 4,380m above sea level. Every year in Janai Purnima thousands of Hindu pilgrims come here for a holy bath, believing that sins are a relief after taking a bath in this sacred lake. During this trek, we can get a majestic view of the highest mountain around the lake. Gosainkunda trek is preferable for those trekkers who want a short and less expensive trek.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>The short Gosainkunda trek</strong> starts a scenic drive from Kathmandu to Dhunche and trek to Sing Gompa. We continue our trek to the sacred lake, Gosainkunda, and after exploring around we head back to Dhunche via Sing-Gompa. Then we drive back to Kathmandu."], "description": "A <strong>short and easy</strong> <strong>Gosainkunda trekking</strong> can be organized from near the Kathmandu valley. Also, we can take a drive to Gosainkunda which takes about 8 hours from Kathmandu. This trekking is a perfect mixture of cultural heritage and nature. Trek also touches the Langtang region through <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhunche\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Dhunche</a>. Langtang is also one of the popular trekking destinations in Nepal. It’s probably the only trek that leads trekkers more than 4000 m high within a short period. This trek offers a magnificent view of alpine valleys, high Himalayas, and typical cultural heritage.\\r\\n\\r\\nGosaikunda Lake is one of the most religious and famous places of pilgrimage situated at 4,380m above sea level. Every year in Janai Purnima thousands of Hindu pilgrims come here for a holy bath, believing that sins are a relief after taking a bath in this sacred lake. During this trek, we can get a majestic view of the highest mountain around the lake. Gosainkunda trek is preferable for those trekkers who want a short and less expensive trek.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>The short Gosainkunda trek</strong> starts a scenic drive from Kathmandu to Dhunche and trek to Sing Gompa. We continue our trek to the sacred lake, Gosainkunda, and after exploring around we head back to Dhunche via Sing-Gompa. Then we drive back to Kathmandu."}], "itinerary_title": "Gosainkunda Trekking", "sub_description": "Explore Short and Easy Gosainkunda Trekking with Everest Vacation.", "trip_type_level": "Short and Easy", "meta_description": "Short and Easy Gosainkunda trekking is a perfect mixture of cultural heritage and nature that takes you to the holy Gosaikunda Lake.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}}	2023-12-07 06:21:16+00	2024-02-09 09:27:39+00
196	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "6", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Short and Easy"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "5", "_edit_lock": "1707471045:5", "_dp_original": "890", "_thumbnail_id": "800", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "6", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "6 Days Classic Annapurna Trek", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "6 Days Classic Annapurna Trek", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "47", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "The 6 Days Classic Annapurna Trek is a comfortable trek package designed by Everest Vacation that caters to the trekker’s preference.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Short and Easy", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "classic-annapurna-trek", "tags": [], "title": "6 Days Classic Annapurna Trek", "duration": "6 Days", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "The <strong>6 Days Classic Annapurna Trek</strong> is a comfortable trek package designed by Everest Vacation that caters to the trekker’s preference. The popular treks in the Annapurna regions take you through beautiful scenic landscapes, and views of snow-capped Annapurna and Dhaulagiri ranges.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe <strong>Classic Annapurna trek</strong> provides cultural and natural insights. Trekkers can immerse themselves in the local lifestyle and culture of the ethnicities living there. Also, capture nature wonders and scenic mountain vistas for an unforgettable memory during the tour.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis trek's elevation is comparatively low and easy for trekkers of all age groups with good physical fitness. You pass through beautiful Ghorepani village and climb Poon Hill for stunning sunrise views. Trek to attractive Gurung village Ghandruk and adore the natural scenery at its best. Traverse beautiful settlements of Tolkha, Australian Camp, and Kande and return to Pokhara."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Drive to Nayapul. Trek to Ulleri.", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 2, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Ghorepani. Explore around Ghorepani.", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 3, "meal": "", "title": "Early morning climb Poon-Hill then Trek to the Ghandruk", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 4, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Tolkha via Landruk", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 5, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Australian Camp", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 6, "meal": "", "title": "Trek to Kande and drive to Pokhara", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/ANNAPURNA.jpeg", "title": "ANNAPURNA", "altText": "6 Days Classic Annapurna Trek", "caption": "6 Days Classic Annapurna Trek", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "", "ws_block_best_seas