 \\t<li>Monuments entrance/admission fees</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) &amp; government taxes.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "Including Kathmandu & Bhaktapur | Thimphu & Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike ", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "04", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_i