inerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Paro (base for the hike)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Airport Bird's Eye View Point, Paro</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Paro", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "<div id=\\"collapse-4\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-4\\">\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</div>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 3 nights 4 days", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Including Kathmandu \\\\u0026 Bhaktapur | Thimphu \\\\u0026 Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike \\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath,  Pashupatinath)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview \\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"Nepal Bhutan Tour 3 nights 4 days designed by Everest Vacation is a perfect short package to explore these mystical nations. Visit UNESCO Heritage sites that hold both historical and cultural significance in Kathmandu. These heritage sites are truly iconic and a great testament to impressive architecture, and skillful craftsmanship.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFly to  \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-4-nights-5-days/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eBhutan\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e and drive to Thimphu, the capital city to explore the prominent landmarks such as Memorial Chorten, Tashichho Dzong, Great Buddha Dordenma statue, etc. The city of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paro,_Bhutan\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eParo\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e includes sightseeing the ancient Paro Dzong, old Paro town, and an exceptional hike to Paro Taktsang Monastery. A hike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery is full of adventure and offers a unique spiritual experience.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour 3 nights 4 days (1 night in Nepal and 2 nights in Bhutan)\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWe take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"f