el)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Kathmandu & Bhaktapur | Thimphu & Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike", "trip_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath,  Pashupatinath)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 3 nights 4 days is perfect for visitors to explore the aesthetic natural beauty and culture of these nations.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Including Kathmandu & Bhaktapur | Thimphu & Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike"}	2023-12-10 06:51:31+00	2024-08-18 08:43:04+01
