in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nEverest Vacation has designed an amazing <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-3-nights-4-days/\\">Nepal</a> Bhutan Tour 4 nights 5 days package that is flexible and customizable. Kathmandu sightseeing includes UNESCO Heritage sites that are architecturally marvelous. Relish the beautiful sunrise/sunset views over the majestic snowy Himalayas in Nagarkot.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Bhutan and visit stunning landmarks in <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paro,_Bhutan\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Paro</a> and Thimphu. Explore ancient Dzongs, the enormous Great Buddha Dordenma, a beautiful old Paro town, and experience the national sport of Archery during the tour. Experience a magical spiritual aura while hiking to the Paro Taktsang Monastery also popular as ‘Tiger’s Nest Monastery’. This short tour is a great mix of culture and nature."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Arrival in Kathmandu and Kathmandu Sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Kathmandu (TIA) airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Boudhanath ( A large Buddhist Stupa)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pashupatinath (Largest Hindu Temple having an open cremation area)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Swoyambhu Stupa (Monkey Temple)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Kathmandu, we will manage the tour in next day (before flight to Bhutan)</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "30 minutes drive from airport", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 2, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Bhaktapur, Changu Narayan and Nagarkot Tour", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhaktapur Durbar Square</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changu Narayan Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Nagarkot for panoramic view of Himalayas and Kathmandu valley (Sunset / Sunrise also popular)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Kathmandu.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "4 hours", "elevation": "2175m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 3, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Fly Kathmandu to Paro(Bhutan), drive to Thimphu and Thimphu sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop to Kathmandu airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Paro airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Memorial Chorten (temple)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changangkha Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Statue of Buddha</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Weekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "1 hour 30 minutes drive", "elevation": "2200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 4, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Drive to Paro, Hike to Taktsang Monastery and Paro Tour", "richText": "<div id=\\"collapse-4\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-4\\">\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Paro (base for the hike)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Airport Bird's Eye View Point, Paro</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</div>", "driveTime": "1 hour 30 minutes drive", "elevation": "1950m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 5, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Final Departure / Tour end", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Paro-Airport-Landing.jpg", "title": "Paro-Airport-Landing", "altText": "Paro-Airport, Landing view", "caption": "Paro-Airport, Landing view", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["625", "4309", "542", "603", "4303", "4897", "4462", "3869", "4043", "3949", "4434", "4444", "4446", "4022"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "", "ws_block_best_season": "", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "2", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "Cost Inclusion ", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-white", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Why Travel With Us?", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc4e9c19160", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_b