3ePickup from your hotel\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePlace to visit / Tour\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBhaktapur Durbar Square\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eChangu Narayan Temple\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrive to Nagarkot for panoramic view of the Himalayas and Kathmandu Valley (Sunset / Sunrise also popular)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrive back to Kathmandu.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"03\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Fly Kathmandu to Paro(Bhutan), drive to Thimphu and Thimphu sightseeing\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"2200m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"1 hour 30 minutes drive\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrop to Kathmandu airport\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePickup from Paro airport\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrive to Thimphu\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePlace to visit / Tour\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMemorial Chorten (temple)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eChangangkha Lhakhang\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eStatue of Buddha\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWeekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eIf you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"04\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Punakha Day Tour (Thimphu - Dochu La Pass – Punakha – Thimphu)\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"2200m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\" 2 hour 30 minutes drive\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"3star to Luxury hotels\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv id=\\\\u0022collapse-4\\\\u0022 class=\\\\u0022panel-collapse collapse show\\\\u0022 role=\\\\u0022tabpanel\\\\u0022 ari