_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "Airport transfer, collect your original passport and photographs and request to fill up Tibet group visa form.", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "Boudhanath Stupa, Pashupatinath Temple, Patan Durbar Square.", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "Swoyambhunath Temple (Monkey Temple), Bhaktapur Durbar Square and Nagarkot for sunset and sunrise view.", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "Sunrise tour, drive to Kathmandu and collect your Tibet group visa with your original passport and flight to Lhasa, Rest in Lhasa hotel for high altitude acclimatization.", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "Potala Palace, Jokhang Temple, Barkhor Street.", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "Dadong Village and Sera Monastery.", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "Yamdrok Lake, Karola Glacier, Pelkor Chöde Monastery with Gyantse Kumbum.", "ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "Tashilhunpo Monastery.", "ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "Flight to China mainland city or back to Kathmandu for your next destination or for your home.", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Nepal Tibet Multi countries Tour Itinerary | Everest Vacation", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003e3 nights in Kathmandu including Nagarkot + 5 nights at Lhasa, Yamdrok lake and Shigatse\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eProcess: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eArrival in Kathmandu, Tibet visa processing, Nagarkot, Lhasa city tour, Lhasa to Shigatse via Yamdrok Lake and return to Lhasa, flight to Chengdu or Kathmandu for international flight or next destination.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eDistance:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e 1.5 hours flight from Kathmandu to Lhasa and 1.5 hours drive from Lhasa Gonggar Airport to downtown/hotel, 7-8 hours drive from Lhasa to Shigatse.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Tibet Multi Countries tour\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e is a flexible and customizable package designed by Everest Vacation for all travel lovers. A delightful experience in Kathmandu to sightsee architecturally impressive cultural UNESCO-listed sites and fabulous Himalayan view with sunrise in Nagarkot.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nA short flight to Lhasa (Tibet) teases you with the scenic Himalayas. Experience a different aura once you land at the Lhasa Airport. Explore popular UNESCO Heritage sites and immerse yourself in the spiritual ambiance of Lhasa \\\\u0026amp; Shigatse while visiting sacred Buddhist monasteries. The natural freshwater Yamdrok Lake add beauty to this multi-country tour.\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Tour Highlights\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMarvelous Bhaktapur Durbar Square and Nagarkot sunrise view\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eUNESCO-listed royal museum Potala Palace includes 1,000 rooms, 10,000 shrines, and approx. 200,000 statues\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHoly Barkhor Street popular for the Kora ritual and for buying Tibetan original goods\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSpiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit the holy Sera Monastery famous for debate sessions (between 3-5 pm)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eNorbulingka Palace with its unique Tibetan architecture popular for the Yogurt festival (Sho Dun)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit the beautiful Dadong Village and the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Lake\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eShigatse Sightseeing (Tashilhunpo Monastery, Shigatse Dzong, Sakya Monastery, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMajestic Mountain ranges views during flights from Kathmandu to Lhasa or vice versa\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-gallerie