\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003e8 nights in Kathmandu, Chitwan National Park, Pokhara | 4 nights in Lhasa\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eProcess: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eIf you already have a Chinese visa, Collect Tibet permit in Chengdu / Beijing / Kunming / Guangzhou / Shanghai or mainland China, flight/train to Lhasa from China mainland city, Lhasa tour with Yamdrok lake, flight to Kathmandu, 3 nights Kathmandu, 2 nights Chitwan and 2 nights Pokhara.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eVice-versa: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e3 nights in Kathmandu, Pokhara, Chitwan and fly to Lhasa, Lhasa tour with Yamdrok lake and fly out via Chengdu or Kathmandu to your home or next destination.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nEverest Vacation has designed a 13-day flexible and customizable \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Tibet Tour\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e that delights visitors with the natural beauty and culture of these magical destinations.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nA visit to the city of temples, Kathmandu including UNESCO Heritage sites and the spectacular Bhaktapur Durbar Square is impressive. Nagarkot sunrise view, Pokhara sightseeing with Sarangkot hike, and Jungle Safari in Chitwan National Park connect visitors closely to nature.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFly to Lhasa (Tibet), and explore UNESCO Heritage sites, Buddhist monasteries, and the freshwater Yamdrok Lake. Get amused with traditional Tibetan architecture and lifestyle, deep valleys, greenery, and old trails while visiting the beautiful Dadong Village.\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Tour Highlights\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eUNESCO-listed royal museum Potala Palace includes 1,000 rooms, 10,000 shrines, and approx. 200,000 statues\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHoly Barkhor Street popular for the Kora ritual and for buying Tibetan original goods\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSpiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit the holy Sera Monastery famous for debate sessions (between 3-5 pm)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBeautiful Dadong Village and serene Yamdrok Lake\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO Heritage sites\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMarvelous Bhaktapur Durbar Square and Nagarkot Sunrise View\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePokhara Sightseeing with Sarangkot hike\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eJungle Safari in Chitwan National Park\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMajestic Mountain ranges views during flights from Kathmandu to Lhasa or vice versa\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo Gallery \\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"4314\\",\\"4330\\",\\"525\\",\\"4341\\",\\"4282\\",\\"4026\\",\\"4328\\",\\"731\\",\\"4858\\",\\"4433\\",\\"4859\\",\\"4856\\",\\"4854\\",\\"4421\\",\\"4459\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea