"field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_duration": " Approx, 1 hour 30 minutes drive from Thimphu to Paro.", "ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration": "", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "822m", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1600m", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "150m", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "415m", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "415m", "ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "2200m", "ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1200m", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_Elevation": " 3120m", "ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "", "_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "Pickup from Kathmandu (TIA) airport\\r\\n<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Boudhanath ( A large Buddhist Stupa)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pashupatinath (Largest Hindu Temple having an open cremation area)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nIf you arrive lately in Kathmandu, we will manage the tour in next day (before flight to Bhutan)\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Kathmandu</em>", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhaktapur (Durbar Square, Nyatapola Temple, 55 Window Palace, Dattatreya Temple, Pottery Square etc)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Patan (Durbar Square, Golden Temple, Patan Museum, handicraft center etc.)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Kathmandu</em>", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>After breakfast, Drive/flight to Pokhara</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around lakeside.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Boating at Phewa Lake.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Pokhara</em>", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "<div id=\\"collapse-4\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-4\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Place to visit/tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning drive to Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunrise view from Himalayas</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Pokhara valley</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Davis Falls</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>International Mountain Museum</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bindhyabasini Temple</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Pokhara</em>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "<strong>Place to visit/tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>After breakfast, Drive to Lumbini</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Maya Devi Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the Ashoka Pillar</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>World Peace Pagoda</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Eternal Peace Flame</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit popular monasteries made by different nations reflecting their unique architecture (Like Royal Thai Monastery, Myanmar Golden Monastery, Dae Sung Shakya Korean Temple</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Lumbini</em>", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Chitwan National Park</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lunch upon arrival at hotel of Chitwan</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around Tharu village/community</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunset view from beach of Rapti river</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Chitwan</em>", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "<div id=\\"collapse-7\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-7\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning Jungle walk</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Canoeing and Elephant breeding center</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Elephant Safari / Jeep Safari inside National Park</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Evening Cultural program, Tharu Dance</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Chitwan</em>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>", "ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight to Kathmandu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Rest or Walking tour around Thamel and Ason Bazaar</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Shopping if you wish</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<div id=\\"collapse-8\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-8\\"><em>Overnight at Kathmandu</em></div>", "ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "<div id=\\"collapse-9\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-9\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nDrop to Kathmandu airport\\r\\n\\r\\nPickup from Paro airport\\r\\n\\r\\nDrive to Thimphu\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changangkha Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Statue of Buddha</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Weekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nIf you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.\\r\\n<div id=\\"collapse-9\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-9\\"><em>Overnight at Thimphu</em></div>\\r\\n</div>", "ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "Drive to Punakha crossing over Dochu La Pass (3100 mts)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Dochu La Pass (views of the highest mountain peaks &amp; walk around the 108 stupas)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through the paddy field and old village to visit Chhimi Lhakhang, the temple of fertility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suspension Bridge</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Thimphu</em>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "Drive to Paro (base for the hike)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Place to visit / Tour</strong>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Airport Bird's Eye View Point, Paro</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<em>Overnight at Paro</em>", "ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Bhutan Nepal Tour 11 nights 12 days | Everest Vacation", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Including Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Chitwan, Lumbini \\\\u0026 Pokhara | Thimphu, Punakha \\\\u0026 Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike \\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eChitwan Sightseeing (Jungle Safari, Tharu Village Tour, Canoeing, Sunset View)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePhenomenal Sunrise View from Sarangkot\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePokhara Sightseeing (Lakeside View, Davis Fall, Phewa Lake Boating, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eCherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePunakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\" Overview \\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour 11 nights 12 days (8 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWe take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-10-nights-11-days-2/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e 11 nights 12 days package designed by Everest Vacation is breathtaking. Visit the Himalayan nations of Nepal and Bhutan. Visit iconic landmarks, immerse in their culture, and enjoy the uniqueness of these captivating destinations. Explore the UNESCO-listed sites in Nepal such as the artistic beautiful Kathmandu Valley, and Lumbini, the birthplace of Buddha. Experience the nature tour with a visit to Chitwan and Pokhara. The Jungle Safari in Chitwan and mountain views while boating in Pokhara are captivating.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe Bhutan tour includes visiting 3 beautiful cities of Paro, Thimphu, and Punakha. Visit superb landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu. Relish the wonderful views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass. Punakha Sightseeing is incomplete without visiting the Chhimi Lakhang Temple, the second-oldest Punakha Dzong. Paro's visit is exciting with Paro Dzong, old Paro Town, and the unmissable\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paro_Taktsang\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003e Tiger’s Nest Monastery\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"4331\\",\\"4329\\",\\"4341\\",\\"4323\\",\\"4320\\",\\"4306\\",\\"4289\\",\\"768\\",\\"4436\\",\\"4439\\",\\"4440\\",\\"4445\\",\\"4462\\",\\"4460\\",\\"4297\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit