w Point, Paro\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cem\\\\u003eOvernight at Paro\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_di_days\\":\\"12\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Final Departure / Tour end\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrop you to Paro airport from your hotel\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eReturn with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":12,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"Cost Inclusion \\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cblockquote\\\\u003eWe are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e(\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNote:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/blockquote\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBhutan Travel Permit and Visa\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate vehicle with air conditioning\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBreakfast in Nepal\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMonuments entrance/admission fees\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eGuide and driver’s meals and accommodation\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eService Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) \\\\u0026amp; government taxes.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHandle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Outdoor Extra Activities\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHiking:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eRiver rafting: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eThrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal and Bhutan on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eParagliding: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eRelish amazing panoramic Himalayan views, scenic landscapes, and beautiful surroundings\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eZipline: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eExperience the longest and steepest zipline in Nepal and admire scenic surroundings (Currently no zip line in Bhutan)\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBungee jump: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eAdrenaline rush experience through bungee jumping in Nepal amidst beautiful surrounding scenery (Not permitted in Bhutan)\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eYoga and meditation: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ePractice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHelicopter tours: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eExciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp \\\\u0026amp; Annapurna Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Best time to visit\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eHigh season (Best Time):\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eMarch to May\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e with the blooming flowers covering the hillsides, warm temperatures, stable weather with low humidity and rainfall, clear skies with clear views, and lush greenery everywhere.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eSeptember to November \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ewith mild temperatures, stable weather, clear skies, and phenomenal views.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eShoulder season (Good Time):\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eDecember to February \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ewith sunny day weather and slightly cold nights \\\\u0026amp; mornings, mild day temperatures, clear surrounding views, and fewer crowds which is perfect for visitors seeking a peaceful visit.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eLow or Off-season (Average Time):\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eJune to August \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ewith unstable weather and temperature, high humidity, light to heavy rainfall, mostly obstructed views, but lush greenery everywhere. High chances of flight cancelations and roadblocks due to floods \\\\u0026amp; landslides in some places.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Nepal-Bhutan Tour: Is It Right for You?\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eA perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSuitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAccompanied by experienced local guides\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eComfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTechnical Climbing is not involved during the trip\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike through forested trails which is medium.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAn experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Why Travel With Us?\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e24/7 International Support\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Private and Customize Trips\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSafety: Our Topmost Priority\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSecure Online Payment\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBookings and Payments Flexibility\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eLifetime Deposit Guaranteed\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eGuaranteed Departures\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTravel with Locals to support locals\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eExperienced Team and Expert Guides\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eRespect Nature through Responsible Tourism\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHappiness and Best Priced Assured\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Lumbini-Nepal.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/kathmandu-tour-nepal.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/kathmandu-cultural-tour.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Peace-Pagoda-Pokhara1.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/elephant.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/chitwan-jungle-safari.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/waterfalls-in-pokhara.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/sarangkot-tourist-hub.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/lumbini.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Punakha-Dzong-3.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Thimphu-Tour-bhutan.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/thimphu-buddha-statue.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/tiger-nest-in-bhutan-tour.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bhutan-airport.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/beautiful-place-in-bhutan.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/swyambhunath.jpg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=937", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "937", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-20 07:22:06", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-20 07:22:06", "post_modified": "2024-08-18 10:20:34", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-08-18 10:20:34"}}, "customSections": [{"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Nepal Bhutan Tour 11 nights 12 days (8 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-10-nights-11-days-2/\\">Nepal Bhutan Tour</a> 11 nights 12 days package designed by Everest Vacation is breathtaking. Visit the Himalayan nations of Nepal and Bhutan. Visit iconic landmarks, immerse in their culture, and enjoy the uniqueness of these captivating destinations. Explore the UNESCO-listed sites in Nepal such as the artistic beautiful Kathmandu Valley, and Lumbini, the birthplace of Buddha. Experience the nature tour with a visit to Chitwan and Pokhara. The Jungle Safari in Chitwan and mountain views while boating in Pokhara are captivating.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Bhutan tour includes visiting 3 beautiful cities of Paro, Thimphu, and Punakha. Visit superb landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu. Relish the wonderful views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass. Punakha Sightseeing is incomplete without visiting the Chhimi Lakhang Temple, the second-oldest Punakha Dzong. Paro's visit is exciting with Paro Dzong, old Paro Town, and the unmissable<a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paro_Taktsang\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"> Tiger’s Nest Monastery</a>."], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Nepal Bhutan Tour 11 nights 12 days (8 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-10-nights-11-days-2/\\">Nepal Bhutan Tour</a> 11 nights 12 days package designed by Everest Vacation is breathtaking. Visit the Himalayan nations of Nepal and Bhutan. Visit iconic landmarks, immerse in their culture, and enjoy the uniqueness of these captivating destinations. Explore the UNESCO-listed sites in Nepal such as the artistic beautiful Kathmandu Valley, and Lumbini, the birthplace of Buddha. Experience the nature tour with a visit to Chitwan and Pokhara. The Jungle Safari in Chitwan and mountain views while boating in Pokhara are captivating.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Bhutan tour includes visiting 3 beautiful cities of Paro, Thimphu, and Punakha. Visit superb landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu. Relish the wonderful views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass. Punakha Sightseeing is incomplete without visiting the Chhimi Lakhang Temple, the second-oldest Punakha Dzong. Paro's visit is exciting with Paro Dzong, old Paro Town, and the unmissable<a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paro_Taktsang\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"> Tiger’s Nest Monastery</a>."}, {"id": "overview-2", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Outdoor Extra Activities", "content": ["Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Hiking:</strong> Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>River rafting: </strong>Thrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal and Bhutan on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Paragliding: </strong>Relish amazing panoramic Himalayan views, scenic landscapes, and beautiful surroundings\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Zipline: </strong>Experience the longest and steepest zipline in Nepal and admire scenic surroundings (Currently no zip line in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Bungee jump: </strong>Adrenaline rush experience through bungee jumping in Nepal amidst beautiful surrounding scenery (Not permitted in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Yoga and meditation: </strong>Practice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Helicopter tours: </strong>Exciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp &amp; Annapurna Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan"], "description": "Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Hiking:</strong> Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>River rafting: </strong>Thrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal and Bhutan on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Paragliding: </strong>Relish amazing panoramic Himalayan views, scenic landscapes, and beautiful surroundings\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Zipline: </strong>Experience the longest and steepest zipline in Nepal and admire scenic surroundings (Currently no zip line in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Bungee jump: </strong>Adrenaline rush experience through bungee jumping in Nepal amidst beautiful surrounding scenery (Not permitted in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Yoga and meditation: </strong>Practice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Helicopter tours: </strong>Exciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp &amp; Annapurna Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan"}, {"id": "overview-3", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Best time to visit", "content": ["<h3>High season (Best Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>March to May</strong> with the blooming flowers covering the hillsides, warm temperatures, stable weather with low humidity and rainfall, clear skies with clear views, and lush greenery everywhere.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>September to November </strong>with mild temperatures, stable weather, clear skies, and phenomenal views.\\r\\n<h3>Shoulder season (Good Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>December to February </strong>with sunny day weather and slightly cold nights &amp; mornings, mild day temperatures, clear surrounding views, and fewer crowds which is perfect for visitors seeking a peaceful visit.\\r\\n<h3>Low or Off-season (Average Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>June to August </strong>with unstable weather and temperature, high humidity, light to heavy rainfall, mostly obstructed views, but lush greenery everywhere. High chances of flight cancelations and roadblocks due to floods &amp; landslides in some places."], "description": "<h3>High season (Best Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>March to May</strong> with the blooming flowers covering the hillsides, warm temperatures, stable weather with low humidity and rainfall, clear skies with clear views, and lush greenery everywhere.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>September to November </strong>with mild temperatures, stable weather, clear skies, and phenomenal views.\\r\\n<h3>Shoulder season (Good Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>December to February </strong>with sunny day weather and slightly cold nights &amp; mornings, mild day temperatures, clear surrounding views, and fewer crowds which is perfect for visitors seeking a peaceful visit.\\r\\n<h3>Low or Off-season (Average Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>June to August </strong>with unstable weather and temperature, high humidity, light to heavy rainfall, mostly obstructed views, but lush greenery everywhere. High chances of flight cancelations and roadblocks due to floods &amp; landslides in some places."}, {"id": "overview-4", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Nepal-Bhutan Tour: Is It Right for You?", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>A perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Accompanied by experienced local guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Comfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Technical Climbing is not involved during the trip</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>A perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Accompanied by experienced local guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Comfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Technical Climbing is not involved during the trip</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "overview-5", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Why Travel With Us?", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa", "Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan", "Breakfast in Nepal", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa", "Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan", "Breakfast in Nepal", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "The breathtaking Nepal Bhutan Tour", "sub_description": "8 nights in Kathmandu, Pokhara, Lumbini, Chitwan and 3 nights in Bhutan", "trip_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Chitwan Sightseeing (Jungle Safari, Tharu Village Tour, Canoeing, Sunset View)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Phenomenal Sunrise View from Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pokhara Sightseeing (Lakeside View, Davis Fall, Phewa Lake Boating, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Cherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "Visit famous destinations such as Thimphu, Punakha, Paro, Lumbini, Chitwan, Pokhara, Kathmandu during Bhutan Nepal Tour 11 nights 12 days.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Including Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Chitwan, Lumbini & Pokhara | Thimphu, Punakha & Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike"}	2023-12-20 07:22:06+00	2024-08-18 11:20:34+01
214	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "7 nights Kathmandu, Pokhara, Chitwan and 3 nights Bhutan", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "11", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "5", "_edit_lock": "1723975271:5", "_dp_original": "809", "_thumbnail_id": "4282", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "7 nights Kathmandu, Pokhara, Chitwan and 3 nights Bhutan", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "11", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 11 days", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 11 days", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "47", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Visit the ancient temples in Kathmandu, tourist hub Pokhara, and mystical Tiger’s Nest Monastery, during the Nepal Bhutan Tour 11 days.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "nepal-bhutan-tour-10-nights-11-days-2", "tags": [], "title": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 11 days", "duration": "11 Days", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Nepal Bhutan Tour 10 nights 11 days (7 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nEverest Vacation has created a fabulous Nepal Bhutan Tour 10 nights 11 days package to these beautiful Himalayan nations. Visitors have the flexibility to customize the itinerary to their preferences. Explore the UNESCO-listed sites in Nepal including the artistically marvelous Durbar Squares in Kathmandu Valley. Connect closely to nature while visiting Chitwan and Pokhara. The Chitwan tour includes an amazing Jungle Safari with fun activities and a Tharu Village tour. Pokhara sightseeing includes attractive places with a Phewa Lake boating. Walk a tour around the Thamel area and go shopping, which is a great way to wrap up the Nepal tour.\\r\\n\\r\\nA visit to the mystical Tiger’s Nest Monastery, and the serene towns of Thimphu, Paro, and <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punakha\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Punakha</a> astounds the visitors. Explore ancient Dzongs, the giant Great Buddha Dordenma, a beautiful old Paro town, stunning Punakha Dzong, and the world-renowned Chhimi Lhakhang temple. Get awesome views of the highest mountain peaks from Dochu La Pass &amp; walk around the 108 stupas. The itinerary is flexible to customize and travelers can choose the best package that best suits them. Create cherished memories of a lifetime during these tours."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Arrival in Kathmandu and Kathmandu Sightseeing if time permit", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Kathmandu (TIA) airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Boudhanath ( A large Buddhist Stupa)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pashupatinath (Largest Hindu Temple having an open cremation area)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Swoyambhu Stupa (Monkey Temple)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Kathmandu, we will manage the tour in next day (before flight to Bhutan)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "driveTime": "30m drive from airport to hotel", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 2, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Sightseeing of Patan and Bhaktapur Durbar Square", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhaktapur (Durbar Square, Nyatapola Temple, 55 Window Palace, Dattatreya Temple, Pottery Square etc)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Patan (Durbar Square, Golden Temple, Patan Museum, handicraft center etc.)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 3, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Drive/Flight to Chitwan and Village Tour", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight to Chitwan</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lunch upon arrival at hotel of Chitwan</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around Tharu village/community</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunset view from beach of Rapti river</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Chitwan", "driveTime": "25m flight or 5h drive to Chitwan", "elevation": "415m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 4, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Chitwan National Park Tour", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning Jungle walk</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Canoeing and Elephant breeding center</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Elephant Safari / Jeep Safari inside National Park</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Evening Cultural program, Tharu Dance</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Chitwan", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "415m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 5, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Drive/Flight to Pokhara and Relax around lakeside", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning Bird Watching Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>After breakfast, Drive/flight to Pokhara</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around lakeside.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "driveTime": "20m flight or 5h drive to Pokhara", "elevation": "822m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Sarangkot Sunrise and Pokhara Sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit/tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning drive to Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunrise view from Himalayas</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Pokhara valley</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Phewa Lake boating</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Davis Falls</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>International Mountain Museum</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bindhyabasini Temple</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "driveTime": "20-30 minutes drive to Sarangkot", "elevation": "1600m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Drive/flight to Kathmandu and Rest or Walking tour around Thamel", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight back to Kathmandu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Rest today or walking tour around Thamel</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "driveTime": "30m flight or 7h drive to Kathmandu", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 8, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Fly Kathmandu to Paro(Bhutan), drive to Thimphu and Thimphu sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop to Kathmandu airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Paro airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Memorial Chorten (temple)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changangkha Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Statue of Buddha</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Weekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "driveTime": "1h15m flight and 1h30m drive", "elevation": "2200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 9, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Punakha Day Tour (Thimphu - Dochu La Pass – Punakha – Thimphu)", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Punakha crossing over Dochu La Pass (3100 meters)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Dochu La Pass (views of the highest mountain peaks &amp; walk around the 108 stupas)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through the paddy field and old village to visit Chhimi Lhakhang, the temple of fertility.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Khamsum Yuley Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "driveTime": "2h drive from Thimphu to Punakha", "elevation": "1200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 10, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Drive to Paro, Hike to Taktsang Monastery and Paro Tour", "richText": "<div id=\\"collapse-10\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-10\\">\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Paro (base for the hike)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Airport Bird's Eye View Point, Paro</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Paro\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>", "driveTime": "1h30m drive from Thimphu to Paro", "elevation": "2950m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 11, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Final Departure / Tour end", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pokhara-phewa-lake.jpg", "title": "pokhara-phewa-lake", "altText": "Boating at Phewa Lake at Pokhara", "caption": "Boating at Phewa Lake at Pokhara", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["4821", "527", "611", "613", "4281", "4287", "766", "4328", "4319", "4302", "4440", "4914", "4435", "4915"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "", "ws_block_best_season": "", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "-1", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "Cost Inclusion ", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-white", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Why Travel With Us?", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc4e9c19160", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_block_video_widgets": "field_63eef38026ee6", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "", "ws_trip_galleries_title": "Photo/Visual Gallery", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "_ws_trip_galleries_title": "field_63ec89128acaa", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Chitwan Sightseeing (Jungle Safari, Tharu Village Tour, Canoeing, Sunset View)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Phenomenal Sunrise View from Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pokhara Sightseeing (Lakeside View, Davis Fall, Phewa Lake Boating, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Cherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "ws_trip_information_list": 11, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec94565c587", "starter_kit_section_title": "Day to Day Journey", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private vehicle with air conditioning</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan and Chitwan National park</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Breakfast in Kathmandu and Pokhara</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Monuments entrance/admission fees</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) &amp; government taxes.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "T