\t<li>Pashupatinath (Largest Hindu Temple having an open cremation area)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Swoyambhu Stupa (Monkey Temple)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Kathmandu, we will manage the tour in next day (before flight to Bhutan)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhaktapur (Durbar Square, Nyatapola Temple, 55 Window Palace, Dattatreya Temple, Pottery Square etc)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Patan (Durbar Square, Golden Temple, Patan Museum, handicraft center etc.)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight to Chitwan</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lunch upon arrival at hotel of Chitwan</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around Tharu village/community</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunset view from beach of Rapti river</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Chitwan", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning Jungle walk</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Canoeing and Elephant breeding center</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Elephant Safari / Jeep Safari inside National Park</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Evening Cultural program, Tharu Dance</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Chitwan", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning Bird Watching Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>After breakfast, Drive/flight to Pokhara</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around lakeside.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit/tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning drive to Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunrise view from Himalayas</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Pokhara valley</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Phewa Lake boating</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Davis Falls</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>International Mountain Museum</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bindhyabasini Temple</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight back to Kathmandu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Rest today or walking tour around Thamel</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop to Kathmandu airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Paro airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Memorial Chorten (temple)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changangkha Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Statue of Buddha</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Weekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Punakha crossing over Dochu La Pass (3100 meters)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Dochu La Pass (views of the highest mountain peaks &amp; walk around the 108 stupas)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through the paddy field and old village to visit Chhimi Lhakhang, the temple of fertility.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Khamsum Yuley Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "<div id=\\"collapse-10\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-10\\">\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Paro (base for the hike)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Airport Bird's Eye View Point, Paro</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Paro\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 11 days", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Including Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Chitwan \\\\u0026 Pokhara | Thimphu, Punakha \\\\u0026 Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eChitwan Sightseeing (Jungle Safari, Tharu Village Tour, Canoeing, Sunset View)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePhenomenal Sunrise View from Sarangkot\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePokhara Sightseeing (Lakeside View, Davis Fall, Phewa Lake Boating, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eCherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePunakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":[\\"pb-0\\"],\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour 10 nights 11 days (7 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWe take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nEverest Vacation has created a fabulous Nepal Bhutan Tour 10 nights 11 days package to these beautiful Himalayan nations. Visitors have the flexibility to customize the itinerary to their preferences. Explore the UNESCO-listed sites in Nepal including the artistically marvelous Durbar Squares in Kathmandu Valley. Connect closely to nature while visiting Chitwan and Pokhara. The Chitwan tour includes an amazing Jungle Safari with fun activities and a Tharu Village tour. Pokhara sightseeing includes attractive places with a Phewa Lake boating. Walk a tour around the Thamel area and go shopping, which is a great way to wrap up the Nepal tour.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nA visit to the mystical Tiger’s Nest Monastery, and the serene towns of Thimphu, Paro, and \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punakha\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003ePunakha\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e astounds the visitors. Explore ancient Dzongs, the giant Great Buddha Dordenma, a beautiful old Paro town, stunning Punakha Dzong, and the world-renowned Chhimi Lhakhang temple. Get awesome views of the highest mountain peaks from Dochu La Pass \\\\u0026amp; walk around the 108 stupas. The itinerary is flexible to customize and travelers can choose the best package that best suits them. Create cherished memories of a lifetime during these tours.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"4821\\",\\"527\\",\\"611\\",\\"613\\",\\"4281\\",\\"4287\\",\\"766\\",\\"4328\\",\\"4319\\",\\"4302\\",\\"4440\\",\\"4914\\",\\"4435\\",\\"4915\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_b