3eChitwan Sightseeing (Jungle Safari, Tharu Village Tour, Canoeing, Sunset View)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePhenomenal Sunrise View from Sarangkot\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePokhara Sightseeing (Lakeside View, Davis Fall, Phewa Lake Boating, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eCherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePunakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour 10 days (6 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWe take care of your Visa of Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-7-nights-8-days/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e  9 nights 10 days by Everest Vacation is the perfect package for all travelers wishing to explore these majestic countries. Visitors have the flexibility to customize the itinerary to their preferences. Explore the UNESCO-listed sites in Nepal including the architecturally aesthetic Durbar Squares in Kathmandu and Bhaktapur. Delve deeply into nature while visiting Chitwan and \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pokhara\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003ePokhara\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e. The Jungle Safari in Chitwan and mountain views while boating in Pokhara are appealing.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nExplore the 3 beautiful cities of Paro, Thimphu, and Punakha during the Bhutan tour. Visit fabulous landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu. The mountain range views from Dochu La Pass are breathtaking. Punakha excursion includes visiting the Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, the second-oldest Punakha Dzong. Visiting amazing places like Paro Dzong, old Paro Town, Kyichu Lhakhang, and the iconic Tiger’s Nest Monastery in Paro is delightful.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"527\\",\\"611\\",\\"613\\",\\"609\\",\\"4281\\",\\"4287\\",\\"766\\",\\"4328\\",\\"4319\\",\\"4302\\",\\"4439\\",\\"4440\\",\\"4435\\",\\"4444\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_sec