\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/tiger-nest-in-bhutan.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/swoyambhu-monkey-temple.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/local-people-bungmati.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/bhaktapur-city-of-arts-e1706022904337.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/antique-bell.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/phewa-lake-pokhara-1.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/saangkot-pokhara.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/bhaktapur-durbar-square.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Thimphu-Tour-bhutan.jpeg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/thimphu-buddha-statue.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/punakha-tour.jpeg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=1056", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "1056", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2023-12-25 07:15:33", "post_date_gmt": "2023-12-25 07:15:33", "post_modified": "2024-11-13 11:56:05", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-11-13 11:56:05"}}, "overviewImage": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/tiger-nest-in-bhutan-tour.jpg", "customSections": [{"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Nepal Bhutan Tour 9 nights 10 days (5 nights in Nepal and 4 nights in Bhutan)</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa of Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Nepal Bhutan Tour 9 nights 10 days by Everest Vacation is the ideal package for all travelers wishing to explore these majestic nations. Explore attractive destinations including Durbar Squares listed as UNESCO World Heritage Sites in Nepal. The lovely tourist capital city of Pokhara welcomes you with beautiful mountain vistas during the flight. The Sarangkot hike with a sunrise view is remarkable. Explore the lakeside and other popular places in Pokhara with Phewa Lake boating. Free time walking around the Thamel area and shopping is a great way to conclude the Nepal tour.\\r\\n\\r\\nExplore the beautiful cities of Paro, <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thimphu\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Thimphu</a>, Phobjikha, and Punakha during the Bhutan tour. Visit Thimphu’s marvelous landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. Cherish the stunning views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass. Punakha Sightseeing is incomplete without visiting the Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, the second-oldest Punakha Dzong. Phobjikha remote village tour with a natural trail hike is a unique experience. Paro's visit is amusing with Paro Dzong, old Paro Town, Kyichu Lhakhang, and the iconic Tiger’s Nest Monastery. Explore freely and create some remarkable memories."], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Nepal Bhutan Tour 9 nights 10 days (5 nights in Nepal and 4 nights in Bhutan)</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa of Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Nepal Bhutan Tour 9 nights 10 days by Everest Vacation is the ideal package for all travelers wishing to explore these majestic nations. Explore attractive destinations including Durbar Squares listed as UNESCO World Heritage Sites in Nepal. The lovely tourist capital city of Pokhara welcomes you with beautiful mountain vistas during the flight. The Sarangkot hike with a sunrise view is remarkable. Explore the lakeside and other popular places in Pokhara with Phewa Lake boating. Free time walking around the Thamel area and shopping is a great way to conclude the Nepal tour.\\r\\n\\r\\nExplore the beautiful cities of Paro, <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thimphu\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Thimphu</a>, Phobjikha, and Punakha during the Bhutan tour. Visit Thimphu’s marvelous landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. Cherish the stunning views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass. Punakha Sightseeing is incomplete without visiting the Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, the second-oldest Punakha Dzong. Phobjikha remote village tour with a natural trail hike is a unique experience. Paro's visit is amusing with Paro Dzong, old Paro Town, Kyichu Lhakhang, and the iconic Tiger’s Nest Monastery. Explore freely and create some remarkable memories."}, {"id": "overview-2", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Outdoor Extra Activities", "content": ["Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Hiking:</strong> Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>River rafting: </strong>Thrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal and Bhutan on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Paragliding: </strong>Relish amazing panoramic Himalayan views, scenic landscapes, and beautiful surroundings\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Zipline: </strong>Experience the longest and steepest zipline in Nepal and admire scenic surroundings (Currently no zip line in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Bungee jump: </strong>Adrenaline rush experience through bungee jumping in Nepal amidst beautiful surrounding scenery (Not permitted in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Yoga and meditation: </strong>Practice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Helicopter tours: </strong>Exciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>National Park Tour: </strong>Wildlife Jungle Safari in a jeep or elephant to explore the region’s rich biodiversity, witness diverse flora and fauna, and get close to nature"], "description": "Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Hiking:</strong> Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>River rafting: </strong>Thrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal and Bhutan on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Paragliding: </strong>Relish amazing panoramic Himalayan views, scenic landscapes, and beautiful surroundings\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Zipline: </strong>Experience the longest and steepest zipline in Nepal and admire scenic surroundings (Currently no zip line in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Bungee jump: </strong>Adrenaline rush experience through bungee jumping in Nepal amidst beautiful surrounding scenery (Not permitted in Bhutan)\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Yoga and meditation: </strong>Practice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Helicopter tours: </strong>Exciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>National Park Tour: </strong>Wildlife Jungle Safari in a jeep or elephant to explore the region’s rich biodiversity, witness diverse flora and fauna, and get close to nature"}, {"id": "overview-3", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Best time to visit", "content": ["<h3>High season (Best Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>March to May</strong> with the blooming flowers covering the hillsides, warm temperatures, stable weather with low humidity and rainfall, clear skies with clear views, and lush greenery everywhere.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>September to November </strong>with mild temperatures, stable weather, clear skies, and phenomenal views.\\r\\n<h3>Shoulder season (Good Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>December to February </strong>with sunny day weather and slightly cold nights &amp; mornings, mild day temperatures, clear surrounding views, and fewer crowds which is perfect for visitors seeking a peaceful visit.\\r\\n<h3>Low or Off-season (Average Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>June to August </strong>with unstable weather and temperature, high humidity, light to heavy rainfall, mostly obstructed views, but lush greenery everywhere. High chances of flight cancelations and roadblocks due to floods &amp; landslides in some places."], "description": "<h3>High season (Best Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>March to May</strong> with the blooming flowers covering the hillsides, warm temperatures, stable weather with low humidity and rainfall, clear skies with clear views, and lush greenery everywhere.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>September to November </strong>with mild temperatures, stable weather, clear skies, and phenomenal views.\\r\\n<h3>Shoulder season (Good Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>December to February </strong>with sunny day weather and slightly cold nights &amp; mornings, mild day temperatures, clear surrounding views, and fewer crowds which is perfect for visitors seeking a peaceful visit.\\r\\n<h3>Low or Off-season (Average Time):</h3>\\r\\n<strong>June to August </strong>with unstable weather and temperature, high humidity, light to heavy rainfall, mostly obstructed views, but lush greenery everywhere. High chances of flight cancelations and roadblocks due to floods &amp; landslides in some places."}, {"id": "overview-4", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Nepal-Bhutan Tour: Is It Right for You?", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>A perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Accompanied by experienced local guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Comfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Technical Climbing is not involved during the trip</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>A perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Accompanied by experienced local guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Comfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Technical Climbing is not involved during the trip</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "overview-5", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Why Travel With Us?", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa", "Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan", "Breakfast in Nepal", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa", "Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan", "Breakfast in Nepal", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day to Day Journey", "sub_description": "5 nights in Nepal including Pokhara and 4 nights in Bhutan", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 9 nights 10 days is an ideal package for all travelers wishing to explore the nature and culture of these majestic nations.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Cost Inclusion"}	2023-12-25 07:15:33+00	2024-11-13 11:56:05+00
217	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "3 nights in Kathmandu, Nagarkot and 3 nights in Bhutan", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "7", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "5", "_edit_lock": "1723967332:5", "_dp_original": "808", "_thumbnail_id": "4455", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "3 nights in Kathmandu, Nagarkot and 3 nights in Bhutan", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "7", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 6 nights 7 days", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 6 nights 7 days", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "44", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Explore the beautiful cultural landmarks, historical sites, and adventures during Nepal Bhutan Tour 6 nights 7 days.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "nepal-bhutan-tour-6-nights-7-days", "tags": [], "title": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 6 nights 7 days", "duration": "7 Days", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Nepal Bhutan Tour 6 nights 7 days (3 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa of Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nEverest Vacation has developed a fantastic Nepal Bhutan Tour 6 nights 7 days weekly package that is adjustable and custom-made. Explore the UNESCO Heritage sites including Durbar Squares in Kathmandu. They have great historical and cultural significance and are uniquely spectacular. Village tours include beautiful <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagarkot\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Nagarkot</a> popular for sunrise &amp; sunset, and ancient Dhulikhel and Panauti.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to the ‘The Himalayan Kingdom’ of <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-5-nights-6-days/\\">Bhutan</a> and visit the beautiful cities of Paro, Thimphu, and Punakha. The ancient Dzongs, holy temples &amp; Lhakhang, and the weekend market visit are rewarding. Adore the phenomenal Himalayas from Dochu La Pass and pay homage to 108 stupas. Paro Taktsang or Tiger’s Nest Monastery holds great spiritual significance. A hike to this monastery offers scenic landscapes, beautiful views, and deep cultural insights. Enjoy this 7-day Nepal Bhutan tour, which perfectly blends culture, history, and natural beauty and ensures a remarkable journey."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Arrival in Kathmandu and Kathmandu Sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Kathmandu (TIA) airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Boudhanath ( A large Buddhist Stupa)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pashupatinath (Largest Hindu Temple having open cremation area)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Swoyambhu Stupa (Monkey Temple)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Kathmandu, we will manage the tour in next day (before flight to Bhutan)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "driveTime": "Approx, 30 minutes drive from airport to hotel.", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 2, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Bhaktapur, Changu Narayan and Nagarkot Tour", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhaktapur Durbar Square</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changu Narayan Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Nagarkot for panoramic view of the Himalayas and Kathmandu Valley</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Nagarkot", "driveTime": "Approx, 40 minutes drive to Bhaktapur and 1 hour drive to Nagakot from Bhaktapur", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 3, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Nagarkot Sunrise, Dhulikhel and Patan Tour", "richText": "<div id=\\"collapse-3\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-3\\">\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunrise from Nagarkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Dhulikhel from Nagarkot after breakfast</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking ancient town of <strong>Panauti</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Mountain views from Dhulikhel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Kathmandu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Patan Durbar Square</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu</div>", "driveTime": "Approx, 1 hour 15 minutes drive to Dhulikhel/Panauti and 1 hour drive to Kathamndu from Dhulikhel.", "elevation": "2175m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 4, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Fly Kathmandu to Paro(Bhutan), drive to Thimphu and Thimphu sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop to Kathmandu airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Paro airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Memorial Chorten (temple)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changangkha Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Statue of Buddha</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Weekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "driveTime": "Approx, 1 hour 30 minutes drive from Paro to Thimphu.", "elevation": "2200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 5, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Punakha Day Tour (Thimphu - Dochu La Pass – Punakha – Thimphu)", "richText": "<div id=\\"collapse-5\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-5\\">\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Punakha crossing over Dochu La Pass (3100 meters)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Dochu La Pass (views of the highest mountain peaks &amp; walk around the 108 stupas)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through the paddy field and old village to visit Chhimi Lhakhang, the temple of fertility.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Khamsum Yuley Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>", "driveTime": "Approx, 2 hours 30 minutes drive from Thimphu to Punakha", "elevation": "2200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Drive to Paro, Hike to Taktsang Monastery and Paro Tour", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Paro (base for the hike)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Airport Bird's Eye View Point, Paro</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Paro", "driveTime": "Approx, 1 hour 30 minutes drive from Thimphu to Paro.", "elevation": "1950m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Final Departure / Tour end", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/with-bhutan-guide-1.jpeg", "title": "with bhutan guide", "altText": "Our guests with bhutan guide", "caption": "Our guests with bhutan guide", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["4246", "527", "625", "4337", "603", "739", "4897", "4462", "3869", "3949", "4434", "4397", "4447", "4446"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "", "ws_block_best_season": "", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "2", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "Cost Inclusion ", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-white", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Why Travel With Us?", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc4e9c19160", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_block_video_widgets": "field_63eef38026ee6", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "", "ws_trip_galleries_title": "Photo/Visual Gallery", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "_ws_trip_galleries_title": "field_63ec89128acaa", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Nagarkot for a panoramic view of Himalayas and Kathmandu valley (Sunset / Sunrise also popular)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Cherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "ws_trip_information_list": 7, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec94565c587", "starter_kit_section_title": "", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private vehicle with air conditioning</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Breakfast in Nepal</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Monuments entrance/admission fees</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) &amp; government taxes.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan)).</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_test