 Development Fees</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Breakfast and Diner in hotels, Lunch will be in outside of hotel (Restaurant).</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>English speaking Bhutan licensed guide</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Entrance, museums and park fees indicated in the itinerary</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bottled drinking water throughout the journeys</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "Bhutan Short Tour 3 days itinerary provides you an excellent opportunity to explore Bhutan’s popular places within a short stay in this magical “Land of the Thunder Dragon”. Bhutan is a tiny nation full of beautiful sceneries, the greater Himalayas, ancient Buddhist monasteries, Dzongs, Chortens, prayer wheels, and natural beauties.\\r\\n\\r\\n<a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/bhutan-tour-5-days/\\">Bhutan</a> is rich in arts and crafts, verdant greenery forests, and beautiful towns with unique cultural festivals. Beautiful sightseeing around Thimphu and Paro. <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buddha_Dordenma_statue\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Great Buddha Dordenma</a>, Tiger’s Nest, Tashichho Dzong, and National Museum are some major attractions in Bhutan.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe help you make the most out of your three days in Bhutan with our detailed itinerary.  We assure you that you enjoy the natural and cultural beauty of Bhutan.", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_