y (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKyichu Lhakhang, one of the oldest temples in Bhutan\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nOvernight at Paro\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_di_days\\":\\"12\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Final Departure / Tour end\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrop you to Paro airport from your hotel\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eReturn with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":12,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cblockquote\\\\u003eWe are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e(\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNote:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/blockquote\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBhutan Travel Permit and Visa\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate vehicle with air conditioning\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBreakfast in Nepal\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMonuments entrance/admission fees\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eGuide and driver’s meals and accommodation\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eService Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) \\\\u0026amp; government taxes.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHandle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Outdoor Extra Activities\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHiking:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eRiver rafting: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eThrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal and Bhutan on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eParagliding: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eRelish amazing panoramic Himalayan views, scenic landscapes, and beautiful surroundings\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eZipline: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eExperience the longest and steepest zipline in Nepal and admire scenic surroundings (Currently no zip line in Bhutan)\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eBungee jump: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eAdrenaline rush experience through bungee jumping in Nepal amidst beautiful surrounding scenery (Not permitted in Bhutan)\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eYoga and meditation: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ePractice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHelicopter tours: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eExciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp \\\\u0026amp; Annapurna Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Best time to visit\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eHigh season (Best Time):\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eMarch to May\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e with the blooming flowers covering the hillsides, warm temperatures, stable weather with low humidity and rainfall, clear skies with clear views, and lush greenery everywhere.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eSeptember to November \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ewith mild temperatures, stable weather, clear skies, and phenomenal views.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eShoulder season (Good Time):\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eDecember to February \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ewith sunny day weather and slightly cold nights \\\\u0026amp; mornings, mild day temperatures, clear surrounding views, and fewer crowds which is perfect for visitors seeking a peaceful visit.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eLow or Off-season (Average Time):\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eJune to August \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ewith unstable weather and temperature, high humidity, light to heavy rainfall, mostly obstructed views, but lush greenery everywhere. High chances of flight cancelations and roadblocks due to floods \\\\u0026amp; landslides in some places.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Nepal-Bhutan Tour: Is It Right for You?\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eA perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSuitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAccompanied by experienced local guides\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eComfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTechnical Climbing is not involved during the trip\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike through forested trails which is medium.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAn experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Why Travel With Us?\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e24/7 International Support\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Private and Customize Trips\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSafety: Our Topmost Priority\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSecure Online Payment\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBookings and Payments Flexibility\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eLifetime Deposit Guaranteed\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eGuaranteed Departures\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTravel with Locals to support locals\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eExperienced Team and Expert Guides\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eRespect Nature through Responsible Tourism\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHappiness and Best Priced Assured\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"-1\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "descriptions": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Including Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan \\\\u0026 Chandragiri hills | Thimphu, Punakha, Pobhjikha, Trongsa, Bumthang Valley \\\\u0026 Paro\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eChandragiri sightseeing for panoramic views of Kathmandu Valley and the Himalayan ranges from Annapurna to Everest.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAn option to visit a village and a farmhouse for lunch/dinner\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eCherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePunakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Buddhist Stupas, local History of and culture ,Local lifestyle\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour 11 nights 12 days (3 nights in Nepal and 8 nights in Bhutan)\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWe take care of your Visa to Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at Kathmandu (TIA) airport.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThe \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-10-nights-11-days-2/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e 11 nights 12 days package designed by Everest Vacation is tremendous. Visit the Himalayan nations of Nepal and Bhutan. Visit iconic landmarks, immerse in their culture, and enjoy the uniqueness of these captivating destinations. In Nepal, explore the cultural city of Kathmandu, the oldest Changu Narayan temple, and architecturally marvelous Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Durbar Squares. A scenic cable car ride to the lovely Chandragiri Hill mesmerizes you with panoramic views of the Himalayan ranges.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nExplore the beautiful cities of Thimphu, Punakha, Trongsa, Jakar, \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phobjikha_Valley\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003ePhobjikha\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, and Paro in Bhutan. All these amazing destinations have diverse offerings for visitors. Visit iconic landmarks such as Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Memorial Chorten, ancient Dzongs, and Tiger’s Nest Monastery. The Phobjikha trail hike takes you closer to nature. The Bumthang Valley excursion is full of amazing surprises which we ensure will enthrall visitors. Get rewarded by the phenomenal mountain views from the Dochu La Pass.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"start