er_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"10 days \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/jomsom-muktinath-4wd-tour/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eJomsom Muktinath\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e Trekking in Nepal is an amazing trek in the Annapurna region. Starting with a scenic drive from Kathmandu to Pokhara, the trek commences with a drive to Nayapul and a walk to Tikhedhunga. Traverse through beautiful settlements and experience a local lifestyle living there. \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marpha\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMarpha\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e is famous for apple farming and brandy. Try some or get some as a souvenir. Reach Muktinath, the holy temple at an elevation of 3,800m. Visit the temple and adore the surrounding scenic landscapes.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Upper Mustang Trek\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Drive Kathmandu to Pokhara \\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_informat