ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"A short \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eGosainkunda pass trekking\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e can be organized from near the Kathmandu valley. Also, we can take a drive to Gosainkunda which will take about 8 hours from Kathmandu. This trekking is a perfect mixture of cultural heritage and nature. Trek also touches the Langtang region through Dhunche. Langtang is also one of the popular trekking destinations in Nepal. It’s probably the only trek that leads trekkers more than 4000 m high within a short period. This trek offers a magnificent view of alpine valleys, high Himalayas, and typical cultural heritage.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nGosainkunda Lake is one of the most religious and famous places of pilgrimage situated at 4,380m above sea level. Every year in Janai Purnima thousands of Hindu pilgrims come here for a holy bath, believing that sins are a relief after taking a bath in this sacred lake. During this trek, we can get a majestic view of the highest mountain around the lake. Gosainkunda trek is preferable for those trekkers who want a short and less expensive trek.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-