opener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-view-from-pokhara-scaled.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pashupati-temple-load-shiva.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/sunrise-view-from-sarangkot-enjoying-scaled.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/paragliding-at-pokhara-scaled.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/chitwan-elephant-safari.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/fewa-lake-pokhara.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pokhara-david-falls.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-flight-everest.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/chitwan-national-park-tour-1.jpg", "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/david-falls.jpg"], "importSource": {"guid": "https://wildstonesolution.com/demo/ev/?post_type=trip&#038;p=3532", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "3532", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2024-01-04 07:40:44", "post_date_gmt": "2024-01-04 07:40:44", "post_modified": "2024-05-17 07:11:40", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-05-17 07:11:40"}}, "customSections": [{"id": 1, "type": "paragraph", "title": "Extended Tours", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Overview", "content": ["<strong>Scenic Cultural Kathmandu and Pokhara Tour</strong> starts from <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathmandu\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu</a>; it has dozens of ethnic groups and more than a half-dozen UNESCO World Heritage sites. <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/cultural-scenic-tour-kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-lumbini/\\"><strong>Pokhara</strong></a> is a laid-back city that has a small-town vibe. Scattered through all parts of the city are temples, monasteries, and stupas. Near the main strip of Pokhara lies Phewa Lake.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Activities</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\nTour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath, and Bouddhanath\\r\\nTour of Patan (Lalitpur) &amp; Bhaktapur\\r\\nMorning scenic Mountain Flight and fly/drive to Pokhara with tour\\r\\nMorning to Sarangkot &amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake.\\r\\n<h3>Outline Itinerary</h3>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swoyambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan &amp; Bhaktapur durbar square\\r\\nDay 03: Morning scenic Mountain Flight and fly/drive to Pokhara with tour.\\r\\nDay 04: Morning to Sarankot &amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake.\\r\\nDay 05: Drive/flight back to Kathmandu"], "description": "<strong>Scenic Cultural Kathmandu and Pokhara Tour</strong> starts from <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathmandu\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu</a>; it has dozens of ethnic groups and more than a half-dozen UNESCO World Heritage sites. <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/cultural-scenic-tour-kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-lumbini/\\"><strong>Pokhara</strong></a> is a laid-back city that has a small-town vibe. Scattered through all parts of the city are temples, monasteries, and stupas. Near the main strip of Pokhara lies Phewa Lake.\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Activities</strong>\\r\\n\\r\\nTour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath, and Bouddhanath\\r\\nTour of Patan (Lalitpur) &amp; Bhaktapur\\r\\nMorning scenic Mountain Flight and fly/drive to Pokhara with tour\\r\\nMorning to Sarangkot &amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake.\\r\\n<h3>Outline Itinerary</h3>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swoyambhunath, Pashupatinath and Bouddhanath\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan &amp; Bhaktapur durbar square\\r\\nDay 03: Morning scenic Mountain Flight and fly/drive to Pokhara with tour.\\r\\nDay 04: Morning to Sarankot &amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake.\\r\\nDay 05: Drive/flight back to Kathmandu"}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["All taxes, fees and handling charges", "Private Driver & Guide", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Private Tour", "Drinking water", "Transport by private AC car"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["All taxes, fees and handling charges", "Private Driver & Guide", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Private Tour", "Drinking water", "Transport by private AC car"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "Durbar Squares, Pashupatinath, Bouddhanath, Pokhara tour with Sarangkot sunrise tour above the himalayas", "trip_highlights": "<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\"col-lg-12 info first_para\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nEverest Vacation offer you short 5 days Kathmandu Pokhara tour. This tour offers the most popular old heritage sights visit in Kathmandu valley and scenic nature trip to Pokhara. Everyone likes to see the natural beauty of Nepal after experiencing the cultural tour and lake tour in Pokhara.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "Scenic Cultural Kathmandu and Pokhara Tour is a perfect gateway from busy lives and spend some quality time adoring its natural beauty.", "trip_attractions": "Pashupatinath, Everest Mountain flight (Optional), Pokhara city tour, Sarankot sunrise tour", "trip_best_season": "Any Season", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "Breakfast, lunch & dinner", "start_end": "", "attractions": "Pashupatinath, Everest Mountain flight (Optional), Pokhara city tour, Sarankot sunrise tour", "best_season": "Any Season", "accommodation": "Hotel with all category depends on your budget and interest", "max_elevation": "2175 meters", "transportation": "Private AC Vehicle"}, "trip_accommodation": "Hotel with all category depends on your budget and interest", "trip_max_elevation": "2175 meters", "trip_transportations": "Private AC Vehicle", "trip_highlights_title": "4 nights 5 days Kathmandu & Pokhara Tour with Everest mountain flight or helicopter"}	2024-01-04 07:40:44+00	2024-05-17 08:11:40+01
235	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Kathmandu, Pokhara & Lumbini, Birth place of Lord Buddha.", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "7", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "2", "_edit_lock": "1715931529:2", "_dp_original": "765", "_thumbnail_id": "559", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "Kathmandu, Pokhara & Lumbini, Birth place of Lord Buddha.", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "7", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Kathmandu Pokhara & Lumbini Cultural Historical Scenic Tour", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "40", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Kathmandu Pokhara & Lumbini Cultural Historical Scenic Tour is a great destination to explore the natural and cultural beauty in Nepal.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "cultural-historical-scenic-tour", "tags": [], "title": "Cultural, Historical & Scenic Tour", "duration": "7 Days", "overview": {"title": "Overview", "description": "This 7-day guided sightseeing tour of <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/cultural-scenic-tour-kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-lumbini/\\">Kathmandu</a>, Patan, Bhaktapur, Pokhara &amp; <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lumbini\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Lumbini</a> with an experienced English-speaking guide and driver. Lumbini, the birthplace of Gautam Buddha, and Pokhara, a city of beautiful lakes &amp; mountain views tours include major historical, cultural, and religious landmarks with delightful scenery. Explore world heritage sites, caves, lakes, eye-catching Himalayas views with sunrise, Maya Devi temple, and monasteries including the scenic drive.\\r\\n<h3>Outline Itinerary</h3>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square, Swoyambhunath, Pashupatinath\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan &amp; Bhaktapur\\r\\nDay 03: Morning drive/flight to Pokhara overland journey\\r\\nDay 04: Morning to Sarankot &amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake\\r\\nDay 05: Drive to Lumbini birth place of Lord Buddha\\r\\nDay 06: Tour of Lumbini interesting places\\r\\nDay 07: Drive/flight back to Kathmandu by overland"}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath", "richText": "Morning 9 a.m. departure from the hotel for guided sightseeing tour of historical and cultural tour with delightful scenery around Kathmandu city with Everest Vacation, a short ride to <strong>Kathmandu Durbar Square</strong>, visit of places with old history and rich culture of old king’s durbar square and Hanuman Dhoka (palace) visit of ancient Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu name derived from) this temple built of wood from a single tree, tour of Kumari Goddess (living virgin goddess) Kumari a very young girl, after teenage years phase replaced by another young Kumari, from here a short drive to west of the city at Swayambhunath Stupa located on a hill top, with panorama view of Kathmandu city, surrounding green hills with snow capped mountains in the north.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis old Stupa of <strong>Swayambhunath</strong>, the oldest historical monument listed as World Heritage Sites with over 2, 5000 years old Buddhist religion area with huge dome shape stupa overlooking four cardinal eyes of Buddha around North, South, East and West directions. Here visiting monastery and chapels, Sywambhunath is guarded with lovely woodland with a many monkeys around, this place is also named as “Monkey Temple”.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom here another tour leads to <strong>Pashupatinath </strong><strong>Temple</strong>, where non Hindu are not permitted inside the main temple entrance, where visitors can have a look of the temple surrounding from above the Bagmati river, this famous Shiva temple decorated with golden tier roofs with silver doors around each corner, this place close to green woodland with lots of monkeys around. Pashupatinath is full of pilgrims in special day on Shiva Ratri (birth anniversary of lord Shiva).\\r\\n\\r\\nNearby on the side of the river funeral and cremation are held for all Hindus, from here return back to your hotels at leisure for the rest of afternoon.", "driveTime": "5-6 hrs", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner"}, {"day": 2, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Patan & Bhaktapur Sightseeing", "richText": "Starting the morning with a short drive towards Patan city located south of Kathmandu at mere distance across the bridge, on reaching Patan also known as Lalitpur meaning “city of arts” visit the old Palace complex, courtyard (Durbar) with tall terracotta palace, impressive window carvings, and a tall Krishna Temple with Garuda pillar, a vehicle of Lord Vishnu and Lord Krishna, from here a pleasant ride to valley 03rd biggest city, this old looking city at one time Nepal capital during Malla period in 12th to 15th century.\\r\\n\\r\\nBhaktapur famous for arts and crafts like woodcarving and pottery, tour of unique Durbar Square with golden gate of 55 windows palace, interesting wooden peacock window, continue tour of Bhaktapur visiting another Durbar Square with famed Nytapola Temple, Bhaktapur National Art Gallery, and Bhairavnath Temple.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a lovely and interesting day return back to hotel with afternoon free at leisure.", "driveTime": "4-5 hrs", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner"}, {"day": 3, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Morning drive/flight to Pokhara", "richText": "Morning depart from the hotel for a scenic and interesting drive towards Nepal’s and Himalayan countries most scenic and touristic spot of Pokhara with its serene lakes, drive leads past Kathmandu valley towards warmer area passing by farm villages, towns with distant views of snow capped mountains, after a good interesting drive reaching at Pokhara, and transfer to respective hotels by the lake Phewa with afternoon free at leisure", "driveTime": "5-6 hrs drive / 30 minute flight", "elevation": "822m", "accommodation": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner"}, {"day": 4, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Morning to Sarangkot & Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake.", "richText": "At Pokhara tour begins early morning with a short drive to a hill side at Sarankot for stunning sunrise view over array of snow capped mountains from world’s 7th highest Mt. Dhaulagiri 8,167 m, 10th highest Mt. Annapurna 8,091 m and 8th highest Mt. Manaslu 8,163 m including range of smaller peaks with ever present majestic Mt. Machhapuchhre “Fish Tail” standing high at 6,993 meters.\\r\\n\\r\\nSarankot hill top the tallest spot at 1, 460 meters with super views of mountains, Pokhara green valley and its city with Phewa Lake below, beside the fabulous panorama famous for paragliding which is one of the most popular adventure sports around this scenic place, after a tremendous panorama views back to hotel for breakfast and tour of Bhare Temple located in the middle of the lake in peaceful environment, boating for an hour and back to hotel.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfternoon local tour of David’s fall or Pathelo Chhango a huge volume of waterfalls (depending upon the season) and visit the nearby Gupteshwor Cave a deep cave where Seti River flows with torrent speed, this cave with lord Shiva temple, after a great moment transfer back to hotel with rest of the afternoon and evening at leisure.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "1600m", "accommodation": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner"}, {"day": 5, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Drive to Lumbini, birth place of Lord Buddha", "richText": "After an enjoyable time at Pokhara with grand views of Annapurna, Manaslu range with Mt. Machhapuchhre, Everest Vacation next historical tour leads with an interesting drive towards south west at lower country of Nepal passing nice farm villages and towns of Butwal and Bhairawa and then reaching at Rupendehi in Lumbini the famous holy Buddhist place and world heritage site, here transfer to nice hotels close to birth place of lord Buddha the ‘Light of Asia’.", "driveTime": "6-7 hrs", "elevation": "150m", "accommodation": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Tour of Lumbini interesting places", "richText": "Morning our guide will receive for an interesting historical tour of Lumbini, the main attraction at Lumbini, sacred garden spread over 8 sq. km with ancient valuable artifacts and treasures of this historic area.\\r\\n\\r\\nMayadevi temple is the main attraction for pilgrims and archeologists alike, to the south of the temple a sacred pond – Puskarni – where Queen Mayadevi took a bath just before giving birth to Siddhartha Gautama Buddha. There are more than fifty monasteries around the area, visit of different monasteries from different Buddhist schools, Chinese monastery, Japanese monastery, Korean monastery, Tibetan monastery, Thai monastery, Sri Lanka after a grand tour retire back to hotel.", "driveTime": "5-6 hrs", "elevation": "150m", "accommodation": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Drive/flight back to Kathmandu", "richText": "<div id=\\"collapse-7\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-7\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a grand time in this historical and religious place of Lumbini, morning drive leads past many farm fields, villages and towns with views of snow capped mountain along the drive, on reaching at Mugling town follow the Trisuli river upstream for a while and then uphill leaving the warm low area to reach Kathmandu valley, in Kathmandu rest of the afternoon free at leisure for individual activities.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>", "driveTime": "7-8 hrs drive / 1 hour flight", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/historical-day-tour.jpg", "title": "Historical Monuments in Kathmandu", "altText": "historical-day-tour", "caption": "historical-day-tour", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["766", "4331", "4303", "3931", "529", "4342", "4282", "4283", "4293", "4306", "733", "558", "768", "4825"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "Kathmandu Durbar Square, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath, Bhaktapur, Patan, Pokhara (sunrise tour at Sarangkot, Cave, Waterfalls, boating, temple), Lumbini (A birth place of Lord Buddha)", "ws_block_best_season": "Any Season", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "2", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "What's not included?", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-light", "ws_block_accommodation": "Hotel with all category depends on your budget and interest", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_block_video_widgets": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-exclude", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Overview", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc6695edb31", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_block_video_widgets": "field_63eef38026ee6", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "Private AC Vehicle", "ws_trip_galleries_title": "Photo/Visual Gallery", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "_ws_trip_galleries_title": "field_63ec89128acaa", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "", "ws_trip_information_list": 1, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec90a574f02", "starter_kit_section_title": "Day by Day Activities", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "ws_trip_overview_description": "This 7-day guided sightseeing tour of <a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/cultural-scenic-tour-kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-lumbini/\\">Kathmandu</a>, Patan, Bhaktapur, Pokhara &amp; <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lumbini\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Lumbini</a> with an experienced English-speaking guide and driver. Lumbini, the birthplace of Gautam Buddha, and Pokhara, a city of beautiful lakes &amp; mountain views tours include major historical, cultural, and religious landmarks with delightful scenery. Explore world heritage sites, caves, lakes, eye-catching Himalayas views with sunrise, Maya Devi temple, and monasteries including the scenic drive.\\r\\n<h3>Outline Itinerary</h3>\\r\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square, Swoyambhunath, Pashupatinath\\r\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan &amp; Bhaktapur\\r\\nDay 03: Morning drive/flight to Pokhara overland journey\\r\\nDay 04: Morning to Sarankot &amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake\\r\\nDay 05: Drive to Lumbini birth place of Lord Buddha\\r\\nDay 06: Tour of Lumbini interesting places\\r\\nDay 07: Drive/flight back to Kathmandu by overland", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "starter_kit_testimonial_title": "Traveler's Reviews", "_starter_kit_testimonial_title": "field_63ba53af6b053", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "6 nights 7 days Kathmandu Valley with Pokhara & Lumbini Tour ", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "04", "ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days": "05", "ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days": "06", "ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days": "07", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food": "", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food": "Breakfast", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food": "Breakfast", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food": "Breakfast", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_food":