tinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_hotel": "field_63ec96e3878e0", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_title": "field_63ec945663e31", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "Extended Tours", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title": "field_63ec91180462f", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "5-6 hrs", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration": "4-5 hrs", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration": "5-6 hrs drive / 30 minute flight", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration": "", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_duration": "6-7 hrs", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration": "5-6 hrs", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration": " 7-8 hrs drive / 1 hour flight", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration": "field_63ec96a0878df", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "822m", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1600m", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "150m", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "150m", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "1400m", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation": "field_63ec967a59e99", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "Morning 9 a.m. departure from the hotel for guided sightseeing tour of historical and cultural tour with delightful scenery around Kathmandu city with Everest Vacation, a short ride to <strong>Kathmandu Durbar Square</strong>, visit of places with old history and rich culture of old king’s durbar square and Hanuman Dhoka (palace) visit of ancient Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu name derived from) this temple built of wood from a single tree, tour of Kumari Goddess (living virgin goddess) Kumari a very young girl, after teenage years phase replaced by another young Kumari, from here a short drive to west of the city at Swayambhunath Stupa located on a hill top, with panorama view of Kathmandu city, surrounding green hills with snow capped mountains in the north.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis old Stupa of <strong>Swayambhunath</strong>, the oldest historical monument listed as World Heritage Sites with over 2, 5000 years old Buddhist religion area with huge dome shape stupa overlooking four cardinal eyes of Buddha around North, South, East and West directions. Here visiting monastery and chapels, Sywambhunath is guarded with lovely woodland with a many monkeys around, this place is also named as “Monkey Temple”.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom here another tour leads to <strong>Pashupatinath </strong><strong>Temple</strong>, where non Hindu are not permitted inside the main temple entrance, where visitors can have a look of the temple surrounding from above the Bagmati river, this famous Shiva temple decorated with golden tier roofs with silver doors around each corner, this place close to green woodland with lots of monkeys around. Pashupatinath is full of pilgrims in special day on Shiva Ratri (birth anniversary of lord Shiva).\\r\\n\\r\\nNearby on the side of the river funeral and cremation are held for all Hindus, from here return back to your hotels at leisure for the rest of afternoon.", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "Starting the morning with a short drive towards Patan city located south of Kathmandu at mere distance across the bridge, on reaching Patan also known as Lalitpur meaning “city of arts” visit the old Palace complex, courtyard (Durbar) with tall terracotta palace, impressive window carvings, and a tall Krishna Temple with Garuda pillar, a vehicle of Lord Vishnu and Lord Krishna, from here a pleasant ride to valley 03rd biggest city, this old looking city at one time Nepal capital during Malla period in 12th to 15th century.\\r\\n\\r\\nBhaktapur famous for arts and crafts like woodcarving and pottery, tour of unique Durbar Square with golden gate of 55 windows palace, interesting wooden peacock window, continue tour of Bhaktapur visiting another Durbar Square with famed Nytapola Temple, Bhaktapur National Art Gallery, and Bhairavnath Temple.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a lovely and interesting day return back to hotel with afternoon free at leisure.", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "Morning depart from the hotel for a scenic and interesting drive towards Nepal’s and Himalayan countries most scenic and touristic spot of Pokhara with its serene lakes, drive leads past Kathmandu valley towards warmer area passing by farm villages, towns with distant views of snow capped mountains, after a good interesting drive reaching at Pokhara, and transfer to respective hotels by the lake Phewa with afternoon free at leisure", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "At Pokhara tour begins early morning with a short drive to a hill side at Sarankot for stunning sunrise view over array of snow capped mountains from world’s 7th highest Mt. Dhaulagiri 8,167 m, 10th highest Mt. Annapurna 8,091 m and 8th highest Mt. Manaslu 8,163 m including range of smaller peaks with ever present majestic Mt. Machhapuchhre “Fish Tail” standing high at 6,993 meters.\\r\\n\\r\\nSarankot hill top the tallest spot at 1, 460 meters with super views of mountains, Pokhara green valley and its city with Phewa Lake below, beside the fabulous panorama famous for paragliding which is one of the most popular adventure sports around this scenic place, after a tremendous panorama views back to hotel for breakfast and tour of Bhare Temple located in the middle of the lake in peaceful environment, boating for an hour and back to hotel.\\r\\n\\r\\nAfternoon local tour of David’s fall or Pathelo Chhango a huge volume of waterfalls (depending upon the season) and visit the nearby Gupteshwor Cave a deep cave where Seti River flows with torrent speed, this cave with lord Shiva temple, after a great moment transfer back to hotel with rest of the afternoon and evening at leisure.", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "After an enjoyable time at Pokhara with grand views of Annapurna, Manaslu range with Mt. Machhapuchhre, Everest Vacation next historical tour leads with an interesting drive towards south west at lower country of Nepal passing nice farm villages and towns of Butwal and Bhairawa and then reaching at Rupendehi in Lumbini the famous holy Buddhist place and world heritage site, here transfer to nice hotels close to birth place of lord Buddha the ‘Light of Asia’.", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "Morning our guide will receive for an interesting historical tour of Lumbini, the main attraction at Lumbini, sacred garden spread over 8 sq. km with ancient valuable artifacts and treasures of this historic area.\\r\\n\\r\\nMayadevi temple is the main attraction for pilgrims and archeologists alike, to the south of the temple a sacred pond – Puskarni – where Queen Mayadevi took a bath just before giving birth to Siddhartha Gautama Buddha. There are more than fifty monasteries around the area, visit of different monasteries from different Buddhist schools, Chinese monastery, Japanese monastery, Korean monastery, Tibetan monastery, Thai monastery, Sri Lanka after a grand tour retire back to hotel.", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "<div id=\\"collapse-7\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-7\\">\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter a grand time in this historical and religious place of Lumbini, morning drive leads past many farm fields, villages and towns with views of snow capped mountain along the drive, on reaching at Mugling town follow the Trisuli river upstream for a while and then uphill leaving the warm low area to reach Kathmandu valley, in Kathmandu rest of the afternoon free at leisure for individual activities.\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Helicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp</a> - 4-5 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Mountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area</a> - 1 hour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Short 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu</a> - 4-6 hours</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu, Bhaktapur &amp; Patan Tour</a> - 2 days</li>\\r\\n \\t<li><a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour</a> - 4 days</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description": "field_63ec913e04630"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Cultural, Historical & Scenic Tour | Everest Vacation", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"6 nights 7 days Kathmandu Valley with Pokhara \\\\u0026 Lumbini Tour \\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Kathmandu Durbar Square, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath, Bhaktapur, Patan, Pokhara (sunrise tour at Sarangkot, Cave, Waterfalls, boating, temple), Lumbini (A birth place of Lord Buddha)\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"Hotel with all category depends on your budget and interest\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"This 7-day guided sightseeing tour of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/cultural-scenic-tour-kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-lumbini/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, Patan, Bhaktapur, Pokhara \\\\u0026amp; \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lumbini\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eLumbini\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e with an experienced English-speaking guide and driver. Lumbini, the birthplace of Gautam Buddha, and Pokhara, a city of beautiful lakes \\\\u0026amp; mountain views tours include major historical, cultural, and religious landmarks with delightful scenery. Explore world heritage sites, caves, lakes, eye-catching Himalayas views with sunrise, Maya Devi temple, and monasteries including the scenic drive.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eOutline Itinerary\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square, Swoyambhunath, Pashupatinath\\\\r\\\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan \\\\u0026amp; Bhaktapur\\\\r\\\\nDay 03: Morning drive/flight to Pokhara overland journey\\\\r\\\\nDay 04: Morning to Sarankot \\\\u0026amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake\\\\r\\\\nDay 05: Drive to Lumbini birth place of Lord Buddha\\\\r\\\\nDay 06: Tour of Lumbini interesting places\\\\r\\\\nDay 07: Drive/flight back to Kathmandu by overland\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"766\\",\\"4331\\",\\"4303\\",\\"3931\\",\\"529\\",\\"4342\\",\\"4282\\",\\"4283\\",\\"4293\\",\\"4306\\",\\"733\\",\\"558\\",\\"768\\",\\"4825\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"5-6 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning 9 a.m. departure from the hotel for guided sightseeing tour of historical and cultural tour with delightful scenery around Kathmandu city with Everest Vacation, a short ride to \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eKathmandu Durbar Square\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, visit of places with old history and rich culture of old king’s durbar square and Hanuman Dhoka (palace) visit of ancient Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu name derived from) this temple built of wood from a single tree, tour of Kumari Goddess (living virgin goddess) Kumari a very young girl, after teenage years phase replaced by another young Kumari, from here a short drive to west of the city at Swayambhunath Stupa located on a hill top, with panorama view of Kathmandu city, surrounding green hills with snow capped mountains in the north.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThis old Stupa of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eSwayambhunath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, the oldest historical monument listed as World Heritage Sites with over 2, 5000 years old Buddhist religion area with huge dome shape stupa overlooking four cardinal eyes of Buddha around North, South, East and West directions. Here visiting monastery and chapels, Sywambhunath is guarded with lovely woodland with a many monkeys around, this place is also named as “Monkey Temple”.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here another tour leads to \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eTemple\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, where non Hindu are not permitted inside the main temple entrance, where visitors can have a look of the temple surrounding from above the Bagmati river, this famous Shiva temple decorated with golden tier roofs with silver doors around each corner, this place close to green woodland with lots of monkeys around. Pashupatinath is full of pilgrims in special day on Shiva Ratri (birth anniversary of lord Shiva).\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNearby on the side of the river funeral and cremation are held for all Hindus, from here return back to your hotels at leisure for the rest of afternoon.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"02\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Patan \\\\u0026 Bhaktapur Sightseeing\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"4-5 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Starting the morning with a short drive towards Patan city located south of Kathmandu at mere distance across the bridge, on reaching Patan also known as Lalitpur meaning “city of arts” visit the old Palace complex, courtyard (Durbar) with tall terracotta palace, impressive window carvings, and a tall Krishna Temple with Garuda pillar, a vehicle of Lord Vishnu and Lord Krishna, from here a pleasant ride to valley 03rd biggest city, this old looking city at one time Nepal capital during Malla period in 12th to 15th century.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nBhaktapur famous for arts and crafts like woodcarving and pottery, tour of unique Durbar Square with golden gate of 55 windows palace, interesting wooden peacock window, continue tour of Bhaktapur visiting another Durbar Square with famed Nytapola Temple, Bhaktapur National Art Gallery, and Bhairavnath Temple.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a lovely and interesting day return back to hotel with afternoon free at leisure.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"03\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Morning drive/flight to Pokhara\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"822m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"5-6 hrs drive / 30 minute flight\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning depart from the hotel for a scenic and interesting drive towards Nepal’s and Himalayan countries most scenic and touristic spot of Pokhara with its serene lakes, drive leads past Kathmandu valley towards warmer area passing by farm villages, towns with distant views of snow capped mountains, after a good interesting drive reaching at Pokhara, and transfer to respective hotels by the lake Phewa with afternoon free at leisure\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"04\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Morning to Sarangkot \\\\u0026 Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1600m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"At Pokhara tour begins early morning with a short drive to a hill side at Sarankot for stunning sunrise view over array of snow capped mountains from world’s 7th highest Mt. Dhaulagiri 8,167 m, 10th highest Mt. Annapurna 8,091 m and 8th highest Mt. Manaslu 8,163 m including range of smaller peaks with ever present majestic Mt. Machhapuchhre “Fish Tail” standing high at 6,993 meters.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nSarankot hill top the tallest spot at 1, 460 meters with super views of mountains, Pokhara green valley and its city with Phewa Lake below, beside the fabulous panorama famous for paragliding which is one of the most popular adventure sports around this scenic place, after a tremendous panorama views back to hotel for breakfast and tour of Bhare Temple located in the middle of the lake in peaceful environment, boating for an hour and back to hotel.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfternoon local tour of David’s fall or Pathelo Chhango a huge volume of waterfalls (depending upon the season) and visit the nearby Gupteshwor Cave a deep cave where Seti River flows with torrent speed, this cave with lord Shiva temple, after a great moment transfer back to hotel with rest of the afternoon and evening at leisure.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days\\":\\"05\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Drive to Lumbini, birth place of Lord Buddha\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"150m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"6-7 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"After an enjoyable time at Pokhara with grand views of Annapurna, Manaslu range with Mt. Machhapuchhre, Everest Vacation next historical tour leads with an interesting drive towards south west at lower country of Nepal passing nice farm villages and towns of Butwal and Bhairawa and then reaching at Rupendehi in Lumbini the famous holy Buddhist place and world heritage site, here transfer to nice hotels close to birth place of lord Buddha the ‘Light of Asia’.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days\\":\\"06\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Lumbini interesting places\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"150m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"5-6 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning our guide will receive for an interesting historical tour of Lumbini, the main attraction at Lumbini, sacred garden spread over 8 sq. km with ancient valuable artifacts and treasures of this historic area.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMayadevi temple is the main attraction for pilgrims and archeologists alike, to the south of the temple a sacred pond – Puskarni – where Queen Mayadevi took a bath just before giving birth to Siddhartha Gautama Buddha. There are more than fifty monasteries around the area, visit of different monasteries from different Buddhist schools, Chinese monastery, Japanese monastery, Korean monastery, Tibetan monastery, Thai monastery, Sri Lanka after a grand tour retire back to hotel.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days\\":\\"07\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Drive/flight back to Kathmandu\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\" 7-8 hrs drive / 1 hour flight\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv id=\\\\u0022collapse-7\\\\u0022 class=\\\\u0022panel-collapse collapse show\\\\u0022 role=\\\\u0022tabpanel\\\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\\\u0022heading-7\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a grand time in this historical and religious place of Lumbini, morning drive leads past many farm fields, villages and towns with views of snow capped mountain along the drive, on reaching at Mugling town follow the Trisuli river upstream for a while and then uphill leaving the warm low area to reach Kathmandu valley, in Kathmandu rest of the afternoon free at leisure for individual activities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":7,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll taxes, fees and handling charges\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate Driver \\\\u0026amp; Guide\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHotel pickup and drop-off\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate Tour\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking water\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransport by private AC car\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-exclude\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's not included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-testimonial-lists\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ba53af63ade\\",\\"starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"Traveler's Reviews\\",\\"_starter_kit_testimonial_title\\":\\"field_63ba53af6b053\\",\\"review_number_of_post\\":\\"2\\",\\"_review_number_of_post\\":\\"field_63ba542aa9a32\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-information {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-information\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec90a5664e4\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc6695edb31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"Extended Tours\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_title\\":\\"field_63ec91180462f\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/helicopter-tour-to-everest-base-camp/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eHelicopter Tour to Everest Base Camp\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-5 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/mountain-flight-with-view-of-mt-everest/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eMountain Flight over Mt. Everest Area\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 1 hour\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-trekking/easy-hiking/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eShort 1 Day Hiking around Kathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4-6 hours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/2-days-kathmandu-city-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu, Bhaktapur \\\\u0026amp; Patan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 2 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/4-days-kathmandu-nagarkot-hill-tour/\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu Valley with Nagarkot Sunrise/Sunset Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e - 4 days\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_information_description\\":\\"field_63ec913e04630\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":1,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec90a574f02\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "descriptions": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"6 nights 7 days Kathmandu Valley with Pokhara \\\\u0026 Lumbini Tour \\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Kathmandu Durbar Square, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath, Bhaktapur, Patan, Pokhara (sunrise tour at Sarangkot, Cave, Waterfalls, boating, temple), Lumbini (A birth place of Lord Buddha)\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"Any Season\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"Hotel with all category depends on your budget and interest\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"Private AC Vehicle\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"This 7-day guided sightseeing tour of \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/cultural-scenic-tour-kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-lumbini/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e, Patan, Bhaktapur, Pokhara \\\\u0026amp; \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lumbini\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eLumbini\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e with an experienced English-speaking guide and driver. Lumbini, the birthplace of Gautam Buddha, and Pokhara, a city of beautiful lakes \\\\u0026amp; mountain views tours include major historical, cultural, and religious landmarks with delightful scenery. Explore world heritage sites, caves, lakes, eye-catching Himalayas views with sunrise, Maya Devi temple, and monasteries including the scenic drive.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003ch3\\\\u003eOutline Itinerary\\\\u003c/h3\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\nDay 01: Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square, Swoyambhunath, Pashupatinath\\\\r\\\\nDay 02: Tour of Patan \\\\u0026amp; Bhaktapur\\\\r\\\\nDay 03: Morning drive/flight to Pokhara overland journey\\\\r\\\\nDay 04: Morning to Sarankot \\\\u0026amp; Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake\\\\r\\\\nDay 05: Drive to Lumbini birth place of Lord Buddha\\\\r\\\\nDay 06: Tour of Lumbini interesting places\\\\r\\\\nDay 07: Drive/flight back to Kathmandu by overland\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec891287214\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4c3116dd8\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"Photo/Visual Gallery\\",\\"_ws_trip_galleries_title\\":\\"field_63ec89128acaa\\",\\"ws_trip_galleries\\":[\\"766\\",\\"4331\\",\\"4303\\",\\"3931\\",\\"529\\",\\"4342\\",\\"4282\\",\\"4283\\",\\"4293\\",\\"4306\\",\\"733\\",\\"558\\",\\"768\\",\\"4825\\"],\\"_ws_trip_galleries\\":\\"field_63ec89128e6ea\\",\\"ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_video_widgets\\":\\"field_63eef38026ee6\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-detailed-itineray\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec9456589bf\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc666fbd79e\\",\\"starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"Day by Day Activities\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_title\\":\\"field_63ec948c94a16\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"01\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Kathmandu Durbar Square Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"5-6 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning 9 a.m. departure from the hotel for guided sightseeing tour of historical and cultural tour with delightful scenery around Kathmandu city with Everest Vacation, a short ride to \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eKathmandu Durbar Square\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, visit of places with old history and rich culture of old king’s durbar square and Hanuman Dhoka (palace) visit of ancient Kastamandap Temple (where Kathmandu name derived from) this temple built of wood from a single tree, tour of Kumari Goddess (living virgin goddess) Kumari a very young girl, after teenage years phase replaced by another young Kumari, from here a short drive to west of the city at Swayambhunath Stupa located on a hill top, with panorama view of Kathmandu city, surrounding green hills with snow capped mountains in the north.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nThis old Stupa of \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eSwayambhunath\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, the oldest historical monument listed as World Heritage Sites with over 2, 5000 years old Buddhist religion area with huge dome shape stupa overlooking four cardinal eyes of Buddha around North, South, East and West directions. Here visiting monastery and chapels, Sywambhunath is guarded with lovely woodland with a many monkeys around, this place is also named as “Monkey Temple”.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFrom here another tour leads to \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003ePashupatinath \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eTemple\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e, where non Hindu are not permitted inside the main temple entrance, where visitors can have a look of the temple surrounding from above the Bagmati river, this famous Shiva temple decorated with golden tier roofs with silver doors around each corner, this place close to green woodland with lots of monkeys around. Pashupatinath is full of pilgrims in special day on Shiva Ratri (birth anniversary of lord Shiva).\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nNearby on the side of the river funeral and cremation are held for all Hindus, from here return back to your hotels at leisure for the rest of afternoon.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"02\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Patan \\\\u0026 Bhaktapur Sightseeing\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"4-5 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Starting the morning with a short drive towards Patan city located south of Kathmandu at mere distance across the bridge, on reaching Patan also known as Lalitpur meaning “city of arts” visit the old Palace complex, courtyard (Durbar) with tall terracotta palace, impressive window carvings, and a tall Krishna Temple with Garuda pillar, a vehicle of Lord Vishnu and Lord Krishna, from here a pleasant ride to valley 03rd biggest city, this old looking city at one time Nepal capital during Malla period in 12th to 15th century.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nBhaktapur famous for arts and crafts like woodcarving and pottery, tour of unique Durbar Square with golden gate of 55 windows palace, interesting wooden peacock window, continue tour of Bhaktapur visiting another Durbar Square with famed Nytapola Temple, Bhaktapur National Art Gallery, and Bhairavnath Temple.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a lovely and interesting day return back to hotel with afternoon free at leisure.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"03\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Morning drive/flight to Pokhara\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"822m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"5-6 hrs drive / 30 minute flight\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning depart from the hotel for a scenic and interesting drive towards Nepal’s and Himalayan countries most scenic and touristic spot of Pokhara with its serene lakes, drive leads past Kathmandu valley towards warmer area passing by farm villages, towns with distant views of snow capped mountains, after a good interesting drive reaching at Pokhara, and transfer to respective hotels by the lake Phewa with afternoon free at leisure\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"04\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Morning to Sarangkot \\\\u0026 Paragliding and boating at Phewa Lake.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1600m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"At Pokhara tour begins early morning with a short drive to a hill side at Sarankot for stunning sunrise view over array of snow capped mountains from world’s 7th highest Mt. Dhaulagiri 8,167 m, 10th highest Mt. Annapurna 8,091 m and 8th highest Mt. Manaslu 8,163 m including range of smaller peaks with ever present majestic Mt. Machhapuchhre “Fish Tail” standing high at 6,993 meters.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nSarankot hill top the tallest spot at 1, 460 meters with super views of mountains, Pokhara green valley and its city with Phewa Lake below, beside the fabulous panorama famous for paragliding which is one of the most popular adventure sports around this scenic place, after a tremendous panorama views back to hotel for breakfast and tour of Bhare Temple located in the middle of the lake in peaceful environment, boating for an hour and back to hotel.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfternoon local tour of David’s fall or Pathelo Chhango a huge volume of waterfalls (depending upon the season) and visit the nearby Gupteshwor Cave a deep cave where Seti River flows with torrent speed, this cave with lord Shiva temple, after a great moment transfer back to hotel with rest of the afternoon and evening at leisure.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days\\":\\"05\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Drive to Lumbini, birth place of Lord Buddha\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"150m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"6-7 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"After an enjoyable time at Pokhara with grand views of Annapurna, Manaslu range with Mt. Machhapuchhre, Everest Vacation next historical tour leads with an interesting drive towards south west at lower country of Nepal passing nice farm villages and towns of Butwal and Bhairawa and then reaching at Rupendehi in Lumbini the famous holy Buddhist place and world heritage site, here transfer to nice hotels close to birth place of lord Buddha the ‘Light of Asia’.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days\\":\\"06\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Tour of Lumbini interesting places\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"150m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"5-6 hrs\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026 Dinner\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Morning our guide will receive for an interesting historical tour of Lumbini, the main attraction at Lumbini, sacred garden spread over 8 sq. km with ancient valuable artifacts and treasures of this historic area.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nMayadevi temple is the main attraction for pilgrims and archeologists alike, to the south of the temple a sacred pond – Puskarni – where Queen Mayadevi took a bath just before giving birth to Siddhartha Gautama Buddha. There are more than fifty monasteries around the area, visit of different monasteries from different Buddhist schools, Chinese monastery, Japanese monastery, Korean monastery, Tibetan monastery, Thai monastery, Sri Lanka after a grand tour retire back to hotel.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days\\":\\"07\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Drive/flight back to Kathmandu\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"1400m\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\" 7-8 hrs drive / 1 hour flight\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"Breakfast\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cdiv id=\\\\u0022collapse-7\\\\u0022 class=\\\\u0022panel-collapse collapse show\\\\u0022 role=\\\\u0022tabpanel\\\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\\\u0022heading-7\\\\u0022\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAfter a grand time in this historical and religious place of Lumbini, morning drive leads past many farm fields, villages and towns with views of snow capped mountain along the drive, on reaching at Mugling town follow the Trisuli river upstream for a while and then uphill leaving the warm low area to reach Kathmandu valley, in Kathmandu rest of the afternoon free at leisure for individual activities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/div\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":7,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"What's included?\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll taxes, fees and handling charges\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate Driver \\\\u0026amp; Guide\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHotel pickup and drop-off\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate Tour\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eDrinking water\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransport by private AC car\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\