 \\t<li>Boudhanath ( A large Buddhist Stupa)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pashupatinath (Largest Hindu Temple having an open cremation area)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Kathmandu, we will manage the tour in next day (before flight to Bhutan)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight to Pokhara</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around lakeside.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit/tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning drive to Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunrise view from Himalayas</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Pokhara valley</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Phewa Lake boating</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Davis Falls</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>International Mountain Museum</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bindhyabasini Temple</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight back to Kathmandu and then Bhaktapur</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tour of Bhaktapur Durbar Square</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Kathmandu.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<div id=\\"collapse-4\\" class=\\"panel-collapse collapse show\\" role=\\"tabpanel\\" aria-labelledby=\\"heading-4\\">Overnight at Kathmandu</div>", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop to Kathmandu airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Paro airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Memorial Chorten (temple)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changangkha Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Statue of Buddha</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Weekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Punakha crossing over Dochu La Pass (3100 meters)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Dochu La Pass (views of the highest mountain peaks &amp; walk around the 108 stupas)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through the paddy field and old village to visit Chhimi Lhakhang, the temple of fertility.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Khamsum Yuley Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Paro (base for the hike)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Airport Bird's Eye View Point, Paro</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Paro", "ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Bhutan Nepal Tour 7 nights 8 days | Everest Vacation", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Including Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Chitwan \\\\u0026 Pokhara | Thimphu, Punakha \\\\u0026 Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePhenomenal Sunrise View from Sarangkot\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePokhara Sightseeing (Lakeside View, Davis Fall, Phewa Lake Boating, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eCherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePunakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"Buddhist Stupas, local History of and culture ,Local lifestyle\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_accommodation\\":\\"field_63eeee62072dd\\",\\"ws_block_transportation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_transportation\\":\\"field_63eeee74072de\\",\\"ws_block_start_end\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_start_end\\":\\"field_63eeee8b072df\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Overview\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour 7 nights 8 days (4 nights in Nepal and 3 nights in Bhutan)\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWe take care of your Visa of Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathmandu\\\\u0022 target=\\\\u0022_blank\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener\\\\u0022\\\\u003eKathmandu\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e (TIA) airport.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nA tailor-made and flexible \\\\u003ca href=\\\\u0022https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-8-nights-9-days/\\\\u0022\\\\u003eNepal Bhutan Tour\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e  7 nights 8 days package developed by Everest Vacation is perfect for travel fanatics. This tour includes historical and cultural sightseeing of iconic landmarks with natural scenery. Nepal visit includes Kathmandu sightseeing with a tour of marvelous UNESCO Heritage Sites. A short scenic flight to Pokhara, the tourist capital is breathtaking with beautiful mountain views. Pokhara sightseeing with a hike to Sarangkot and witnessing the sunrise view is mesmerizing.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nBhutan, also popular as ‘The Last Shangri-La’ tour takes you to iconic landmarks including ancient Dzongs \\\\u0026amp; Fortresses, sacred Lhakhang \\\\u0026amp; temples, and a vibrant weekend market. A panoramic mountain vista from Dochu La Pass is mesmerizing. The beautiful scenic landscapes, amazing valley views, and walking on uneven trails are great experiences while hiking to the spiritually significant Tiger’s Nest Monastery. Travelers can experience great joy and create some best memories in these beautiful Himalayan nations.\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-galleries {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-galleries\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_k