es, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa", "Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan", "Breakfast in Nepal", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Bhutan Travel Permit and Visa", "Bhutan Government sustainable development fee (SDF) USD 100 per person per night.", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private cultural English-speaking tour guide (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) in Bhutan", "Breakfast in Nepal", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight ticket (Kathmandu/Bangkok/New Delhi/Kolkata/Singapore/Dhaka/Singapore to Paro(Bhutan))"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Day by Day Activities", "sub_description": "4 nights in Kathmandu and Pokhara, 3 nights in Bhutan", "trip_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Phenomenal Sunrise View from Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pokhara Sightseeing (Lakeside View, Davis Fall, Phewa Lake Boating, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit stunning landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc. in Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Cherish the fabulous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham Sum Yuley Lhakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and enjoy the traditional Archery game in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the popular Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "Bhutan Nepal Tour 7 nights 8 days is an amazing cultural and natural tours for visitors spending 3 nights in Bhutan and 4 nights in Nepal.", "trip_attractions": "Buddhist Stupas, local History of and culture ,Local lifestyle", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "Buddhist Stupas, local History of and culture ,Local lifestyle", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Including Kathmandu, Bhaktapur, Patan, Chitwan & Pokhara | Thimphu, Punakha & Paro with Taktsang Monastery Hike"}	2024-01-12 06:53:00+00	2026-01-20 05:40:05+00
240	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "4 nights Kathmandu & Pokhara, 4 nights Bhutan ", "ws_dulux_price": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "9", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "5", "_edit_lock": "1723967889:5", "_dp_original": "3718", "_thumbnail_id": "4398", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "4 nights Kathmandu & Pokhara, 4 nights Bhutan ", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_dulux_price": "", "_ws_dulux_price": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "9", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_focuskw": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 8 nights 9 days", "_yoast_wpseo_linkdex": "44", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 8 nights 9 days takes visitors to UNESCO listed Heritages in Nepal and Bhutan including wonderful natural landmarks.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:4:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";i:2;s:7:\\"reviews\\";i:3;s:4:\\"faqs\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "nepal-bhutan-tour-8-nights-9-days", "tags": [], "title": "Nepal Bhutan Tour 8 nights 9 days", "duration": "9 Days", "overview": {"title": "Why Travel With Us?", "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li><strong>Nepal Bhutan Tour 8 nights 9 days (4 nights in Nepal and 4 nights in Bhutan)</strong></li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Travel Route (Bhutan and then Nepal also possible), Flexible monuments to visit, Flexible number of nights in both countries.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>We take care of your Visa of Bhutan and internal flights. A Nepal visa is easily available upon your arrival at <a href=\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathmandu\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Kathmandu</a> (TIA) airport.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n&nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n<a href=\\"https://everestnepaltours.com/nepal-bhutan-tour-7-nights-8-days/\\">Nepal Bhutan Tour</a>  8 nights 9 days is a flexible and customizable package designed by Everest Vacation for travel lovers around the globe. Visit the UNESCO Heritage sites in Kathmandu and Bhaktapur, which are uniquely stunning and hold great historical and cultural significance. A short flight to the tourist capital of Pokhara is scenic with beautiful mountain views. A hike to Sarangkot and witnessing the sunrise view is mesmerizing along with sightseeing beautiful places in Pokhara.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Bhutan and visit gorgeous landmarks in Paro, Punakha, and Thimphu. Explore ancient Dzongs, the giant Great Buddha Dordenma, a beautiful old Paro town, beautiful Punakha Dzong, and the popular Chhimi Lhakhang temple. Tiger’s Nest Monastery hike in Paro offers beautiful surrounding views and a deep spiritual awakening after visiting the sacred monastery. In these beautiful nations, travelers are sure to have a great time and can create remarkable memories."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Arrival in Kathmandu and Kathmandu Sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Kathmandu (TIA) airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Boudhanath ( A large Buddhist Stupa)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pashupatinath (Largest Hindu Temple having an open cremation area)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Kathmandu, we will manage the tour in next day (before flight to Bhutan)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "driveTime": "Approx, 30 minutes drive from airport to hotel.", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 2, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Drive/Flight to Pokhara and Relax around lakeside", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight to Pokhara</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Walking Tour around lakeside.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "driveTime": "Approx, 30 minutes flight or 6 hours drive from Kathmandu to Pokhara.", "elevation": "822m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 3, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Sarangkot Sunrise and Pokhara Sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit/tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Early morning drive to Sarangkot</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunrise view from Himalayas</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Pokhara valley</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Phewa Lake boating</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Davis Falls</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>International Mountain Museum</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bindhyabasini Temple</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Pokhara", "driveTime": "Approx, 30 minutes drive to Sarangkot hill from Pokhara valley.", "elevation": "1600m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 4, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Drive/flight to Kathmandu and Bhaktapur Tour", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive/flight back to Kathmandu and then Bhaktapur</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tour of Bhaktapur Durbar Square</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive back to Kathmandu.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Kathmandu", "driveTime": "Approx, 30 minutes flight or 6 hours drive to Kathmandu from Pokhara.", "elevation": "1400m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 5, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Fly Kathmandu to Paro(Bhutan), drive to Thimphu and Thimphu sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop to Kathmandu airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pickup from Paro airport</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Thimphu</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Memorial Chorten (temple)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Changangkha Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Statue of Buddha</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the fortress of Thimphu, Tashichho Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Weekend market (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>If you arrive lately in Paro, we will manage the tour in next day morning.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Thimphu", "driveTime": "Approx, 1 hour 30 minutes drive from Paro to Thimphu.", "elevation": "2200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Drive to Punakha and Punakha Sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Punakha crossing over Dochu La Pass (3100 mts)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Dochu La Pass (views of the highest mountain peaks &amp; walk around the 108 stupas)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through the paddy field and old village to visit Chhimi Lhakhang, the temple of fertility.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Dzong</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Khamsum Yuley Lhakhang</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Punakha", "driveTime": "Approx, 2 hours 30 minutes drive from Thimphu to Punakha", "elevation": "1200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Drive to Paro and Paro Sightseeing", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to Paro after breakfast</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Paro Dzong (Fortress)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Old Paro Town</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Could get some opportunity to see the traditional game, Archery.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Paro", "driveTime": "Approx, 4 hours drive from Punakha to Paro", "elevation": "2200m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 8, "meal": "Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner", "title": "Hike to Taktsang Monastery and visit Kichu Lakhang", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drive to base for the hike</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Place to visit / Tour\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to Taktsang Monastery (Tiger’s Nest) – 3 hours uphill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kyichu Lhakhang, one of the oldest temples in Bhutan</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\nOvernight at Paro", "driveTime": "Approx, 20 minutes drive from Paro town to base camp of hike", "elevation": "1950m", "accommodation": "3star to Luxury hotels"}, {"day": 9, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Final Departure / Tour end", "richText": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Drop you to Paro airport from your hotel</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Return with some magnificent memories and moments from Nepal and Bhutan trip.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flight available from Paro to Kathmandu, Bangkok, New Delhi, Kolkata, Bagdogra, Singapore, Dhaka etc.</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/dochulapass-bhutan.jpg", "title": "dochulapass-bhutan", "altText": "Dochu La Pass, Bhutan Thimpbu", "caption": "Dochu La Pass, Bhutan Thimpbu", "variants": {}}, "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_trip_galleries": ["613", "611", "527", "609", "4281", "4287", "766", "4439", "4440", "4435", "4444"], "_ws_trip_galleries": "field_63ec89128e6ea", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "", "ws_block_best_season": "", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "review_number_of_post": "-1", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "What's included?", "_review_number_of_post": "field_63ba542aa9a32", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_