</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>A perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Accompanied by experienced local guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Comfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Technical Climbing is not involved during the trip</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "overview-3", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Why Travel With Us?", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan.", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan.", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Sample Itinerary (Customizable)", "sub_description": "Explore Tibet and Bhutan Tour Package with Everest Vacation.", "trip_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>UNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Holy Barkhor Street and Spiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the holy Drepung and Sera Monasteries</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Thimphu Excursion (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Relish the wonderful views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and Kyichu Lhakhang in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the renowned Tiger’s Nest (Taktsang) Monastery</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu sightseeing including UNESCO World Heritage Sites (optional)</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "trip_type_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "meta_description": "Remarkable journey with the Tibet Bhutan Tour Package 2025/2026. Customize your itinerary for an unforgettable adventure in the Himalayas.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Tour Highlights"}	2024-05-04 12:33:04+01	2024-11-18 11:10:34+00
274	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "13", "child_select_quick_link": "a:2:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": ""}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "1", "_edit_lock": "1731927781:1", "_dp_original": "5246", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "13", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Tibet with Everest Base Camp & Bhutan Tour package 2025/2026", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Tibet & Bhutan tour focusing Himalayan landscapes, iconic cultural landmarks like the Potala Palace, Everest Base Camp & Tiger's Nest Monastery.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:2:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "0"}, "slug": "tibet-with-everest-base-camp-and-bhutan-tour", "tags": [], "title": "Tibet with Everest Base Camp and Bhutan Tour", "duration": "13 Days", "overview": {"title": "Why Travel With Us?", "description": "A 13-day Tibet with Everest Base Camp and Bhutan Tour is an amazing tour package. This tour takes visitors close to Everest Base Camp and an overland tour to Kathmandu from Tibet offers scenic adventure to the visitors. Relish the scenic Himalayas during a flight to Lhasa (Tibet). Explore UNESCO-listed Potala Palace, Barkhor Street, etc., and other numerous monasteries (Tashilhunpo, Drepung, Sakya, etc.). The freshwater Yamdrok Lake excursion is magical. Enjoy the northern face of Mt. Everest from one of the world’s highest-elevated Rongbuk Monastery.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Bhutan to explore culturally and naturally stunning landmarks in Paro, Punakha, and Thimphu. Visit ancient Dzongs and Lhakhangs, the Great Buddha Dordenma, the Bhutan Postal Museum, the Memorial Chorten, and the well-known Chhimi Lhakhang temple. A hike to Tiger’s Nest Monastery is fruitful rewarding visitors with deep spiritual insights. Also, try Bhutanese cuisine and interact with friendly locals and monks. Create lovely memories during these Tibet and Bhutan tours."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Arrival in Lhasa (Tibet)", "richText": "Welcome in Lhasa (Tibet) airport and transfer to Lhasa city. Rest today for high-altitude acclimatization (Altitude: 3650m).\\r\\n\\r\\n<em> * France, Germany, Italy, the Netherlands, Spain, Malaysia, Austria, Belgium, Hungary, Ireland, Luxembourg, Switzerland, Poland, New Zealand and Australia and Singapore citizens can enter China without Chinese visa upto December 31, 2026. Except these nationalities, they must bring China visa from their country.\\r\\n</em><em>* Collect the Tibet Travel permit from to the airport or hotel of Beijing/Chengdu/or other china mainland city.</em><em>\\r\\n* Tibet Travel permit (hard copy) is requiring to fly Tibet.\\r\\n</em><strong><em>Driving Distance to Lhasa from airport:</em> </strong>2 hours", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 2, "meal": "", "title": "Lhasa Sightseeing tour", "richText": "- Potala Palace\\r\\n- Jokhang Temple\\r\\n- Barkhor Street", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 3, "meal": "", "title": "Continue Sightseeing tour Lhasa", "richText": "- Sera monastery\\r\\n- Drepung monastery\\r\\n- Norbulinca temple", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 4, "meal": "", "title": "Lhasa - Gyantse (3950m) -Shigatse (3900m) via Yamdrok Lake", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 5, "meal": "", "title": "Drive Shigatse to Shegar (Rongbuk Monastery / Everest Base Camp)", "richText": "<em>Recommend you to stay Shegar instead of Rongbuk's tent. The accommodation is very weak at Rongbuk. You have to go early morning in the next day to see the sunrise view of Mt. Everest from Gywola pass and continue drive to Rongbuk Monastery / Everest base camp to see the close view of Mt. Everest.</em>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 6, "meal": "", "title": "Shegar - Rongbuk Monastery / Everest base camp – Gyirung (Kerung)", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 7, "meal": "", "title": "Kerung/Gyirong to Kathmandu, Nepal", "richText": "*Apply Nepal visa at border of Nepal (on-arrival basis)<em>\\r\\n</em>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 8, "meal": "", "title": "Kathmandu Sightseeing (It is optional, you can skip this day if you want)", "richText": "- Pashupatinath Temple\\r\\n- Boudhanath Stupa\\r\\n- Patan Durbar Square and Museum", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 9, "meal": "", "title": "Flight from Kathmandu to Paro(Bhutan) and Thimphu Sightseeing", "richText": "Flight time: <em>9:10am (Kathmandu) - 10:30 am (Paro)\\r\\n</em>- Airport drop to Kathmandu and pickup from Paro airport.\\r\\n- Drive to Thimphu\\r\\n<strong>- Thimphu Sightseeing </strong>\\r\\n- Tachogang Lhakhang,\\r\\n- Visit Buddha Dordenma,\\r\\n- Bhutan Postal Museum, Memorial Chorten\\r\\n<strong>Distance: </strong>1:15 hours flight &amp; 1.30 hours’ drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 10, "meal": "", "title": "Punakha Sightseeing", "richText": "Drive from Thimphu to Punakha via Dochu La Pass\\r\\n- Dochula Pass\\r\\n- Punakha Dzong\\r\\n- Suspension Bridge\\r\\n- Chimi Lhakhang, Temple of fertility\\r\\n<strong>Distance:</strong> 2.5 hours drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 11, "meal": "", "title": "Punakha to Paro", "richText": "After breakfast, drive back to Paro and<strong> Paro valley tour.</strong>\\r\\n<strong>Distance</strong>: 3-4 hours drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 12, "meal": "", "title": "Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest) Hike/Trek", "richText": "Drive to hiking base point.\\r\\n- Hike to Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest)\\r\\n- Visit Kyichu Lhakhang and back to hotel.\\r\\n<strong>Distance: </strong>4-6 hours hike depend on you.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 13, "meal": "", "title": "Final departure from Paro, Bhutan", "richText": "- Drop you at Paro airport before 3 hours of your flight time as per airport rule.\\r\\n<em>*Flights available from Paro to Bangkok or New Delhi or Kathmandu or Dhaka or Singapore</em>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": "", "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "", "ws_block_best_season": "", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "starter_kit_hchi_link": "", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "Cost Inclusion ", "_starter_kit_hchi_link": "field_5f34d7a643459", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_hchi_image": 5732, "starter_kit_hchi_title": "", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-light", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Why Travel With Us?", "_starter_kit_hchi_image": "field_5f34d6be2ee12", "_starter_kit_hchi_title": "field_5f34d6be2585d", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc4e9c19160", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>UNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Holy Barkhor Street and Spiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the holy Drepung and Sera Monasteries</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Shigatse &amp; Gyantse Sightseeing (Tashilhunpo Monastery, Shigatse Dzong, Sakya Monastery, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Rongbuk Monastery-One of the highest-elevated Monastery in the world</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Iconic Northern Everest Base Camp and view of the north face of Mt. Everest</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Thimphu Excursion (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Relish the wonderful views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and Kyichu Lhakhang in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the prominent Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "ws_trip_information_list": 13, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec94565c587", "starter_kit_section_title": "Sample Itinerary (Customizable)", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "starter_kit_hchi_sub_title": "", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "_starter_kit_hchi_sub_title": "field_63b6eb486b39a", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tibet Travel Permit</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private vehicle with air conditioning</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Breakfast in Tibet</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All meals (Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner) in Bhutan.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Monuments entrance/admission fees</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) &amp; government taxes.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "starter_kit_hchi_description": "A 13-day Tibet with Everest Base Camp and Bhutan Tour is an amazing tour package. This tour takes visitors close to Everest Base Camp and an overland tour to Kathmandu from Tibet offers scenic adventure to the visitors. Relish the scenic Himalayas during a flight to Lhasa (Tibet). Explore UNESCO-listed Potala Palace, Barkhor Street, etc., and other numerous monasteries (Tashilhunpo, Drepung, Sakya, etc.). The freshwater Yamdrok Lake excursion is magical. Enjoy the northern face of Mt. Everest from one of the world’s highest-elevated Rongbuk Monastery.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Bhutan to explore culturally and naturally stunning landmarks in Paro, Punakha, and Thimphu. Visit ancient Dzongs and Lhakhangs, the Great Buddha Dordenma, the Bhutan Postal Museum, the Memorial Chorten, and the well-known Chhimi Lhakhang temple. A hike to Tiger’s Nest Monastery is fruitful rewarding visitors with deep spiritual insights. Also, try Bhutanese cuisine and interact with friendly locals and monks. Create lovely memories during these Tibet and Bhutan tours.", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_hchi_description": "field_5f34d6be2ee97", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "Tour Highlights", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "starter_kit_hchi_image_position": "right", "starter_kit_hchi_search_section": "no", "_starter_kit_hchi_image_position": "field_5f34d6be2581e", "_starter_kit_hchi_search_section": "field_65718c92967af", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "04", "ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days": "05