03eDistance:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e 2.5 hours drive\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_10_di_days\\":\\"11\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Punakha to Paro \\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"After breakfast, drive back to Paro and\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003e Paro valley tour.\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eDistance\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e: 3-4 hours drive\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_di_days\\":\\"12\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest) Hike/Trek\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Drive to hiking base point.\\\\r\\\\n- Hike to Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest)\\\\r\\\\n- Visit Kyichu Lhakhang and back to hotel.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eDistance: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e4-6 hours hike depend on you.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_12_di_days\\":\\"13\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_12_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Final departure from Paro, Bhutan\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"- Drop you at Paro airport before 3 hours of your flight time as per airport rule.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e*Flights available from Paro to Bangkok or New Delhi or Kathmandu or Dhaka or Singapore\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list\\":13,\\"_ws_trip_information_list\\":\\"field_63ec94565c587\\",\\"ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_title\\":\\"field_63ec94c094a17\\",\\"ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_flash_message_text\\":\\"field_63ec950194a18\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-include-exclude {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-include-exclude\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edd6a330794\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc651ee1073\\",\\"ws_select_content_type\\":\\"ws-included\\",\\"_ws_select_content_type\\":\\"field_63edd755e9729\\",\\"ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"Cost Inclusion \\",\\"_ws_trip_include_title\\":\\"field_63edd6a334286\\",\\"ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cblockquote\\\\u003eWe are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e(\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNote:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/blockquote\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTibet Travel Permit\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate vehicle with air conditioning\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePrivate English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBreakfast in Tibet\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll meals (Breakfast, Lunch \\\\u0026amp; Dinner) in Bhutan.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAll accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eMonuments entrance/admission fees\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eGuide and driver’s meals and accommodation\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eService Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) \\\\u0026amp; government taxes.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHandle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_include_description\\":\\"field_63edd6a337cd0\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Outdoor Extra Activities\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHiking:\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eRiver rafting: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eThrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal  on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eYoga and meditation: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003ePractice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eHelicopter tours: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eExciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eNational Park Tour: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003eWildlife Jungle Safari in a jeep or elephant to explore the region’s rich biodiversity, witness diverse flora and fauna, and get close to nature\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Bhutan-Tibet Tour: Is It Right for You?\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eA perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSuitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAccompanied by experienced local guides\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eComfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTechnical Climbing is not involved during the trip\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHike through forested trails which is medium.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eAn experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTransfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-overview {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-overview\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec8086435ad\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-light\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63fc4e9c19160\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"Why Travel With Us?\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_title\\":\\"field_63ec808647048\\",\\"ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003e24/7 International Support\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eFlexible Private and Customize Trips\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSafety: Our Topmost Priority\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSecure Online Payment\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eBookings and Payments Flexibility\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eLifetime Deposit Guaranteed\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eGuaranteed Departures\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTravel with Locals to support locals\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eExperienced Team and Expert Guides\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eRespect Nature through Responsible Tourism\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHappiness and Best Priced Assured\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_overview_description\\":\\"field_63ec83089dd8e\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-quick-enquiry\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7635c\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"Ask to Expert about this trip\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_title\\":\\"field_63edeb1c7d769\\",\\"ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"Fill the form below for your interest.\\\\r\\\\n\\",\\"_ws_quick_enquiry_desc\\":\\"field_63edeb1c811ab\\",\\"ws_gf_id\\":\\"4\\",\\"_ws_gf_id\\":\\"field_63edec7318284\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->", "imageGallary": [], "importSource": {"guid": "https://everestnepaltours.com/?post_type=trip&#038;p=5263", "system": "wordpress", "parentId": 0, "postType": "trip", "wpPostId": "5263", "wpSiteUrl": "https://everestnepaltours.com", "postStatus": "publish", "tablePrefix": "wev_", "wpContentDir": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content", "sourceTimestamps": {"post_date": "2024-05-07 09:00:46", "post_date_gmt": "2024-05-07 09:00:46", "post_modified": "2024-11-18 11:02:45", "post_modified_gmt": "2024-11-18 11:02:45"}}, "overviewImage": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Sunrise-from-Gawu-La-Pass-Tibet.jpg", "customSections": [{"id": "overview-1", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Outdoor Extra Activities", "content": ["Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Hiking:</strong> Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>River rafting: </strong>Thrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal  on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Yoga and meditation: </strong>Practice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Helicopter tours: </strong>Exciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>National Park Tour: </strong>Wildlife Jungle Safari in a jeep or elephant to explore the region’s rich biodiversity, witness diverse flora and fauna, and get close to nature"], "description": "Not only historical, cultural, and natural tours embark on an adventurous journey through our outdoor extra activities. Some of our popular outdoor activities to carry out during this tour are as follows:\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Hiking:</strong> Short scenic hikes take you closer to nature and offer picturesque views\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>River rafting: </strong>Thrilling White Water River rafting in Nepal  on rapid rivers relishing scenic landscapes\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Yoga and meditation: </strong>Practice Yoga and Meditation in serene places such as a monastery, yoga centers, or in the vicinity of nature\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Helicopter tours: </strong>Exciting helicopter tours to the iconic Everest Base Camp in Nepal and get close-up views of the Himalayas and admire its beauty in Bhutan\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>National Park Tour: </strong>Wildlife Jungle Safari in a jeep or elephant to explore the region’s rich biodiversity, witness diverse flora and fauna, and get close to nature"}, {"id": "overview-2", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Bhutan-Tibet Tour: Is It Right for You?", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>A perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Accompanied by experienced local guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Comfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Technical Climbing is not involved during the trip</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>A perfect combination tour of history, culture, and nature</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Suitable for all age groups of travelers (Senior citizens to Kids)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Accompanied by experienced local guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Comfortable flat trails while sightseeing Heritage Sites</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Technical Climbing is not involved during the trip</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike through forested trails which is medium.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>An experienced guide accompanies you to ensure a comfortable Taktsang Monastery Hike. Pony rides to the halfway are also available.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Transfer via clean private vehicles that are comfortable during sightseeing tours</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "overview-3", "type": "paragraph", "title": "Why Travel With Us?", "content": ["<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"], "description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>"}, {"id": "included-list", "note": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan.", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan.", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Sample Itinerary (Customizable)", "sub_description": "Explore Tibet with Everest Base Camp and Bhutan Tour with Everest Vacation.", "trip_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>UNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Holy Barkhor Street and Spiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the holy Drepung and Sera Monasteries</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Shigatse &amp; Gyantse Sightseeing (Tashilhunpo Monastery, Shigatse Dzong, Sakya Monastery, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Rongbuk Monastery-One of the highest-elevated Monastery in the world</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Iconic Northern Everest Base Camp and view of the north face of Mt. Everest</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Thimphu Excursion (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Relish the wonderful views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and Kyichu Lhakhang in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the prominent Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "trip_type_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "meta_description": "Tibet & Bhutan tour focusing Himalayan landscapes, iconic cultural landmarks like the Potala Palace, Everest Base Camp & Tiger's Nest Monastery.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Tour Highlights"}	2024-05-07 10:00:46+01	2024-11-18 11:02:45+00
275	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "15", "child_select_quick_link": "a:2:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": ""}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "1", "_edit_lock": "1731922297:1", "_dp_original": "5246", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "15", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Bhutan and Tibet Combined Tour Package 2025/2026, Book Now!", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Experience the enchanting beauty of Bhutan and Tibet with our combined tour package. Book your adventure for 2025 and 2026!", "child_select_quick_link": "a:2:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "0"}, "slug": "bhutan-and-tibet-combined-tour-package", "tags": [], "title": "Bhutan and Tibet Combined Tour Package", "duration": "15 Days", "overview": {"title": "Why Travel With Us?", "description": "A 15-day Bhutan and Tibet combined tour package is a great deal for visitors seeking to explore these magical Buddhist destinations. Fly to Bhutan and explore the incredible cities of Paro, Thimphu, Phobjikha, and Punakha. Admire the wonderful mountain views from Dochu La Pass. The natural trail tour at Phobjikha connects closely to nature. An excursion to landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Paro Dzong, Kyichu Lhakhang, etc. is impressive. Tiger’s Nest Hike in Paro is tiring yet rewarding offering a deep meaningful insight to the visitors.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Tibet, the famed Roof of the World via Kathmandu. Tibetan Buddhism is highly influenced and thus, the region is culturally rich. Sightsee Lhasa, Shigatse, and Gyantse where you explore the UNESCO Heritage sites, and several monasteries, and immerse in local culture. Don’t miss visiting Tibet’s first Samye Monastery and historic Yumbu Lhakhang Palace. A visit to the holy Yamdrok Tso Lake provides a profound connection to nature."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Flight to Paro(Bhutan), drive to Thimphu and Thimphu Sightseeing", "richText": "<em>Flights arriving time at Paro(Bhutan) from <strong>Kathmandu</strong>: 10:30 am\\r\\n<strong>Approx. flight time to Bhutan:</strong>\\r\\nFlights arriving time at Paro(Bhutan) from <strong>Bangkok</strong>: 15:15 pm or 16:35 pm\\r\\nFlights arriving time at Paro(Bhutan) from <strong>New Delhi</strong>: 15:20 pm\\r\\nFlights arriving time at Paro(Bhutan) from <strong>Kathmandu</strong>: 10:20 am\\r\\nFlights arriving time at Paro(Bhutan) from <strong>Dhaka</strong>: 10:40 am\\r\\nFlights arriving time at Paro(Bhutan) from <strong>Singapore</strong>: 16:45 pm\\r\\n*Above timing based on Druk air schedule.</em>\\r\\n\\r\\n- welcome to Bhutan. Pickup from Paro airport and drive to Thimphu\\r\\n<strong>- Thimphu Sightseeing </strong><em>(*If time does not allow, we will do it the next day)</em>\\r\\n- Tachogang Lhakhang,\\r\\n- Visit Buddha Dordenma,\\r\\n- Bhutan Postal Museum, Memorial Chorten\\r\\n<strong>Driving Distance: </strong>1.30 hours’ drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 2, "meal": "", "title": "Punakha Sightseeing", "richText": "Drive from Thimphu to Punakha via Dochu La Pass\\r\\n- Dochula Pass\\r\\n- Punakha Dzong\\r\\n- Suspension Bridge\\r\\n- Chimi Lhakhang, Temple of fertility\\r\\n<strong>Distance:</strong> 2.5 hours drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 3, "meal": "", "title": "Drive to Pobhjikha and Pobhjikha tour", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 4, "meal": "", "title": "Pobhjikha to Paro", "richText": "After breakfast, drive back to Paro and<strong> Paro valley tour.</strong>\\r\\n<strong>Distance</strong>: 5 hours drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 5, "meal": "", "title": "Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest) Hike/Trek", "richText": "Drive to hiking base point.\\r\\n- Hike to Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest)\\r\\n- Visit Kyichu Lhakhang and back to hotel.\\r\\n<strong>Distance: </strong>4-6 hours hike depend on you.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 6, "meal": "", "title": "Flight from Paro, Bhutan to Kathmandu, Nepal - Kathmandu Sightseeing", "richText": "- Drop you at Paro airport before 3 hours of your flight time as per airport rule.\\r\\n\\r\\nWelcome in Kathmandu. Our guide and driver will meet you outside of airport and drop you to your hotel.  After refreshment, start Kathmandu sightseeing\\r\\n- Pashupatinath Temple\\r\\n- Boudhanath Stupa\\r\\n- Patan Durbar Square and Museum\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong>Arrival in Kathmandu - 8:10am.\\r\\n</strong><em>* Paro to Kathmandu direct flight available on daily 1 flight.\\r\\n* There are no any flight/land connection between Tibet and Bhutan, so must stay at least 1 overnight at Kathmandu, Nepal. Flight schedule doesn't match (or risky if available) same day 2 flights from Lhasa to Kathmandu and Kathmandu to Paro as well.</em>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 7, "meal": "", "title": "Flight from Kathmandu to Chengdu (Mainland city of China)", "richText": "<em> * France, Germany, Italy, the Netherlands, Spain, Malaysia, Austria, Belgium, Hungary, Ireland, Luxembourg, Switzerland, Poland, New Zealand and Australia and Singapore citizens can enter China without Chinese visa upto December 31, 2026. <strong>Except these nationalities, they must bring China visa from their country</strong>.<strong> Instead of it, you have to stay 4 nights in Kathmandu to get Tibet Group visa and during that time, you will have chance to visit Kathmandu and other cities as well. </strong>\\r\\n</em><em>* Collect the Tibet Travel permit from us at the hotel of Beijing/Chengdu/or other china mainland city. Or direct flight to Lhasa (Tibet) from Kathmandu if available; as of now only 3 flights per week.</em><em>\\r\\n* Tibet Travel permit (hard copy) is requiring to fly Tibet.</em>\\r\\n\\r\\nOvernight at Chengdu.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 8, "meal": "", "title": "Chengdu (China mainland) to Tsedang (Tibet)", "richText": "Welcome in Lhasa (Tibet) airport and transfer to Tsedang city. Rest today for high-altitude acclimatization. (Tsedang Altitude: 3100m)", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 9, "meal": "", "title": "Visit Samye Monstaery and Afternoon Visit Yumbu Lhakang .", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 10, "meal": "", "title": "Drive Tsetang to Gyantse Via Lake Yamdrok Lake", "richText": "Visit Kunbum monastery, Pelkhor Stupa at Gyantse", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 11, "meal": "", "title": "Drive Gyantse drive to Shigatse", "richText": "Visit Tashilhunpo Monastery and surrounding.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 12, "meal": "", "title": "Drive Shigatse to Lhasa", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 13, "meal": "", "title": "Lhasa Sightseeing tour", "richText": "- Potala Palace\\r\\n- Jokhang Temple\\r\\n- Barkhor Street", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 14, "meal": "", "title": "Continue Sightseeing tour Lhasa", "richText": "- Sera monastery\\r\\n- Drepung monastery\\r\\n- Norbulinca temple", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 15, "meal": "", "title": "Transfer to airport and fly to your home or next destination via China mainland city", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": "", "acf_blocks": {"ws_gf_id": "4", "_ws_gf_id": "field_63edec7318284", "ws_block_meals": "", "_ws_block_meals": "field_63eeee4e072dc", "ws_block_start_end": "", "_ws_block_start_end": "field_63eeee8b072df", "ws_block_attractions": "", "ws_block_best_season": "", "_ws_block_attractions": "field_63eeee1f072da", "_ws_block_best_season": "field_63eeee37072db", "starter_kit_hchi_link": "", "ws_block_trip_grading": "", "ws_flash_message_text": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "Fill the form below for your interest.\\r\\n", "ws_trip_include_title": "Cost Inclusion ", "_starter_kit_hchi_link": "field_5f34d7a643459", "_ws_block_trip_grading": "field_63ec73a6a4716", "_ws_flash_message_text": "field_63ec950194a18", "_ws_quick_enquiry_desc": "field_63edeb1c811ab", "_ws_trip_include_title": "field_63edd6a334286", "starter_kit_hchi_image": 5750, "starter_kit_hchi_title": "", "starter_kit_section_bg": "bg-light", "ws_block_accommodation": "", "ws_block_max_elevation": "", "ws_flash_message_title": "", "ws_quick_enquiry_title": "Ask to Expert about this trip", "ws_select_content_type": "ws-included", "ws_trip_overview_title": "Why Travel With Us?", "_starter_kit_hchi_image": "field_5f34d6be2ee12", "_starter_kit_hchi_title": "field_5f34d6be2585d", "_starter_kit_section_bg": "field_63fc4e9c19160", "_ws_block_accommodation": "field_63eeee62072dd", "_ws_block_max_elevation": "field_63eeee07072d9", "_ws_flash_message_title": "field_63ec94c094a17", "_ws_quick_enquiry_title": "field_63edeb1c7d769", "_ws_select_content_type": "field_63edd755e9729", "_ws_trip_overview_title": "field_63ec808647048", "ws_block_transportation": "", "_ws_block_transportation": "field_63eeee74072de", "starter_kit_padding_type": "p-medium", "ws_trip_block_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Thimphu Sightseeing (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Buddha Dordenma, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Relish the superb views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Natural Trail at Phobjikha valley</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and Kyichu Lhakhang in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the prominent Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Tibet’s first monastery-Samye and historic Yumbu Lhakhang Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Shigatse &amp; Gyantse Sightseeing (Gyantse Kumbum, Pelkor Chöde Monastery, Tashilhunpo Monastery)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>UNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Holy Barkhor Street and Spiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the holy Drepung and Sera Monasteries</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "ws_trip_information_list": 15, "_starter_kit_padding_type": "field_5f8584c998bc2", "_ws_trip_block_highlights": "field_63ec73a6a0d8f", "_ws_trip_information_list": "field_63ec94565c587", "starter_kit_section_title": "Sample Itinerary (Customizable)", "_starter_kit_section_title": "field_63ec948c94a16", "starter_kit_enable_section": "1", "starter_kit_hchi_sub_title": "", "_starter_kit_enable_section": "field_63edeb1c7635c", "_starter_kit_hchi_sub_title": "field_63b6eb486b39a", "starter_kit_section_padding": "", "ws_trip_include_description": "<blockquote>We are dedicated to providing quality service to our clients where safety is our topmost priority. We have not mentioned our costs as they depend on factors like trip customization, group sizes, travel season, trip duration, and types of accommodation, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tibet Travel Permit</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal (It takes 4 working days with your original passport)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private vehicle with air conditioning</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Breakfast in Tibet</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All meals (Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner) in Bhutan.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Monuments entrance/admission fees</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) &amp; government taxes.</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_section_padding": "field_5f3e0f86a2634", "_ws_trip_include_description": "field_63edd6a337cd0", "starter_kit_hchi_description": "A 15-day Bhutan and Tibet combined tour package is a great deal for visitors seeking to explore these magical Buddhist destinations. Fly to Bhutan and explore the incredible cities of Paro, Thimphu, Phobjikha, and Punakha. Admire the wonderful mountain views from Dochu La Pass. The natural trail tour at Phobjikha connects closely to nature. An excursion to landmarks such as Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Great Buddha Dordenma, Chhimi Lhakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Paro Dzong, Kyichu Lhakhang, etc. is impressive. Tiger’s Nest Hike in Paro is tiring yet rewarding offering a deep meaningful insight to the visitors.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Tibet, the famed Roof of the World via Kathmandu. Tibetan Buddhism is highly influenced and thus, the region is culturally rich. Sightsee Lhasa, Shigatse, and Gyantse where you explore the UNESCO Heritage sites, and several monasteries, and immerse in local culture. Don’t miss visiting Tibet’s first Samye Monastery and historic Yumbu Lhakhang Palace. A visit to the holy Yamdrok Tso Lake provides a profound connection to nature.", "ws_trip_overview_description": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>24/7 International Support</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Flexible Private and Customize Trips</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Safety: Our Topmost Priority</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Secure Online Payment</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Bookings and Payments Flexibility</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Lifetime Deposit Guaranteed</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Guaranteed Departures</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Travel with Locals to support locals</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Experienced Team and Expert Guides</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Respect Nature through Responsible Tourism</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Happiness and Best Priced Assured</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "_starter_kit_hchi_description": "field_5f34d6be2ee97", "_ws_trip_overview_description": "field_63ec83089dd8e", "ws_trip_fact_short_description": "Tour Highlights", "_ws_trip_fact_short_description": "field_63ec73a69d305", "starter_kit_hchi_image_position": "right", "starter_kit_hchi_search_section": "no", "_starter_kit_hchi_image_position": "field_5f34d6be2581e", "_starter_kit_hchi_search_section": "field_65718c92967af", "ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "01", "ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "02", "ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "03", "ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "04", "ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days": "05", "ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days": "06", "ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days": "07", "ws_trip_information_list_7_di_days": "08", "ws_trip_information_list_8_di_days": "09", "ws_trip_information_list_9_di_days": "10", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days": "field_63ec958b8c799", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days": "field_63e