ry_description\\":\\"Drive to hiking base point.\\\\r\\\\n- Hike to Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest)\\\\r\\\\n- Visit Kyichu Lhakhang and back to hotel.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eDistance: \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e4-6 hours hike depend on you.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days\\":\\"06\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Flight from Paro, Bhutan to Kathmandu, Nepal - Kathmandu Sightseeing\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"- Drop you at Paro airport before 3 hours of your flight time as per airport rule.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nWelcome in Kathmandu. Our guide and driver will meet you outside of airport and drop you to your hotel.  After refreshment, start Kathmandu sightseeing\\\\r\\\\n- Pashupatinath Temple\\\\r\\\\n- Boudhanath Stupa\\\\r\\\\n- Patan Durbar Square and Museum\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eArrival in Kathmandu - 8:10am.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e* Paro to Kathmandu direct flight available on daily 1 flight.\\\\r\\\\n* There are no any flight/land connection between Tibet and Bhutan, so must stay at least 1 overnight at Kathmandu, Nepal. Flight schedule doesn't match (or risky if available) same day 2 flights from Lhasa to Kathmandu and Kathmandu to Paro as well.\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days\\":\\"07\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Flight from Kathmandu to Chengdu (Mainland city of China)\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e * France, Germany, Italy, the Netherlands, Spain, Malaysia, Austria, Belgium, Hungary, Ireland, Luxembourg, Switzerland, Poland, New Zealand and Australia and Singapore citizens can enter China without Chinese visa upto December 31, 2026. \\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003eExcept these nationalities, they must bring China visa from their country\\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e.\\\\u003cstrong\\\\u003e Instead of it, you have to stay 4 nights in Kathmandu to get Tibet Group visa and during that time, you will have chance to visit Kathmandu and other cities as well. \\\\u003c/strong\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e* Collect the Tibet Travel permit from us at the hotel of Beijing/Chengdu/or other china mainland city. Or direct flight to Lhasa (Tibet) from Kathmandu if available; as of now only 3 flights per week.\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\u003cem\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n* Tibet Travel permit (hard copy) is requiring to fly Tibet.\\\\u003c/em\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nOvernight at Chengdu.\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_7_di_days\\":\\"08\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_7_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Chengdu (China mainland) to Tsedang (Tibet)\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878df\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_hotel\\":\\"field_63ec96e3878e0\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_food\\":\\"field_63ec96f1878e1\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"Welcome in Lhasa (Tibet) airport and transfer to Tsedang city. Rest today for high-altitude acclimatization. (Tsedang Altitude: 3100m)\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description\\":\\"field_63ec9456679f6\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_8_di_days\\":\\"09\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_8_di_days\\":\\"field_63ec958b8c799\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"Visit Samye Monstaery and Afternoon Visit Yumbu Lhakang .\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_title\\":\\"field_63ec945663e31\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_Elevation\\":\\"field_63ec967a59e99\\",\\"ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_duration\\":\\"field_63ec96a0878d