tion, meals, transportation, and choice of various activities.\\r\\n<em>(<strong>Note:</strong> On your request, we can send you cost details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal (It takes 4 working days with your original passport)", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan.", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal (It takes 4 working days with your original passport)", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan.", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Tibet and Bhutan"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Sample Itinerary (Customizable)", "sub_description": "Explore Bhutan and Tibet Combined Tour Package with Everest Vacation.", "trip_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Thimphu Sightseeing (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Buddha Dordenma, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Relish the superb views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Natural Trail at Phobjikha valley</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Paro Dzong (Fortress), Old Paro Town, and Kyichu Lhakhang in Paro</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Hike to the prominent Tiger’s Nest Monastery</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit Tibet’s first monastery-Samye and historic Yumbu Lhakhang Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Shigatse &amp; Gyantse Sightseeing (Gyantse Kumbum, Pelkor Chöde Monastery, Tashilhunpo Monastery)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>UNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Holy Barkhor Street and Spiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the holy Drepung and Sera Monasteries</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "trip_type_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "meta_description": "Experience the enchanting beauty of Bhutan and Tibet with our combined tour package. Book your adventure for 2025 and 2026!", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Tour Highlights"}	2024-05-07 11:53:01+01	2024-11-18 06:59:40+00
277	{"acf": {"ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "6 nights in Kathmandu/Pokhara, 4 nights in Thimphu/Punakha/Paro, 7 nights in Lhasa, Rongbuk/EBC, Gyantse, Shigatse", "ws_regular_price": "", "ws_number_of_days": "18", "child_select_quick_link": "a:2:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";}", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour"}, "meta": {"_edit_last": "1", "_edit_lock": "1750073798:1", "_dp_original": "5263", "_thumbnail_id": "5734", "ws_sale_price": "", "ws_short_desc": "6 nights in Kathmandu/Pokhara, 4 nights in Thimphu/Punakha/Paro, 7 nights in Lhasa, Rongbuk/EBC, Gyantse, Shigatse", "_ws_sale_price": "field_63ec6cbabf59a", "_ws_short_desc": "field_64bcfed7ea657", "ws_regular_price": "", "_ws_regular_price": "field_63ec6b81bf599", "ws_number_of_days": "18", "_ws_number_of_days": "field_63ec6d011465f", "_yoast_wpseo_title": "Nepal, Bhutan, Tibet Overland Tour with Everest Base Camp 2025", "_yoast_wpseo_metadesc": "Nepal, Bhutan, and Tibet with Everest Base Camp exploring majestic Himalayan landscapes, ancient monasteries, and vibrant cultures.", "child_select_quick_link": "a:2:{i:0;s:8:\\"overview\\";i:1;s:9:\\"itinerary\\";}", "_child_select_quick_link": "field_643ed174633ee", "ws_trips_difficulty_level": "Private Tour", "_ws_trips_difficulty_level": "field_63ec7097385a5", "_yoast_wpseo_content_score": "90", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_activity": "", "_yoast_wpseo_primary_destination": "", "_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp": "", "_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes": "1"}, "slug": "nepal-bhutan-tibet-overland-ebc-tour", "tags": [], "title": "Nepal, Bhutan, Tibet Overland EBC Tour", "duration": "18 Days", "overview": {"title": "Why Travel With Us?", "description": "The Nepal Bhutan Tibet Overland EBC Tour is a complete package that offers travelers a diverse experience in 3 distinct destinations. Nepal tour pleases visitors with UNESCO Heritage sites and local markets in Kathmandu. The tourist capital Pokhara amazes visitors with its beautiful landmarks with captivating sunrise view at Sarangkot.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Bhutan and visit elegant landmarks in Bhutan’s primary cities: Paro, Punakha, and Thimphu. The ancient Dzongs, divine Lhakhangs, Great Buddha Dordenma statue, and a hike to the prominent Tiger’s Nest Monastery impress everyone. A pleasant and rewarding feeling to witness the fabulous mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass.\\r\\n\\r\\nFly to Tibet and explore several incredible attractions in Lhasa and Shigatse. Explore the UNESCO-listed Potala Palace, Norbulingka Palace, Barkhor Street, and Jokhang Temple. A visit to sacred Drepung and Sera Monasteries along with an excursion to serene Yamdrok Lake is delightful. Drive to Kathmandu via Tibet Overland. The Tibet Overland tour allows visitors to get close to the world’s highest elevated Rongbuk Monastery. The sunrise view near Everest Base Camp over majestic Everest is heavenly. The tour is a perfect fusion of nature and culture highlighting the importance of these majestic places."}, "taxonomy": {}, "itinerary": [{"day": 1, "meal": "", "title": "Arrival in Kathmandu and transfer to your hotel.", "richText": "Airport transfer, collect your original passport and photographs and request to fill up Tibet group visa form.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 2, "meal": "", "title": "Kathmandu Tour", "richText": "Apply Tibet visa and Tour continue: Boudhanath Stupa, Pashupatinath Temple, Patan Durbar Square.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 3, "meal": "", "title": "Kathmandu to Pokhara", "richText": "Flight/drive to Pokhara and Phewa lake boating, enjoy around lakeside.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 4, "meal": "", "title": "Pokhara Tour", "richText": "Activities: Sarangkot sunrise tour, Bindabasini Temple, Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave, Davis Fall, Mountain Museum.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 5, "meal": "", "title": "Pokhara– Kathmandu", "richText": "Flight/drive to Kathmandu, leisure time / shopping time if you prefer. Collect Tibet visa today.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 6, "meal": "", "title": "Flight from Kathmandu to Paro(Bhutan) and Thimphu Sightseeing", "richText": "Flight time: <em>9:10am (Kathmandu) - 10:30 am (Paro)\\r\\n</em>- Airport drop to Kathmandu and pickup from Paro airport.\\r\\n- Drive to Thimphu\\r\\n<strong>- Thimphu Sightseeing </strong>\\r\\n- Tachogang Lhakhang,\\r\\n- Visit Buddha Dordenma,\\r\\n- Bhutan Postal Museum, Memorial Chorten\\r\\n<strong>Distance: </strong>1:15 hours flight &amp; 1.30 hours’ drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 7, "meal": "", "title": "Punakha Sightseeing", "richText": "Drive from Thimphu to Punakha via Dochu La Pass\\r\\n- Dochula Pass\\r\\n- Punakha Dzong\\r\\n- Suspension Bridge\\r\\n- Chimi Lhakhang, Temple of fertility\\r\\n<strong>Distance:</strong> 2.5 hours drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 8, "meal": "", "title": "Punakha to Paro", "richText": "After breakfast, drive back to Paro and<strong> Paro valley tour.</strong>\\r\\n<strong>Distance</strong>: 3-4 hours drive", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 9, "meal": "", "title": "Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest) Hike/Trek", "richText": "Drive to hiking base point.\\r\\n- Hike to Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest)\\r\\n- Visit Kyichu Lhakhang and back to hotel.\\r\\n<strong>Distance: </strong>4-6 hours hike depend on you.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 10, "meal": "", "title": "Flight from Paro, Bhutan to Kathmandu.", "richText": "- Drop you at Paro airport before 3 hours of your flight time as per airport rule. Pickup from Kathmandu airport.\\r\\n- Rest day or Shopping day or if you prefer, we will provide light hiking.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 11, "meal": "", "title": "Flight from Kathmandu to Lhasa and transfer to Lhasa city (Tibet)", "richText": "Welcome in Lhasa (Tibet) airport and transfer to Lhasa city. Rest today for high-altitude acclimatization (Altitude: 3650m).\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong><em>Driving Distance to Lhasa from airport:</em> </strong>2 hours", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 12, "meal": "", "title": "Lhasa Sightseeing tour", "richText": "- Potala Palace\\r\\n- Jokhang Temple\\r\\n- Barkhor Street", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 13, "meal": "", "title": "Continue Sightseeing tour Lhasa", "richText": "- Sera monastery\\r\\n- Drepung monastery\\r\\n- Norbulinca temple", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 14, "meal": "", "title": "Lhasa - Gyantse (3950m) -Shigatse (3900m) via Yamdrok Lake", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 15, "meal": "", "title": "Drive Shigatse to Shegar (Rongbuk Monastery / Everest Base Camp)", "richText": "<em>Recommend you to stay Shegar instead of Rongbuk's tent. The accommodation is very weak at Rongbuk. You have to go early morning in the next day to see the sunrise view of Mt. Everest from Guwa La Pass and continue drive to Rongbuk Monastery / Everest base camp to see the close view of Mt. Everest.</em>", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 16, "meal": "", "title": "Shegar - Rongbuk Monastery / Everest base camp – Gyirung (Kerung)", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 17, "meal": "", "title": "Kerung/Gyirong to Kathmandu, Nepal", "richText": "", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}, {"day": 18, "meal": "", "title": "Final departure from Kathmandu, Nepal", "richText": "Good bye from Kathmandu with lots of experiences and happiness.", "driveTime": "", "elevation": "", "accommodation": ""}], "mainImage": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Mo