bet group visa form.", "ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "Apply Tibet visa and Tour continue: Boudhanath Stupa, Pashupatinath Temple, Patan Durbar Square.", "ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "Flight/drive to Pokhara and Phewa lake boating, enjoy around lakeside.", "ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "Activities: Sarangkot sunrise tour, Bindabasini Temple, Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave, Davis Fall, Mountain Museum.", "ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "Flight/drive to Kathmandu, leisure time / shopping time if you prefer. Collect Tibet visa today.", "ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "Flight time: <em>9:10am (Kathmandu) - 10:30 am (Paro)\\r\\n</em>- Airport drop to Kathmandu and pickup from Paro airport.\\r\\n- Drive to Thimphu\\r\\n<strong>- Thimphu Sightseeing </strong>\\r\\n- Tachogang Lhakhang,\\r\\n- Visit Buddha Dordenma,\\r\\n- Bhutan Postal Museum, Memorial Chorten\\r\\n<strong>Distance: </strong>1:15 hours flight &amp; 1.30 hours’ drive", "ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "Drive from Thimphu to Punakha via Dochu La Pass\\r\\n- Dochula Pass\\r\\n- Punakha Dzong\\r\\n- Suspension Bridge\\r\\n- Chimi Lhakhang, Temple of fertility\\r\\n<strong>Distance:</strong> 2.5 hours drive", "ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "After breakfast, drive back to Paro and<strong> Paro valley tour.</strong>\\r\\n<strong>Distance</strong>: 3-4 hours drive", "ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "Drive to hiking base point.\\r\\n- Hike to Taktsang Lhakhang (Tiger’s Nest)\\r\\n- Visit Kyichu Lhakhang and back to hotel.\\r\\n<strong>Distance: </strong>4-6 hours hike depend on you.", "ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "- Drop you at Paro airport before 3 hours of your flight time as per airport rule. Pickup from Kathmandu airport.\\r\\n- Rest day or Shopping day or if you prefer, we will provide light hiking.", "_ws_trip_information_list_0_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_1_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_2_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_3_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_4_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_5_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_6_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_7_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_8_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_9_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "Welcome in Lhasa (Tibet) airport and transfer to Lhasa city. Rest today for high-altitude acclimatization (Altitude: 3650m).\\r\\n\\r\\n<strong><em>Driving Distance to Lhasa from airport:</em> </strong>2 hours", "ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description": "- Potala Palace\\r\\n- Jokhang Temple\\r\\n- Barkhor Street", "ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_description": "- Sera monastery\\r\\n- Drepung monastery\\r\\n- Norbulinca temple", "ws_trip_information_list_13_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_14_ws_itinerary_description": "<em>Recommend you to stay Shegar instead of Rongbuk's tent. The accommodation is very weak at Rongbuk. You have to go early morning in the next day to see the sunrise view of Mt. Everest from Guwa La Pass and continue drive to Rongbuk Monastery / Everest base camp to see the close view of Mt. Everest.</em>", "ws_trip_information_list_15_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_16_ws_itinerary_description": "", "ws_trip_information_list_17_ws_itinerary_description": "Good bye from Kathmandu with lots of experiences and happiness.", "_ws_trip_information_list_10_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_11_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_12_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_13_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_14_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_15_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_16_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6", "_ws_trip_information_list_17_ws_itinerary_description": "field_63ec9456679f6"}, "categoryId": null, "meta_title": "Nepal, Bhutan, Tibet Overland Tour with Everest Base Camp 2025", "blogContent": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-half-content-half-image {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-half-content-half-image\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2579c\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63f85ccfbbd7f\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_image_position\\":\\"right\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_image_position\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2581e\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_search_section\\":\\"no\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_search_section\\":\\"field_65718c92967af\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_image\\":5734,\\"_starter_kit_hchi_image\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2ee12\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_title\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2585d\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_sub_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_sub_title\\":\\"field_63b6eb486b39a\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_description\\":\\"The Nepal Bhutan Tibet Overland EBC Tour is a complete package that offers travelers a diverse experience in 3 distinct destinations. Nepal tour pleases visitors with UNESCO Heritage sites and local markets in Kathmandu. The tourist capital Pokhara amazes visitors with its beautiful landmarks with captivating sunrise view at Sarangkot.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFly to Bhutan and visit elegant landmarks in Bhutan’s primary cities: Paro, Punakha, and Thimphu. The ancient Dzongs, divine Lhakhangs, Great Buddha Dordenma statue, and a hike to the prominent Tiger’s Nest Monastery impress everyone. A pleasant and rewarding feeling to witness the fabulous mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nFly to Tibet and explore several incredible attractions in Lhasa and Shigatse. Explore the UNESCO-listed Potala Palace, Norbulingka Palace, Barkhor Street, and Jokhang Temple. A visit to sacred Drepung and Sera Monasteries along with an excursion to serene Yamdrok Lake is delightful. Drive to Kathmandu via Tibet Overland. The Tibet Overland tour allows visitors to get close to the world’s highest elevated Rongbuk Monastery. The sunrise view near Everest Base Camp over majestic Everest is heavenly. The tour is a perfect fusion of nature and culture highlighting the importance of these majestic places.\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_description\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2ee97\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_link\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_link\\":\\"field_5f34d7a643459\\",\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\"},\\"mode\\":\\"edit\\"} /-->\\n\\n<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-trip-fact {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-trip-fact\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_padding\\":\\"field_5f3e0f86a2634\\",\\"starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"p-medium\\",\\"_starter_kit_padding_type\\":\\"field_5f8584c998bc2\\",\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_63ec73a6998bb\\",\\"ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"Tour Highlights\\",\\"_ws_trip_fact_short_description\\":\\"field_63ec73a69d305\\",\\"ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"\\\\u003cul\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eKathmandu sightseeing (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePokhara Sightseeing (Phewa Lake Boating, Lakeside, Davis Fall, Mountain Museum, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eWonderful sunrise view over the mountains from Sarangkot hill\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eThimphu Sightseeing (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Buddha Dordenma, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003ePunakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eRelish the marvelous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eTiger’s Nest Monastery hike with Paro Sightseeing\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eUNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eHoly Barkhor Street and Spiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit the holy Drepung and Sera Monasteries\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eVisit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eShigatse \\\\u0026amp; Gyantse Sightseeing (Tashilhunpo Monastery, Sakya Monastery, etc.)\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n \\\\t\\\\u003cli\\\\u003eSunrise view with Mount Everest / Rongbuk Monastery\\\\u003c/li\\\\u003e\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003c/ul\\\\u003e\\",\\"_ws_trip_block_highlights\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a0d8f\\",\\"ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_trip_grading\\":\\"field_63ec73a6a4716\\",\\"ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_max_elevation\\":\\"field_63eeee07072d9\\",\\"ws_block_attractions\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_attractions\\":\\"field_63eeee1f072da\\",\\"ws_block_best_season\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_best_season\\":\\"field_63eeee37072db\\",\\"ws_block_meals\\":\\"\\",\\"_ws_block_meals\\":\\"field_63eeee4e072dc\\",\\"ws