 details. Feel free to contact us for further details.)</em></blockquote>", "type": "list", "title": "Cost Include", "content": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Nepalese guide for Nepal, English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Nepal and Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Nepal, Tibet and Bhutan"], "description": ""}], "cost_inclusions": {"permits": ["Tibet Travel Permit", "Tibet visa if you want to apply from Kathmandu, Nepal", "Private vehicle with air conditioning", "Private English-speaking Nepalese guide for Nepal, English-speaking Tibetan guide for Tibet and English-speaking Bhutanese guide for Bhutan (Other language guide also available upon your request with extra cost.)", "Breakfast in Nepal and Tibet", "All meals (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) in Bhutan", "All accommodation as per your choice (Luxury/5-star or 4-star hotel or 3-star hotel)", "Monuments entrance/admission fees", "Guide and driver’s meals and accommodation", "Service Charge (the planning, handling, operational and communication charges) & government taxes.", "Handle your flight or train tickets for Nepal, Tibet and Bhutan"], "services": []}, "itinerary_title": "Sample Itinerary (Customizable)", "sub_description": "6 nights in Kathmandu/Pokhara, 4 nights in Thimphu/Punakha/Paro, 7 nights in Lhasa, Rongbuk/EBC, Gyantse, Shigatse", "trip_highlights": "<ul>\\r\\n \\t<li>Kathmandu sightseeing (Durbar Squares, Boudhanath, Swayambhunath, Pashupatinath)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Pokhara Sightseeing (Phewa Lake Boating, Lakeside, Davis Fall, Mountain Museum, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Wonderful sunrise view over the mountains from Sarangkot hill</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Thimphu Sightseeing (Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, Buddha Dordenma, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Punakha Sightseeing (Chhimi Lakhang Temple, Punakha Dzong, Kham sum Yuley Lakhang)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Relish the marvelous views of mountain ranges from Dochu La Pass</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Tiger’s Nest Monastery hike with Paro Sightseeing</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>UNESCO-listed Norbulingka Palace and Royal Museum Potala Palace</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Holy Barkhor Street and Spiritual Buddhist Sacred Jokhang Temple</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the holy Drepung and Sera Monasteries</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Visit the freshwater sacred Yamdrok Tso Lake</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Shigatse &amp; Gyantse Sightseeing (Tashilhunpo Monastery, Sakya Monastery, etc.)</li>\\r\\n \\t<li>Sunrise view with Mount Everest / Rongbuk Monastery</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "trip_type_level": "Private Tour", "meta_description": "Nepal, Bhutan, and Tibet with Everest Base Camp exploring majestic Himalayan landscapes, ancient monasteries, and vibrant cultures.", "related_trip_facts": {"meals": "", "start_end": "", "attractions": "", "best_season": "", "accommodation": "", "max_elevation": "", "transportation": ""}, "trip_highlights_title": "Tour Highlights"}	2024-08-20 09:44:03+01	2025-06-16 12:36:20+01
