8	Selfi	Mexico	2019-04-25	\N	Outstanding service for a once in a lifetime	Our tour was packed with some unforgettable experiences. A bulk of the credits to the tour operators Everest Vacation. The knowledgeable guides and super-skillful drivers gave it all too. Everything ran smoothly with no complications. As a cultural tour, there were some personal inclusions too with their standard tour. I am grateful for being flexible to make these changes. For anyone planning a cultural tour of Asia, I recommend this company.	5.0	2023-11-30 09:20:46+00	2024-02-15 05:05:48+00	{239,272,132,135,164,208,209,210,211,214,215}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:11:{i:0;s:3:\\"510\\";i:1;s:3:\\"538\\";i:2;s:3:\\"930\\";i:3;s:3:\\"934\\";i:4;s:3:\\"931\\";i:5;s:3:\\"929\\";i:6;s:3:\\"938\\";i:7;s:4:\\"3719\\";i:8;s:3:\\"940\\";i:9;s:3:\\"743\\";i:10;s:4:\\"4836\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20190425", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Mexico", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Selfi"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/jungle-safari-chitwan.jpeg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "jungle safari by jeep, chitwan national park", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/jungle-safari-chitwan.jpeg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/jungle-safari-chitwan.jpeg", "title": "jungle safari chitwan", "altText": "jungle safari by jeep, chitwan national park", "caption": "jungle safari by jeep, chitwan national park", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/jungle-safari-chitwan.jpeg", "attachmentId": 4328}, "variants": {}}	0
23	Sheldon	Canada	2017-04-12	\N	Great tour!	My friend and I did a short tour of Bhutan from July 24-30 and it was wonderful. The guys at Everest vacation organized our tour well. With the quality of transport, hotels, and most importantly our lovely guide, this whole tour turned out to be excellent. I appreciated the itinerary made by the Everest Vacation team, nothing was rushed and each day had its highlights.\r\n\r\nWe have been traveling around the years for many years now. The professionalism shown by Netra, and the team was a delight for us. Bhutan is a sublime country and I would recommend anyone planning a tour there choose Everest vacation.	5.0	2023-09-02 03:58:22+01	2024-06-04 11:04:30+01	{219,220,221,222,223,205,213}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:7:{i:0;s:4:\\"3504\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3505\\";i:2;s:4:\\"3508\\";i:3;s:4:\\"3509\\";i:4;s:4:\\"3507\\";i:5;s:3:\\"937\\";i:6;s:3:\\"919\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20170412", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Canada", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Sheldon"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/piya-sheldon-500x667-1.jpeg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "piya-sheldon-500x667", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/piya-sheldon-500x667-1.jpeg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/piya-sheldon-500x667-1.jpeg", "title": "piya-sheldon-500x667", "altText": "piya-sheldon-500x667", "caption": "piya-sheldon-500x667", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/piya-sheldon-500x667-1.jpeg", "attachmentId": 591}, "variants": {}}	0
6	Paul Wang	Texas, USA	2025-09-27	Nepal, Bhutan, Tibet Tour Package	Exceptional Customized Tour Across Chengdu, Tibet, Nepal, and Bhutan	<p>I recently worked with Everest Vacation to plan a solo trip across multiple countries, and it was an outstanding experience. Netra (the owner) and his team designed a customized itinerary around my schedule in September and October, covering everything I wanted to see.</p><p>They flawlessly coordinated flights, hotels, guides, and transportation for my journey through Chengdu (China); Lhasa, Shigatse, and Mt. Everest Base Camp (Tibet); Kathmandu (Nepal); and Thimphu and Paro (Bhutan)—including all necessary permits and travel arrangements.</p><p>I was able to cross several bucket-list experiences off my list, such as visiting the Potala Palace, seeing Mount Everest, and hiking up to Tiger’s Nest Monastery.</p><p>Throughout the trip, Netra regularly checked in to ensure everything was going smoothly. The communication and attention to detail were exceptional.</p><p>While a tailor-made solo trip isn’t inexpensive, Everest Vacation’s pricing was more competitive than other operators I compared, and the quality of service was never compromised.</p><p>I definitely plan to return to Southeast Asia in the future—and I’ll be reaching out to Netra and his team again to organize my next adventure.</p>	5.0	2026-01-28 14:45:02.582+00	2026-01-28 14:45:07.991+00	{40}	{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/v1769611488/uploads/1769611487377-tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg.jpg", "title": "tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg", "altText": "", "mediaId": "42347c69-ccbf-4d31-ac94-63c331ef4c07", "variants": {"large": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_1200/v1769611488/uploads/1769611487377-tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg.jpg", "small": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_400/v1769611488/uploads/1769611487377-tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg.jpg", "medium": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_800/v1769611488/uploads/1769611487377-tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg.jpg", "thumbnail": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_150,h_150/v1769611488/uploads/1769611487377-tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg.jpg"}}	2
1	Marvin and Yves	Belgium	2025-08-25	Nepal, Bhutan, Tibet Tour Package	Incredible 21-Day Private Tour of Nepal, Tibet & Bhutan – Truly Unforgettable!	<p>We embarked on an amazing 21-day private tour from 23/10 to 14/11 with Netra from Everest Vacation. In the beginning, we were a little unsure since WhatsApp was the only mode of our communication from across the world. However, because of Netra’s professionalism, incredibly fast responses (almost 24/7!) and expertise, we were immediately at ease. He took care of literally everything – logistics, hotels, visas, permits, entrances, and internal flights – allowing us to enjoy a stress-free journey.</p><p>Our fully customized private tour of Nepal, Tibet and Bhutan exceeded all expectations. Some of the highlights included a short hike around Rongbuk Monastery near Tibet Everest Base Camp, the Potala Palace in Lhasa, Chitwan National Park, flights offering breathtaking Himalayan and Everest views, Bhutan’s Tiger’s Nest hike and Punakha and Thimpu,</p><p>Even though Travelling to Tibet with fewer than five people is usually not possible, Netra made it happen for us, allowing us to experience a private journey without having to share guides or transportation with strangers.</p><p>Each guide we had were outstanding – Rajan in Nepal, Nyima in Tibet and Sita in Bhutan. They were incredibly knowledgeable and friendly. Rajan, especially went above and beyond, customizing the trip to our interests and even showing us hidden roof terraces in Kathmandu that we never would have discovered on our own. We were assigned safe, punctual drivers who drove modern, clean vehicles. Accommodations were excellent, with Shangri-La in Lhasa and Hilton Shigatse ranking among the best ones we’ve ever experienced.</p><p>The knowledge and network of Netra are truly exceptional. He is familiar with all the guides, contacts, and operators, which guaranteed the top-quality service throughout our journey. The pricing of this high-end, fully customized trip, was far more reasonable than what a European operator would have charged for the same itinerary.</p><p>For anyone seeking a once-in-a-lifetime adventure, reach out to Netra on WhatsApp: +977 985-1053024. We 100% recommend him – he made our trip effortless, personalized, and absolutely unforgettable!</p>	5.0	2025-11-20 09:21:09.681+00	2026-01-28 14:45:07.991+00	{40}	{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/v1769611328/uploads/1769611327945-Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg.jpg", "title": "Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg", "altText": "", "mediaId": "e4f94aa5-c8e3-4a01-a71a-cd465c91e465", "variants": {"large": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_1200/v1769611328/uploads/1769611327945-Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg.jpg", "small": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_400/v1769611328/uploads/1769611327945-Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg.jpg", "medium": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_800/v1769611328/uploads/1769611327945-Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg.jpg", "thumbnail": "https://res.cloudinary.com/duj4t24c9/image/upload/c_limit,w_150,h_150/v1769611328/uploads/1769611327945-Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg.jpg"}}	1
9	Myrna & Johnny	Guam	2023-11-05	\N	Wonderful and amazing Nepal and Bhutan trip	Namaste Mr. Netra, yes we are back home in the Philippines and now well rested. We were so tired after a long hike to the Tiger’s nest and very proud of ourselves that we were able to go up and down that mountain. I can’t wait to tell you about our wonderful and amazing Nepal and Bhutan trip to my friends in Guam. Will surely recommend your company to them. This was different from our previous trip, more on scenic, cultural, historical and adventure trip. What really made it really ☺☺☺☺☺☺ it different was the nice camaraderie with our drivers and tour guides and, most especially, you checking us we are doing after our day-to-day tour. Thank you for that. I really appreciate the nice gestures. You, your staff and Bhutan staff made this trip wonderful for us. We won’t forget it.\r\n\r\nWe are actually planning to bring our daughter and her husband to Mt. Everest trek maybe up to 3k meters, then explore the Eastern side of Bhutan, but this time coming from India and see Taj Majal and other interesting sites. Very thankful I came across your company on the internet since there were a lot of tour sites to choose from. Love all the nice and comfortable hotels we stayed in. Please extend my regards to Raj, Surad, Dipak,Rinchen and Ram. Sorry I forgot the name of our driver in Pokhara. Thank you all so much, I will let you know about our Himalayan trip plans and, if my friends will be interested in going to any Himalayan countries are you will recommend your company for sure. Namaste🙏	5.0	2023-12-22 02:06:34+00	2024-09-29 11:38:00+01	{216,217,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,238,239,240,171,205,206,207,212,213,214,215}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:20:{i:0;s:4:\\"3505\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3508\\";i:2;s:4:\\"3504\\";i:3;s:4:\\"3507\\";i:4;s:4:\\"3509\\";i:5;s:3:\\"937\\";i:6;s:3:\\"938\\";i:7;s:4:\\"3512\\";i:8;s:4:\\"3510\\";i:9;s:3:\\"935\\";i:10;s:3:\\"919\\";i:11;s:3:\\"924\\";i:12;s:3:\\"925\\";i:13;s:4:\\"1057\\";i:14;s:4:\\"3719\\";i:15;s:4:\\"3718\\";i:16;s:4:\\"3720\\";i:17;s:3:\\"940\\";i:18;s:3:\\"808\\";i:19;s:4:\\"1056\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20231105", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Guam", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Myrna & Johnny"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna.jpeg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna.jpeg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna.jpeg", "title": "bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna", "altText": "bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna", "caption": "bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/bhutan-nepal-trip-by-myrna.jpeg", "attachmentId": 566}, "variants": {}}	0
