18	Arvin	Australia	2019-04-17	\N	A trip enclosing various lifelong experience!	I am a person that sets a bar high for everything. For a vacation as well it is difficult to please me. But, this tour of the fantastic destinations of Nepal has me on my knees. Never before had I felt about a place like here. I was humbled by the majestic views and magical monuments of Pokhara and Kathmandu.\r\n\r\nI selected Everest vacation randomly and I had a few expectations. But, the tour organized by the team and assistance provided by Umesh was very helpful. Even during the hikes here, I had every help available to make everything smooth. As a solo traveler, I was amazed at the photography skills of my guide too. I recommend Netra and Everest Vacation for a pristine vacation in Nepal.	5.0	2023-12-02 02:29:58+00	2024-03-02 13:57:00+00	{236,132,136,157,158,159,162,164,177}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:9:{i:0;s:3:\\"825\\";i:1;s:3:\\"606\\";i:2;s:3:\\"726\\";i:3;s:4:\\"3536\\";i:4;s:3:\\"696\\";i:5;s:3:\\"510\\";i:6;s:3:\\"551\\";i:7;s:3:\\"619\\";i:8;s:3:\\"743\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20190417", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Australia", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Arvin"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara.jpeg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara.jpeg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara.jpeg", "title": "Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara", "altText": "Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara", "caption": "Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Fewa-Lake-Boating-Pokhara.jpeg", "atta