21	Emily	Philippines	2020-01-01	\N	A truly wonderful service!	I had one of the best helicopter tours ever. It was an adventurous and exciting tour over the Himalayas. Our goal was to fly over to the Everest Base Camp. Landing on the Kalapatthar peak was amazing and the views of Everest were breathtaking from here. Also, the Gokyo lakes and other beautiful peaks were amazing. Everything went exactly according to the plan smoothly. Thank you Mr. Netra a lot for arranging this Everest Heli tour.	5.0	2023-12-17 02:49:56+00	2024-06-04 11:01:30+01	{170}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:1:{i:0;s:3:\\"806\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20200101", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Philippines", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Emily"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/helicopter-tour-ebc.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "helicopter-tour-ebc", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/helicopter-tour-ebc.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/helicopter-tour-ebc.jpg", "title": "helicopter-tour-ebc", "altText": "helicopter-tour-ebc", "caption": "helicopter-tour-ebc", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/helicopter-tour-ebc.jpg", "attachmentId": 4409}, "variants": {}}	0
24	Richard	USA	2016-10-26	\N	Excellent Trip!	My wife, son and I want to thank you for providing us with an excellent trip to Nepal, Bhutan &amp; Tibet. Your company was very organized with all of the necessary plane and hotel reservations made well in advance of our trip. Your company arranged all the necessary Visas and the guides in each country were knowledgeable and helpful. My wife appreciated the guide’s assistance in walking. Thanks again. Sincerely,	5.0	2023-03-02 02:59:30+00	2024-06-04 11:06:05+01	{225,272,207,208,210,211}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:6:{i:0;s:3:\\"925\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3512\\";i:2;s:3:\\"934\\";i:3;s:3:\\"931\\";i:4;s:3:\\"929\\";i:5;s:4:\\"4836\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20161026", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "USA", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Richard"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/everest-heli-flight.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Mr. Everest helicopter flight", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/everest-heli-flight.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/everest-heli-flight.jpg", "title": "everest-heli-flight", "altText": "Mr. Everest helicopter flight", "caption": "Mr. Everest helicopter flight", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/everest-heli-flight.jpg", "attachmentId": 4401}, "variants": {}}	0
15	Mikami Dai	Japan	2018-10-18	\N	Good people and great service at a remarkable price	Well, we a family tour overlapping the Hindu Festival of Dashain last year with Everest Vacation, and it was perfect. Netra helped us to time this tour of Kathmandu, Chitwan, and Pokhara. We enjoyed the festival while exploring different heritage sites of Kathmandu. My kids loved the safari at Chitwan. And, the paragliding at Sarangkot, was something I will remember for a long time to come. For a family tour there comes many things under consideration. Everest Vacation changed a few things for an ideal tour here. Similarly, the price was competitive too. For the service we had, I would be happy to pay even more without any hesitation. With humble people, great hospitality, and reasonable price, I recommend Everest Vacation for a family tour in Nepal.	5.0	2023-11-19 02:25:50+00	2024-06-04 11:00:54+01	{233,234,235,236,162,163,166}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:7:{i:0;s:3:\\"737\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3534\\";i:2;s:3:\\"765\\";i:3;s:4:\\"3532\\";i:4;s:4:\\"3529\\";i:5;s:4:\\"3536\\";i:6;s:3:\\"726\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20181018", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Japan", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Mikami Dai"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/chitwan-with-elephant.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "chitwan-with-elephant", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/chitwan-with-elephant.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/chitwan-with-elephant.jpg", "title": "chitwan-with-elephant", "altText": "chitwan-with-elephant", "caption": "chitwan-with-elephant", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/chitwan-with-elephant.jpg", "attachmentId": 