32	Wang Wang	Texas, USA	2025-09-27	\N	Exceptional Customized Tour Across Chengdu, Tibet, Nepal, and Bhutan	<p data-start="0" data-end="287">I recently worked with Everest Vacation to plan a solo trip across multiple countries, and it was an outstanding experience. Netra (the owner) and his team designed a customized itinerary around my schedule in September and October, covering everything I wanted to see.</p>\r\n<p data-start="289" data-end="572">They flawlessly coordinated flights, hotels, guides, and transportation for my journey through Chengdu (China); Lhasa, Shigatse, and Mt. Everest Base Camp (Tibet); Kathmandu (Nepal); and Thimphu and Paro (Bhutan)—including all necessary permits and travel arrangements.</p>\r\n<p data-start="574" data-end="755">I was able to cross several bucket-list experiences off my list, such as visiting the Potala Palace, seeing Mount Everest, and hiking up to Tiger’s Nest Monastery.</p>\r\n<p data-start="757" data-end="911">Throughout the trip, Netra regularly checked in to ensure everything was going smoothly. The communication and attention to detail were exceptional.</p>\r\n<p data-start="913" data-end="1102">While a tailor-made solo trip isn’t inexpensive, Everest Vacation’s pricing was more competitive than other operators I compared, and the quality of service was never compromised.</p>\r\n<p data-start="1104" data-end="1247" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">I definitely plan to return to Southeast Asia in the future—and I’ll be reaching out to Netra and his team again to organize my next adventure.</p>	5.0	2025-10-27 07:42:32+00	2025-11-24 10:05:48+00	{272,275,277,208}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:4:{i:0;s:4:\\"5267\\";i:1;s:4:\\"4836\\";i:2;s:3:\\"929\\";i:3;s:4:\\"5612\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20250927", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Texas, USA", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "Wang", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Paul"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "tigers nest with guide and driver", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg", "title": "tigers nest with guide and driver", "altText": "tigers nest with guide and driver", "caption": "tigers nest with guide and driver", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/tigers-nest-with-guide-and-driver-scaled-e1761551130993.jpg", "attachmentId": 6151}, "variants": {}}	0
20	Ivanny	Los Angeles, USA	2019-04-17	\N	Amazing Bhutan	Bhutan was on my bucket list for a few years now. And I crossed it after having a sublime tour of Nepal and Bhutan. I have some mad respect for the drivers in these areas with narrow hill highways taking us to our next destination. My guides were friendly as well as knowledgeable in multiple languages too. The tour went straight and by the end, I wanted nothing less than a revisit here. I don’t usually recommend the tour companies but Netra, Umesh, and Team deserve it for a superb tour.	5.0	2023-12-02 02:32:12+00	2024-03-02 13:59:04+00	{216,217,224,225,238,239,240,171,205,206,207,212,213,214,215}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:15:{i:0;s:3:\\"937\\";i:1;s:3:\\"935\\";i:2;s:4:\\"3512\\";i:3;s:3:\\"938\\";i:4;s:4:\\"3510\\";i:5;s:3:\\"925\\";i:6;s:4:\\"3719\\";i:7;s:4:\\"1057\\";i:8;s:3:\\"919\\";i:9;s:3:\\"924\\";i:10;s:4:\\"3718\\";i:11;s:4:\\"3720\\";i:12;s:3:\\"940\\";i:13;s:4:\\"1056\\";i:14;s:3:\\"808\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20190417", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Los Angeles, USA", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Ivanny"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/dochulapass-bhutan.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Dochu La Pass, Bhutan Thimpbu", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/dochulapass-bhutan.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/dochulapass-bhutan.jpg", "title": "dochulapass-bhutan", "altText": "Dochu La Pass, Bhutan Thimpbu", "caption": "Dochu La Pass, Bhutan Thimpbu", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/dochulapass-bhutan.jpg", "attachmentId": 4398}, "variants": {}}	0
26	Steve	California, USA	2015-10-27	\N	It was a great flight	<p dir="ltr"><strong>Hello Namaste,</strong>\r\nEverything went smoothly during our Everest Helicopter flight.  No problem at all with the helicopter service.  It was a great flight.  We are very satisfied customers and will have no reservations about recommending this company to any of our friends who may be considering visiting this beautiful country Nepal.</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Thank you for arranging everything!  Well done all aroun</p>	5.0	2023-01-02 03:02:02+00	2024-06-04 11:05:04+01	{169,170,175}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:3:{i:0;s:3:\\"806\\";i:1;s:3:\\"812\\";i:2;s:3:\\"792\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20151027", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "California, USA", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Steve"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/helicopter-at-pheriche.jpeg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "helicopter-at-pheriche", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/helicopter-at-pheriche.jpeg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/helicopter-at-pheriche.jpeg", "title": "helicopter-at-pheriche", "altText": "helicopter-at-pheriche", "caption": "helicopter-at-pheriche", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/helicopter-at-pheriche.jpeg", "attachmentId": 799}, "variants": {}}	0
28	Franz & Lucila	Switzerland/Philippine	2024-05-05	\N	Super fantastic trip! A lifetime memory!	Our Nepal-Tibet 13-day day tour with 3 days in Kathmandu, one day in Nagarkot, and one day in Dhulikhel were perfectly organized and incredible. Our private tour guides Mr. Dipak in Nepal and Mr. Dopula in Tibet were simply perfect. All arrangements were top notch including all comfortable 5* hotels. In Nepal, we visited all the sites of Durbar Square, Bhaktapur which was wonderful. Afterward, we were transferred by car to the Chinese Border in Gyirung. We stayed overnight in Gyirung, Shegar, Shigatse, Gyantse, and then the last 3 nights in Lhasa. Our Tibet highlights were visits to Rongbuk Monastery, Everest Base Camp, Tashilhunpo Monastery, Potala Palace, Barkhor Street, and Jokhang Temple which were phenomenal.\r\n\r\nWe are extremely happy and satisfied with our guides Mr. Dipak and Mr. Dopula. We are grateful for their patience and the knowledge they shared. Everything was perfectly organized and we were updated before and during the trip with all the details – what a relief for the traveler. A big shout-out to the Tour Operator Mr. Netra and a special thanks to him for the fantastic management of the trip from start to end.\r\n\r\nUndoubtedly it was a super fantastic lifetime memorable trip.	5.0	2024-06-04 10:51:38+01	2024-09-29 11:37:01+01	{272,273,275,208,209,210}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:6:{i:0;s:4:\\"4836\\";i:1;s:4:\\"5246\\";i:2;s:4:\\"5267\\";i:3;s:3:\\"930\\";i:4;s:3:\\"931\\";i:5;s:3:\\"929\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20240505", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Switzerland/Philippine", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Franz & Lucila"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/caption-3.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Tibet Everest base camp, rongbuk monastery", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/caption-3.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/caption-3.jpg", "title": "Tibet Everest base camp, rongbuk monastery", "altText": "Tibet Everest base camp, rongbuk monastery", "caption": "Tibet Everest base camp, rongbuk monastery", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/caption-3.jpg", "attachmentId": 5367}, "variants": {}}	0
31	Pierre	Australia	2025-07-29	\N	Wonderful introductions to Tibet, Nepal, and Bhutan	<p data-start="161" data-end="569">My wife, eldest adult daughter, and I went on a 12-day private tour (including two travel days) covering Chengdu in China (1 night), Lhasa in Tibet (2.5 days), Kathmandu in Nepal (3 days), and Paro and Thimphu in Bhutan (4 days). Everest Vacations arranged everything for us — visas, travel permits, hotels, guides, drivers, airport pick-ups/drop-offs, and the full itinerary. All we had to do was show up.</p>\r\n<p data-start="571" data-end="706">Everything was superb. Netra from Everest Vacations was exceptionally responsive and ensured every part of our journey went smoothly.</p>\r\n<p data-start="708" data-end="1138">I initially shared only a high-level idea of where we wanted to go and our preferred timing, and Netra took care of the rest. The itinerary was flexible — we could do as much or as little as we wanted each day. Along with sightseeing, we had time to relax at our hotels, so it never felt like one of those “7am to 9pm nonstop” tours. The only early start was our departure from Paro, which was simply due to the flight schedule.</p>\r\n<p data-start="1140" data-end="1450">Most days began around 9am after breakfast, followed by a few hours of sightseeing with a mix of tourist highlights and local experiences. We usually stopped for lunch at a local restaurant, continued sightseeing for a few more hours, and returned to the hotel around 5pm — in time to relax and enjoy dinner.</p>\r\n<p data-start="1452" data-end="1715">The pace was entirely ours. Whether it was taking extra time for photos, resting during hikes, or pausing by a river to unwind, the guides and drivers accommodated us with ease. They were all knowledgeable, kind, and helpful, and the cars were very comfortable.</p>\r\n<p data-start="1717" data-end="1962">We chose the 5-star hotel package, which was excellent, with stays at Shangri-La and Marriott hotels. Surprisingly, our favourite hotel was in Paro — Nak-Sel Resort (rated 4*), thanks to its stunning location and views. We highly recommend it.</p>\r\n<p data-start="1964" data-end="2142">Our only suggestion would be to add 1–2 extra days in each location, including Chengdu at the start. But that was limited by our own vacation availability, not the tour itself.</p>\r\n<p data-start="2144" data-end="2217">Overall, it was a wonderful, well-organized, and worry-free experience.</p>	5.0	2025-08-17 08:31:00+01	2025-08-17 08:31:00+01	{283,277}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:2:{i:0;s:4:\\"5612\\";i:1;s:4:\\"5607\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20250729", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Australia", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Pierre"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Pierre-from-Australia-hk-at-Thimphu.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Pierre family from Australia-HK at Thimphu", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Pierre-from-Australia-hk-at-Thimphu.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Pierre-from-Australia-hk-at-Thimphu.jpg", "title": "Pierre from Australia-hk at Thimphu", "altText": "Pierre family from Australia-HK at Thimphu", "caption": "Pierre family from Australia-HK at Thimphu", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Pierre-from-Australia-hk-at-Thimphu.jpg", "attachmentId": 6072}, "variants": {}}	0
7	Pinar & Gursu	Turkey	2019-05-17	\N	Great experience in Kathmandu valley with Everest flight	<p class="partial_entry"><strong><span class="fullText ">We spent 2 great days in Kathmandu, Nepal.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class="partial_entry"><span class="fullText ">Tour operator, Everest Vacation (Netra gave fast responses to our emails) created a unique and tailor-made program for us including Everest flight. As our research and suggestion of Netra, we visited all “must see” places (UNESCO World Heritage Sites in Kathmandu Valley) as well as <strong>Kapan </strong><b>Monastery</b>. They arranged Everest flight for us to on 2nd day early morning. <strong>Everest flight was amazing</strong> (even 1 hour, unbelievable experience. During the <strong>2 days private tour</strong>, the driver and guide were excellent and always on time. The guide also joined us during Thamel bazaar walk.</span></p>\r\n<p class="partial_entry"><span class="fullText ">Thanks to Everest Vacation for 2 days arrangements in Kathmandu and recommend everyone.</span></p>	5.0	2023-11-30 09:19:09+00	2024-03-02 13:52:42+00	{132}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:1:{i:0;s:3:\\"510\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20190517", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Turkey", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Pinar & Gursu"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people.jpg", "title": "2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people", "altText": "2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people", "caption": "2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2-days-kathmandu-tour-by-turkey-people.jpg", "attachmentId": 525}, "variants": {}}	0
17	Emerio	United States of America	2019-09-12	\N	Best Travel Company: showing how it is done	We booked a 6-day tour in two beautiful cities of Nepal. Kathmandu and Pokhara were both suggestions from our dear friend who was here last summer. Our second time enjoying a trip conducted by Everest Vacation, and we knew they will do a great job. The experience turned out to be better with an unexpected stop to Bandipur courtesy of Netra and Umesh. The paragliding from Sarangkot perfectly completed our tour and we were a happy couple after this holiday. I have a few plans in my bag for my next visit to Nepal and there are few companies to do it with then Everest Vacation.	5.0	2023-12-02 02:28:52+00	2024-03-02 13:57:50+00	{234,235,236,136,164,166}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:6:{i:0;s:4:\\"3536\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3534\\";i:2;s:4:\\"3532\\";i:3;s:3:\\"765\\";i:4;s:3:\\"551\\";i:5;s:3:\\"743\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20190912", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "United States of America", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Emerio"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pokhara-phewa-lake.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Boating at Phewa Lake at Pokhara", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pokhara-phewa-lake.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pokhara-phewa-lake.jpg", "title": "pokhara-phewa-lake", "altText": "Boating at Phewa Lake at Pokhara", "caption": "Boating at Phewa Lake at Pokhara", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pokhara-phewa-lake.jpg", "attachmentId": 4282}, "variants": {}}	0
12	Trinidad	Philippines	2023-03-16	\N	Highly recommend Everest Vacation for Nepal and Bhutan Tour	Our visit to Nepal was an awesome experience, made even better by our travel agent who arranged guided sightseeing tours for us. Our trip was organized by Everest Vacation for both Nepal and Bhutan, and everything went smoothly. We had fantastic private guided sightseeing tours in Kathmandu and an amazing hike to Nagarkot. Our tour guide, Dipak, was extremely helpful and knowledgeable. I highly recommend Everest Vacation to anyone looking for a great travel experience in Nepal and Bhutan.	5.0	2023-12-22 02:04:46+00	2025-05-24 07:56:08+01	{216,225,239,240,273,156,163,171,206,210,212,213}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:12:{i:0;s:3:\\"737\\";i:1;s:3:\\"601\\";i:2;s:4:\\"3719\\";i:3;s:4:\\"3720\\";i:4;s:3:\\"924\\";i:5;s:4:\\"1056\\";i:6;s:3:\\"808\\";i:7;s:3:\\"937\\";i:8;s:4:\\"3512\\";i:9;s:3:\\"935\\";i:10;s:3:\\"931\\";i:11;s:4:\\"5246\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20230316", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Philippines", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Trinidad"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Philippines-Trinidad.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Philippines travelers - Trinidad", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Philippines-Trinidad.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Philippines-Trinidad.jpg", "title": "Philippines-Trinidad", "altText": "Philippines travelers - Trinidad", "caption": "Philippines travelers - Trinidad", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Philippines-Trinidad.jpg", "attachmentId": 571}, "variants": {}}	0
19	Eric	USA	2018-11-23	\N	Unique Destinations	I was just a backpacker wandering on my own while traveling throughout the world. However, this tour of Nepal made me realize the importance of a good guide, especially in a new country. Some of the places I went would never have been on my radar if I was alone. Similarly, the local suggestions in anything from food to shopping areas were just worth it.\r\n\r\nI had a well-rounded tour of Kathmandu Bhaktapur and Lalitpur in Nepal. But the highlight for me, if asked, will be the Everest Heli tour. As not a trekking person this was perfect for me to be closer to the Himalayas and Everest itself. I always feel that the passion to do something makes the experience more valuable. My guides here in Nepal as well as the tour operators of Everest Vacation proved it to me. The patience they showed and the urge to give every traveler more is what makes this company different and I highly recommend it.	5.0	2023-11-17 02:31:23+00	2024-06-04 11:03:37+01	{132,156,157,158,170,175,177}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:7:{i:0;s:3:\\"812\\";i:1;s:3:\\"806\\";i:2;s:3:\\"510\\";i:3;s:3:\\"601\\";i:4;s:3:\\"606\\";i:5;s:3:\\"825\\";i:6;s:3:\\"619\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20181123", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "USA", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Eric"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219-1.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219-1.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219-1.jpg", "title": "everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219", "altText": "everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219", "caption": "everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-helicopter-ride-kalapatthar-500x219-1.jpg", "attachmentId": 582}, "variants": {}}	0
29	MACIAS TIMOTINO MACIAS TIMOTINO	Mexico	2024-09-15	\N	Highly recommend Everest Vacation - Wonderful Trip	Heartiest thanks to Mr. Netra of Everest Vacation who fantastically arranged our trip to Nepal and Tibet. His availability, guidance, suggestions, and itinerary flexibility along with the finest accommodations and services for our trips were impressive.\r\n\r\nWe explore Kathmandu and Pokhara with our knowledgeable guide Dipak, and skilled driver Kishor in Nepal. Pokhara’s beauty captivated us and the amazing views of the Annapurna Mountains from the hotel fell us in love with Pokhara.\r\n\r\nOur guide Chiongke accompanied us to visit the iconic Potala Palace and significant old monasteries in Tibet.\r\n\r\nWe felt welcomed and truly fortunate to have this wonderful trip where we learned a lot about the cultures of both countries. The locals always greeted us with smiles and enjoyed their warmth and friendliness.\r\n\r\nIf you are planning to visit Nepal and Tibet, I highly recommend Everest Vacation.	1.0	2024-09-29 11:24:19+01	2024-11-13 11:40:49+00	{274,275,283,209,210,211}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:6:{i:0;s:4:\\"5267\\";i:1;s:3:\\"930\\";i:2;s:3:\\"931\\";i:3;s:3:\\"934\\";i:4;s:4:\\"5607\\";i:5;s:4:\\"5263\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20240915", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Mexico", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "1", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "MACIAS TIMOTINO", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "AMELIA HELOISA "}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/image2-e1727605508489.jpeg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "at Potala Palace, Lhasa Tibet", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/image2-e1727605508489.jpeg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/image2-e1727605508489.jpeg", "title": "at Potala Palace, Lhasa Tibet", "altText": "at Potala Palace, Lhasa Tibet", "caption": "at Potala Palace, Lhasa Tibet", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/image2-e1727605508489.jpeg", "attachmentId": 5666}, "variants": {}}	0
16	Mexico	Diaz Vergara	2019-10-23	\N	Wonderful Time in Nepal	My first time in Nepal and I was amazed to see the raw beauty of this country with Everest Vacation. They planned a fantastic tour for me. Even for a solo traveler, they arranged a local guide and a private vehicle which was impressive. My favorite moment was the hike to Chisapani from Sundarijal and the sunrise view from Nagarkot. The local food as suggested by Umesh was good and I will recommend you to try it as well. I will be coming again and this time I will visit Tibet and Bhutan too with Everest Vacation. I rate this company very highly and would recommend it for solo travelers like me.	5.0	2023-12-02 02:27:30+00	2024-03-02 13:55:41+00	{156,163,168,180,186,199}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:6:{i:0;s:3:\\"880\\";i:1;s:3:\\"906\\";i:2;s:3:\\"737\\";i:3;s:3:\\"791\\";i:4;s:3:\\"861\\";i:5;s:3:\\"601\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20191023", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Diaz Vergara", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Mexico"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/dhampus-kande-trek.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "dhampus-kande-trek", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/dhampus-kande-trek.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/dhampus-kande-trek.jpg", "title": "dhampus-kande-trek", "altText": "dhampus-kande-trek", "caption": "dhampus-kande-trek", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/dhampus-kande-trek.jpg", "attachmentId": 4827}, "variants": {}}	0
13	Danny Carpio	Philippines	2022-12-27	\N	Impressive Cultural & Scenic Beauty	I must admit Nepal is culturally blessed. The scenic natural beauty of Nepal impressed me. The adventurous activities that I took on my cultural scenic tour were dreamlike. The Elephant ride in Chitwan was fun. The Sunrise view and Boating on Phewa Lake were blissful. The spiritual and peaceful feeling in Lumbini was enigmatic. The temples, decorative palaces, and artistic works in Kathmandu, Patan, and Bhaktapur Durbar Squares were marvelous. Swayambhunath, Bouddhanath, and Pashupatinath were distinct but wonderful to visit. I am grateful to Umesh and the team of Everest Vacation for smoothly arranging this tour. Strongly commended.	1.0	2023-12-19 02:22:32+00	2024-06-04 11:00:28+01	{233,234,235,236,136,163,166}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:7:{i:0;s:3:\\"737\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3534\\";i:2;s:3:\\"765\\";i:3;s:4:\\"3536\\";i:4;s:4:\\"3529\\";i:5;s:3:\\"551\\";i:6;s:4:\\"3532\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20221227", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Philippines", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "1", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Danny Carpio"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/danny-carpio.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "danny carpio", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/danny-carpio.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/danny-carpio.jpg", "title": "danny carpio", "altText": "danny carpio", "caption": "danny carpio", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/danny-carpio.jpg", "attachmentId": 573}, "variants": {}}	0
30	Nishith & Archana	UK & Kenya	2024-09-17	\N	Wonderful & Memorable Nepal Bhutan trip	Our Nepal and Bhutan trip planned by Everest Vacation went flawlessly. The guides were simply incredible. Netra, the company owner managed everything smoothly. On our Kathmandu to Paro flight, he managed to secure a proper window seat which allowed us to get some amazing mountain views. In Pokhara, we stayed at the Fishtail Lodge. We received some negative comments from our friends about the lodge. But, we must admit what a beautiful hotel it was, and happy with it. Our trip was wonderful and very memorable.\r\n\r\nThank you, Netra. I would certainly use Everest Vacations again.	5.0	2024-11-13 11:33:12+00	2025-05-24 07:55:33+01	{216,217,225,239,275,283,171,213,215}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:9:{i:0;s:3:\\"940\\";i:1;s:3:\\"937\\";i:2;s:3:\\"808\\";i:3;s:4:\\"3719\\";i:4;s:4:\\"5267\\";i:5;s:4:\\"3512\\";i:6;s:4:\\"1057\\";i:7;s:4:\\"1056\\";i:8;s:4:\\"5607\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20240917", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "UK & Kenya ", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Nishith & Archana"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya.jpg", "title": "nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya", "altText": "nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya", "caption": "nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/nishith-archana-from-uk-kenya.jpg", "attachmentId": 5721}, "variants": {}}	0
25	Paul & Angela	United Kingdom	2016-10-13	\N	4 Day Kathmandu Valley plus Mt Everest flight	The trip has been excellent. Angela and I were just discussing it. We have agreed that this has been the best trip we have done and we have done lots of trips, all over the world. Our guide has been an excellent. His English is fluent and his knowledge exemplary. We have learnt so much about Nepal. The planning and pace of the trip were just right for us. We saw everything and more that we wanted to see. The driver was also first rate. Our trips were always smooth and safe. The Hotel Shanker had wonderful charm and the staff were always pleasant, attentive and helpful. The Everst flight was stunning. We are very satisfied customers and will have no reservations recommending your company to any of our friends who may be considering visiting your beautiful country.	5.0	2023-08-02 04:00:45+01	2024-06-04 11:04:44+01	{132,135,156,159,163,177}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:6:{i:0;s:3:\\"825\\";i:1;s:3:\\"510\\";i:2;s:3:\\"696\\";i:3;s:3:\\"601\\";i:4;s:3:\\"737\\";i:5;s:3:\\"538\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20161013", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "United Kingdom", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Paul & Angela"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/boudhanath-stupa-1.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Boudha Stupa, Kathmandu", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/boudhanath-stupa-1.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/boudhanath-stupa-1.jpg", "title": "Boudha Stupa, Kathmandu", "altText": "Boudha Stupa, Kathmandu", "caption": "Boudha Stupa, Kathmandu", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/boudhanath-stupa-1.jpg", "attachmentId": 529}, "variants": {}}	0
27	Eric	United States of America	2015-04-22	\N	Surpassed our expectations!	<p dir="ltr"><strong>Thank you for everything.  </strong></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">The experience surpassed our expectations!  The staff, helicopters, and mountains were all incredible.  We really enjoyed the stop at Everest View Hotel too.</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Thank you again!\r\nNamaste</p>	5.0	2023-01-02 03:04:30+00	2024-06-04 11:05:17+01	{226,132,157,169,170,175,176,177}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:8:{i:0;s:3:\\"812\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3513\\";i:2;s:3:\\"806\\";i:3;s:3:\\"818\\";i:4;s:3:\\"792\\";i:5;s:3:\\"510\\";i:6;s:3:\\"606\\";i:7;s:3:\\"825\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20150422", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "United States of America", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Eric"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-heclicopter-review-eric.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "everest-heclicopter-reviewed by eric", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-heclicopter-review-eric.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-heclicopter-review-eric.jpg", "title": "everest-heclicopter-review-eric", "altText": "everest-heclicopter-reviewed by eric", "caption": "everest-heclicopter-reviewed by eric", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/everest-heclicopter-review-eric.jpg", "attachmentId": 599}, "variants": {}}	0
33	Marvin and Yves	Belgium	2025-10-25	\N	Incredible 21-Day Private Tour of Nepal, Tibet & Bhutan – Truly Unforgettable!	We embarked on an amazing 21-day private tour from 23/10 to 14/11 with Netra from Everest Vacation. In the beginning, we were a little unsure since WhatsApp was the only mode of our communication from across the world. However, because of Netra’s professionalism, incredibly fast responses (almost 24/7!) and expertise, we were immediately at ease. He took care of literally everything – logistics, hotels, visas, permits, entrances, and internal flights – allowing us to enjoy a stress-free journey.\r\n\r\nOur fully customized private tour of Nepal, Tibet and Bhutan exceeded all expectations. Some of the highlights included a short hike around Rongbuk Monastery near Tibet Everest Base Camp, the Potala Palace in Lhasa, Chitwan National Park, flights offering breathtaking Himalayan and Everest views, Bhutan’s Tiger’s Nest hike and Punakha and Thimpu,\r\n\r\nEven though Travelling to Tibet with fewer than five people is usually not possible, Netra made it happen for us, allowing us to experience a private journey without having to share guides or transportation with strangers.\r\n\r\nEach guide we had were outstanding – Rajan in Nepal, Nyima in Tibet and Sita in Bhutan. They were incredibly knowledgeable and friendly. Rajan, especially went above and beyond, customizing the trip to our interests and even showing us hidden roof terraces in Kathmandu that we never would have discovered on our own. We were assigned safe, punctual drivers who drove modern, clean vehicles. Accommodations were excellent, with Shangri-La in Lhasa and Hilton Shigatse ranking among the best ones we’ve ever experienced.\r\n\r\nThe knowledge and network of Netra are truly exceptional. He is familiar with all the guides, contacts, and operators, which guaranteed the top-quality service throughout our journey. The pricing of this high-end, fully customized trip, was far more reasonable than what a European operator would have charged for the same itinerary.\r\n\r\nFor anyone seeking a once-in-a-lifetime adventure, reach out to Netra on WhatsApp: +977 985-1053024. We 100% recommend him – he made our trip effortless, personalized, and absolutely unforgettable!	5.0	2025-12-10 10:12:58+00	2025-12-12 06:33:41+00	{275,277}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:2:{i:0;s:4:\\"5612\\";i:1;s:4:\\"5267\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20251025", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Belgium", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Marvin and Yves"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "Mr. Marvin and Yves Infront of Tiger's Nest Monastery, Bhutan", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg", "title": "Mr. Marvin and Yves infront of Tiger's Nest Monastery, Bhutan", "altText": "Mr. Marvin and Yves Infront of Tiger's Nest Monastery, Bhutan", "caption": "Mr. Marvin and Yves Infront of Tiger's Nest Monastery, Bhutan", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mr.-Marvin-and-Yves-infront-of-Tigers-Nest-Monastery-Bhutan-e1765521213102.jpg", "attachmentId": 6211}, "variants": {}}	0
14	Mary	Vietnam	2022-04-15	\N	A day hike in Kathmandu- Loved it	I just wanted a refreshment from my hectic schedule and had a day off. My friend helped me book a day hike in Kathmandu. He booked with Everest Vacation and a guide picked me up from my hotel. Dipak was my guide and he was polite and had a good sense of humor. I enjoyed his company and reached Nagarkot for sunrise. I must admit I forgot my stress at once when I observed the sunrise over snow-capped mountains. The green natural views and natural beauty around there attracted me. I felt rejuvenated. We had breakfast and started hiking towards ancient Newari village Changu Narayan. The village was peaceful and very beautiful. One of the oldest temples is listed on the World Heritage site. The history of the place was interesting to hear from my guide. A day hike was incredible. A great thanks to Dipak for making it enjoyable. I loved it.	1.0	2023-12-18 02:24:12+00	2024-06-04 10:59:48+01	{156,159,168,179,180}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:5:{i:0;s:3:\\"696\\";i:1;s:3:\\"601\\";i:2;s:3:\\"861\\";i:3;s:3:\\"840\\";i:4;s:3:\\"791\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20220415", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Vietnam", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "1", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Mary"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mary.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "mary", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mary.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mary.jpg", "title": "mary", "altText": "mary", "caption": "mary", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mary.jpg", "attachmentId": 575}, "variants": {}}	0
22	Masako	Japan	2018-09-20	\N	An unbelievable experience!	Our fantastic tour of the Himalayas including Bhutan,  and Nepal was organized seamlessly by Everest Vacation. Netra formulated this two-week trip in the best way with some outstanding memories. I am impressed with the quick and dedicated customer care, as our emails were responded to almost instantly. Between all these, we also managed to take a helicopter to Everest Base Camp. It was a childhood dream of mine, and being there was nothing short of spectacular. Thanks to Netra and the team for suggesting it on time.	5.0	2023-10-02 03:56:46+01	2024-06-04 11:04:12+01	{224,170,212,213}	{"acf": {"rh_review_packages": "a:4:{i:0;s:3:\\"806\\";i:1;s:4:\\"3510\\";i:2;s:3:\\"937\\";i:3;s:3:\\"935\\";}", "rh_review_travelyear": "20180920", "rh_review_email_address": "", "rh_review_traveler_city": "", "rh_reviw_traveler_country": "Japan", "rh_reviewer_traveler_rating": "5", "rh_review_traveler_last_name": "", "rh_review_traveler_first_name": "Masako"}, "url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-view-from-pokhara-scaled.jpg", "source": "wordpress", "altText": "mountain view from sarangkot, pokhara", "gallery": ["https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-view-from-pokhara-scaled.jpg"], "featured": {"url": "https://everestnepaltours.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-view-from-pokhara-scaled.jpg", "title": "mountain-view-from-pokhara", "altText": "mountain view from sarangkot, pokhara", "caption": "mountain view from sarangkot, pokhara", "variants": {}, "localPath": "/Users/pasangrumba/Documents/Work/JavaScript_Projects/everestnepaltours_wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/mountain-view-from-pokhara-scaled.jpg", "attachmentId": 730}, "variants": {}}	0
