84c1f4eb-05cf-4762-8fe4-b38cb3faaacf	easy-hiking	{"title": "Easy Hiking (01-03 Days)", "subtitle": "", "description": "<!-- wp:acf/starter-kit-half-content-half-image {\\"name\\":\\"acf/starter-kit-half-content-half-image\\",\\"data\\":{\\"starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"1\\",\\"_starter_kit_enable_section\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2579c\\",\\"starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"bg-white\\",\\"_starter_kit_section_bg\\":\\"field_63f85ccfbbd7f\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_image_position\\":\\"left\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_image_position\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2581e\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_search_section\\":\\"no\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_search_section\\":\\"field_65718c92967af\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_image\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_image\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2ee12\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_title\\":\\"Easy Hiking (01-03 Days)\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_title\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2585d\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_sub_title\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_sub_title\\":\\"field_63b6eb486b39a\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_description\\":\\"Everest Vacation proposes easy hiking for 1-3 days in the vicinity of beautiful Kathmandu Valley, Annapurna, and Langtang region. These hiking tours are mostly below the elevation of 2,500 m. Hence, it is suitable for all age-group people with good physical fitness as well as limited time.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nEasy Hiking treats travelers with the phenomenal scenic natural beauty of snowy mountains, landscapes, terrains, and authentic village settlements along with their local culture. Despite the low elevation, it provides spectacular sceneries without compromising. This is the beauty of Nepal, for observing mountains, trekking at high elevations is not required. The incredible sunrise views over majestic mountains, beautiful villages, rough trails, and the authenticity of the destinations undoubtedly impress travelers.\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_description\\":\\"field_5f34d6be2ee97\\",\\"starter_kit_hchi_link\\":\\"\\",\\"_starter_kit_hchi_link\\":\\"field_5f34d7a643459\\",\\"s